\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Im 15. Jh. nachgetragenes kurzes {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\b\fs24\chcbpat18 Officium in pascha}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Cum rex glorie Christus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  infernum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 debellaturus intraret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Chev.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  4103. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ps. Beatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps. 1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps. 2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Domine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps. 3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps. 4\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ). Christus resurgens ex mortuis iam non moritur \u8230 \'85 Kyrie. Paternoster. >V< Surrexit deus de sepulcro. Domine exaudi. Oremus: Deus qui hodierna die per unigenitum tuum \u8230 \'85 ordinando prosequere. Per eudem Christum dominum. }

