\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 In purificatione Marie< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Cum inducerent puerum Jhesum parentes eius etc. (Lc 2,27). Hic nota quatuor}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  quid puer Jhesus, quid templum, quid Maria, quid Joseph et Symeon significent \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 ut requiescant a laboribus suis. Quod ipse prestare dignetur qui uiuit et regnat etc.
