\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Es folgen weitere Expositiones zur Fasten- und Osterzeit (Seitentitel 7\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\fs24 / 8\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\fs24 : >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Expositio epistole\plain \f1\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 in prima dom. XL\plain \f2\i\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\fs24 < und (9\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 De resurrectione\plain \f1\fs24 <).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Letzte Homilie (20\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\fs24 -22\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\fs24 )  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [D]omini nostri Jhesu Christi resurrectio et festiuitas}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  hominum fuit et festiuitas angelorum. Festiuitas hominum fuit quia resurgendo a mortuis ad immortalitatem nos perduxit \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 non trepidantes ultro pergamus ad passionem ut uideant confidenciam uestram.
