\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (30\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\fs24  unten) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Epistole Jacobi canonice et  Johannis\plain \f1\fs24 .- (31\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\fs24 -42\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\fs24 )  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Jacobus filius Alphei hic dictus frater domini}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 . Jacobus subplantator uiciarum uel ludator interpredatur\plain \f1\fs24  (Oberer Seitenrand). [1,1] \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Jacobus dei et domini nostri Jhesu Christi seruus confirmans nomine et uita\plain \f1\fs24  (\~?) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 de omnibus\plain \f1\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 XII patriarchis uel perfectis qui\plain \f1\fs24  [et] \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 legis precepta implent fidem et constantiam in dilectione\plain \f1\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 dei et proximi\plain \f1\fs24 . [1,2] \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Omne gaudium. Ne indignemini si mali florent in hoc mundo\plain \f1\fs24  \u8230 \'85 [1,3] \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Scientes quod tribulatio patientiam operatur, patientia uero probationem\plain \f1\fs24  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 [5,20] \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 et  operiet multitudinem peccatorum i. e. ab aspectu interni iudicis \u8230 \'85 et qui uere errantem corrigit per hoc ampliora gaudia celestis uite sibi conquirit.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 (42\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\fs24 -56\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\fs24 )  >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Epistola\plain \f1\fs24  [I] \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Johannis<\plain \f1\fs24  Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Scripserat Johannes ewangelista aduersus dogmata}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  hereticorum qui de uerbis eternitatis male senserant \u8230 \'85In principio epistole ad commendationem\plain \f1\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 sermonis diuinitatem et humanitatem Christi designat\plain \f1\fs24  \u8230 \'85\~; (43\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\fs24 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Epistola Johannis\plain \f1\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Quod fuit ab initio quod uidimus et audiuimus oculis nostris (1,1) fuit ab initio filius dei}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 . In\plain \f1\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 principio erat uerbum\plain \f1\fs24  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 (5,20) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic est uerus deus et uita eterna in resurrectione uestra\plain \f1\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (5,21) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Filioli qui uerum deum cognoscitis \u8230 \'85 custodite uos a doctrinis\plain \f1\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 hereticorum \u8230 \'85 ne aliquis nuper conuersus reliquias superstitionis mente retinuerit\plain \f1\fs24 .- Am oberen Seitenrand: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 >Expliciunt epistole canonice s. Jacobi cum ceteris<.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs20 Vgl\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs20 . \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Steg\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs20 m\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f2\lang1033\fs20 , RB 811 und 10667.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 \par}

