\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In aduentu<  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Erunt signa in sole et luna et stellis etc. (Lc 21,25). In hoc evangelio principaliter}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  agitur de aduentu domini \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 et inter electos feliciter collocari quod ipse prestare dignetur qui uiuit etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\fs24 (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In die cinerum< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Cum ieiunatis nolite fieri sicut ypocrite tristes (Mt 6,16). In capite ieiunii}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hoc evangelium merito legitur quia quale dabet esse ieiunium in hac lectione uerbo\plain \f2\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 declaratur \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 ut corpora cum animabus perpetuam habeant mansionem. Quod ipse prestare\plain \f2\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dignetur et cetera\plain \f2\fs24 . Etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\fs24 )  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica\plain \f2\fs24 < (Am Rand) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Simile est regnum celorum homini regi qui uoluit racionem ponere cum seruis suis etc. (Mt 18,23). Rex iste est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui potenter sapienter et benigne cuncta gubernat \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 et peccatum eorum aggrauatum est nimis.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\fs24 
