\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Sulpicius Severus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Vita S. Martini}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer, au\u223 \'dfer Titel (Unziale): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit epistola Severi ad Desiderium de vita sancti ac beatissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Martini archiepiscopi. Severus Desiderio patri karissimo salvtem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prefatio< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Ego quidem frater unanimis libellum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quem de uita sancti Martini scripseram scaeda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sua premere \u8230 \'85 non loquatur auctorem. Explicit epistola\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prologus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Plerique mortalium studio et gloriae seculari inaniter dediti \u8230 \'85 Explicit prologus. -\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt capitula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 libri primi. De sancta conuersatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt capitula de vita sancti Martini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vita sancti Martini episcopi. Incipit vita sancti ac beatissimi Martini archiepiscopi Turonensis< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Igitur Martinus Sabariae Pannoniarum oppido}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  oriundus fuit \u8230 \'85 sed quicumque crediderit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit liber primus de vita sancti Martini episcopi et confessoris. Incipit epistola Severi ad Eusebium prespiterum postea episcopum< Hesterna die cum ad me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 plerique monachi uenissent \u8230 \'85 sed uere probatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Epistola secunda ad Aurelium diaconum. (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  Epistola ad Bassulam. (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt capitula libri secundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber secundus [Dialogus primus]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum in unum locum ego et Gallus noster conuenissemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quae uidi ipse dicturus sum. >Explicit liber secundus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt capitula dialogi Severi<.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Titelseite: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber tertius. Quo primo igitur tempore relictis scholis beato me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 viro iunxi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 paucos post dies \u8230 \'85 accepta hac Galli sponsione surreximus. Explicit liber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tertius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Capitulatio. Dialogus II (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lucescit o Galle surgendum est \u8230 \'85 ex nostris fletibus dolore discessum est.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: CSEL 1, S. 109-216. \endash  A. A. R. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bastiaensen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / J. W. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Smit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , La vita Martini di Sulpicio Servero, in: Vite dei Santi IV. Mailand 1975, S. 1-67 (zitiert die Hs. S. 2). \endash  Vgl. H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Delehaye\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Saint Martin et Sulpice S\u233 \'e9v\u232 \'e8re, in: Analecta Bollandiana 38 (1920) S. 1-136, hier: S. 10 f. \endash  A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u228 \'e4\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 se\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Fortunatus \endash  ein Unbekannter in der Ulrichsvita Gerhards von Augsburg, in: Zeitschrift des Historischen Vereins f\u252 \'fcr Schwaben 88 (1995) S. 21-55, hier: S. 33 Anm. 49.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  unten)  Anmerkungen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod si quis requirit cur post transitum Gatiani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 episcopi unus tantum idest Liborius usque ad sanctum Martinum fuisset nouerit \u8230 \'85 A passione ergo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 domini usque ad transitum sancti Martini anni quadringenti XII computentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Gregorius Turonensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Narrationes de transitu s. Martini}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Item versiculus de transitu sancti Martini episcopi< Beatus autem Seuerinus Coloniensis ciuitatis episcopus uir honeste uite \u8230 \'85 audiuit chorum canentium in sublimis \u8230 \'85 Sed etsi Seueri recurramus historiam ipsa hora cum sibi scripsit cum libro uite suawe fuisse reuelatum.- \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 BHL 5620-22.-\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Item alius sancti Ambrosii cuius hodie flores eloquii per totam ecclesiam redolent \u8230 \'85 paradisus retinet laetum cum sanctis.}

