\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Caesarius Arelatensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Collectio quinquaginta homiliarum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt capitula sermonum ex libris sancti Augustini episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < Z\u228 \'e4hlt 50 Sermones, in dieser Hs. Augustinus zugeschrieben, mit ihrem jeweiligen Thema auf. (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In letania maiore< Per omnes sanctas scripturas fratres dilectissimi saluberrima ammonicione crebrius exortamur \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 et quorum tecta sunt peccata.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Per Jhesum Christum dominum nostrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Text gedruckt nicht nachweisbar.- (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit tractatus sancti Augustini episcopi de eo quod scriptum est: Quis est homo qui wlt vitam et cupit videre dies bonos.I< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Vocans humanum genus spiritus dei iubendo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quid facere et promittendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pacem sine dissensione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . PL 38, 121. Es folgen die Sermones, zitiert nach Migne: (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) PL 39, 1845\~; (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 33, 611 /12\~; (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 39, 1697\~; (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 39, 2250\~; (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 39, 2247\~; (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 47, 1173\~; (69r) 38, 909\~; (71r) 38, 244\~; (73v) 39, 2212\~; (75v) 38, 241\~; (77v) 39, 2287\~; (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 38, 1463\~; (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 39, 1949\~; (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain 