\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Prologus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Sicut omnis materies si ab inperito artifice}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  constructa fuerit \u8230 \'85 Quod ego Johannes indignus diaconus seruus sancti Januarii multum de uita eius tibi me sepius roganti frater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Athanasi \u8230 \'85 et ab inimicis tutos forte letemur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text\~: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Nicholaus itaque ex illustri prosapia ortus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 habitatore. De qua quia sc. occasio prebuit \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quatinus Jhesu Christo domino nostro seruire in perpetuum mereamur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui cum patre et spiritu sancto uiuit \u8230 \'85 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  BHL 6104-6108 (endet wie BHL 6118).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  Zweite Version der Vita S. Nicolai: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nicholaus itaque ex illustri prosapia ortus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85habitatore. Qua urbe adhuc multa plebium generositate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 absque ambiguitate salutem corporum operatur. Prestante domino nostro Jhesu Christo qui cum patre \u8230 \'85 Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Beide Versionen nicht identisch mit  B. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mombritius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sanctuarium seu Vitae sanctorum. T. 1. 2. Paris 1910, S. 296-309, oder einer der bei BHL angef\u252 \'fchrten \u220 \'dcberlieferungen.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

