\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quomodo aureus numerus habeat reuouari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\~?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et quomodo debeat formari< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Aureus in Jano numerus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  clauosque nouantur \u8230 \'85 prima dies ianique ianua dicitur anni/ ternarium retinet ne posterius ordo uacillet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (\~?) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia Nr. 1833. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Quomodo scitur quotus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sit aureus numerus quolibet anno<\u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iste versus valet ad diuisionem annorum domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 per XIX\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?)< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Penta bissenos sex tres coniungimus unum \u8230 \'85 >Sequitur de nominibus XII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mensium et de officiis eorum< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Bis senos menses tenet annus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia Nr. 2191. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur quod dies determinatos quilibet mensis habeat< Prima dies mensis a kalo dicta kalende \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia Nr. 14562. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Sequitur quomodo dies et ebdomada notantur per VII Litteras alphabeti< Littera septenas ferias septena figurat \u8230 \'85Illa mutari iubet introitus nouus anni \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  Fl\u252 \'fcchtig aufgezeichnete Kalendermerks\u228 \'e4tze: [I]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ntonans dominus diuina gerens bonus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 extat / Omnibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et ex summa quotiens potes eice septem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ceffalus illius habet \u8230 \'85 Est auis taurus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 gemini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia 5599. Etc. Meist fehlen die Anfangsbuchstaben. 
