\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 professionis uoto viuimus uniformes in obseruanciis canonice religionis inueniamur \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~; (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Capitulatio; (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Distinctio prima. De officio ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cap. Primum< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Avdito primo signo surgant}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secunda distinctio de domibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 concedendis et constituendis cap< Nulla domus concedatur nisi a priore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Gegen\u252 \'fcber der Redaktion Raimunds von Penafort um 3 Kapitel erweitert\~: (42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De certis detractionibus singularitatibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et impressionibus vitandum. Cap. 16\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~; (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De capitulo biennali uel triennali cap\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 14\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\~; (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De constitutionibus Bonifacii pape noni. Cap. 18\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 < Denuntiamus feliciter memorie Bonifatium papam nonum anno domini 1427\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sit habenda que quo ad hoc ipsis in nullo uolumus suffragari. Per fratrem Con. de E. 
