\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Regula de paenitentia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Bu\u223 \'dfordnung)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit regula de penitencia fratrum et sororum beati Dominici< Innocencius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [VIII.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 episcopus seruus seruorum dei \u8230 \'85 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Sedis apostolice prouidentia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 ; (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit regula fratrum et sororum \u8230 \'85De recipiendis et eorum condicione primum capitulum< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 In primis ut hic ordo continuum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et perpetuum de bono in melius recipere valeat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Endet (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De obligacione huius regule et viuendi formule ultimum capitulum< Demum quemadmodum in constitutionibus fratrum ordinis predicatorum continetur \u8230 \'85 se nouiter incursurum. Datum Rome apud\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sanctum Petrum sexto kal. Julii pontificatus nostri anno primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [1485]. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit feliciter anno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 domini 1497 per fratrem Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hannem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 E\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [rck].
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

