\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Kapitelsbeschl\u252 \'fcsse und Privilegien}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Prouincialis nouiter institutus curet impetrare confimationem suorum predecessorum que habita hic et similia habebunt vigorem< In dei filio sibi carissimis vniuersis et singulis presidentibus magistris patribus et fratribus \u8230 \'85 fr. Leonardus de Mansuetis de Perusio \u8230 \'85 salutem \u8230 \'85 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Quia prouincia Theutonie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  presertim quoad conuentus reformatos tam fratrum quam sororum dicte prouincie \u8230 \'85 In quorum omnium fidem et testimonium sigillum officiale etc. Datum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rome \u8230 \'85 anno dominice incarnacionis 1479\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bulle copia que habetur sub plumbo extendens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [se ad] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 conseruatores conuentuum prouincie nostre ad sorores etc. de penitencia< Allexander\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [VI.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 episcopus \u8230 \'85 dilectis in Christo filiabus vniuersis monialibus ordinis sancti Augustini sub cura fratrum predicatorum ac de tercio ordine sancti Dominici de penitencia nuncupatis sororibus \u8230 \'85 Sacre religionis \u8230 \'85 apostolorum eius se nouiter incursurum. Datum Rome \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 anno M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nonagesimo quinto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Am Rande vermerkt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Originalis bulla habetur in armario\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 prouinciali in conuentu Franckfordensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Solche Vermerke zur Vorlage der Urkundenabschrift finden sich h\u228 \'e4ufiger in dieser Hs. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sixtus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [IV]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Seruus seruorum dei \u8230 \'85 Sacrosancta Romana ecclesia \u8230 \'85 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Indignationem omnipotentis dei}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ac beatorum Petri et Pauli apostolorum eius se non erit incursurum. Datum Rome \u8230 \'85 anno incarnacionis dominice millesimo quadringentesimo septuagesimo tertio nonas Octobris pontificatus nostri anno etc. quinto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Quellenangabe am Rande: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Habetur sub sigillo camere apostolice et precedens bulla in T\u252 \'fcbingen apud sorores de penitencia s. Dominici.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

