\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Hugo de S. Victore}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Expositio regulae beati Augustini}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit prologus venerabilis doctoris Hugonis de sancto Victore in expositionem regule beati Augustini episcopi< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Ante omnia fratres karissimi diligatur deus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85capitulum speciale superius expressum. >Explicit prologus. Incipit expositio \u8230 \'85< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18  Hec precepta que subscripta sunt }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ideo regularia appellantur \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 vt cultor eius non in seipso sed in illo glorietur. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit expositio Hugonis super regula beati Augustini episcope. Scriptum et finitum anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  LXXXXVIII in die s. Blasii episcopi et martyris per fratrem Johannem Erck ordinis predicatorum conuentus Franckfordensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck (ohne Prolog) PL 176, 881 A-924 D. \endash  Vgl. R. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Goy\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \u220 \'dcberlieferung der Werke des Hugo von St. Viktor. Stuttgart 1976, S. 468. \endash   \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kurz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Hsl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung, S. 294.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

