\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 De sententia excommunicationis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sequitur forma ferendi sententiam excommunicationis et in communi< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Cum mihi fratri tali priori prouinciali fratrum predicatorum in tali prouincia denunciatum fuerit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85>De sententia excommunicationis danda in speciali< Ego frater A etc. volens a te fr. N. scire \u8230 \'85 Copia huius scripture tibi offero coram istis. Testes fuerunt isti et isti etc. Ex libro magistri ordinis. Scriptum anno domini 1498.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

