\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prouinciales eandem habent auctoritatem absoluendi quam magister ordinis et dispensandi super irregularitatibus etc< Sixtus papa IIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Exposuisti nobis quod facultatem absoluendi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Datum Rome apud s. Petrum sub annulo piscatoris \u8230 \'85 M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  LXXXI\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 anno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 decimo.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sixtus IIII. Casus a quibus nec magister ordinis nec prouinciales absolui possunt< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Declaramus hereticos relapsos}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 predictis concedimus per presentes.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Breue per Sixtum IIII datum pro concordia et vnione cleri et mendicancium< Sixtus \u8230 \'85 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Que inter dilectos filios clerum nacionis Germanie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et religiosos ordinum mendicancium controuersia vigeat \u8230 \'85 Datum Rome \u8230 \'85 M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  LXXXIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .
