\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Dilectis filiis Jacobo de Stubach vicario ac prioribus et fratribus domorum seu conuentuum prouincie Theutonie ordinis predicatorum< Dilecti filii salutem etc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[16].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Exponi nobis nuper curastis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod alias in capitulo generali ordinis nostri in ciuitate Veneciarum proxime celebrato ex certis causis \u8230 \'85 non obstant quibus quinque. Datum Rome apud sanctum Petrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  LXXX\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Innocentius papa VIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~.- Am Rande: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Originale habetur in conuentu Wyenensi.
