\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Notandum quod in nostra prouincia theutonie ordinis predicatorum sunt quatuor nationes quarum subscripti sunt conuentus et quilibet conuentus dat omni anno pro contributione conuentus sui< Natio Brabantie. Conuentus Coloniensis + conuentus fratrum Franckfordensis. 4 fl. Moguntinus 2 fl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8230 \'85 Etc. (172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Monasteria sororum in dicta natione. 4 ad sanctam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gertrudinem in Colonia. 1 ad sanctum Achathium in Colonia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. (173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Natio Alsatie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Natio Sueuie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Natio Bauarie superioris portionis: Conuentus Nurembergensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 4 fl\u8230 \'85. Inferioris portionis: 6 ad sanctam Katherinam in N\u252 \'fcremberga\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Schlie\u223 \'dft (177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) mit der Abrechnung der j\u228 \'e4hrlichen Contributiones. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

