\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Dedicatio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lumen confessorum vocatur iste liber}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  omnibus penitentiariis et confessoribus ad sciendum necessarium per me pauperem episcopum Andream Hyspanum minorem penitentiarium et Megarensem episcopum et pontificem ex multis libris et dictis magistrorum theologie et decretalium ac decretorum in multis locis dispersa \u8230 \'85compilata \u8230 \'85 Anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 oblata per me reverendo in Christo patri et domino Jordano de Vrsinis cardinali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; Text (Gliederung an den Seitenr\u228 \'e4ndern, rot): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pars 1\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de confessoribus< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quinque sunt partes luminis confessorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Prima pars in primo articulo declarat que sunt necessaria ex parte confessoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qualiter confessor debet confitentem docere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. Endet (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quo lumine nos illuminet illa lux que est vera que est deus noster qui cum patre et spiritu sancto regnat et residet in perpetuuo lumine. Amen etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Jhesus Christus. Finitus est liber iste lumen confessorum anno domini 1478, indicione vndecima, ciclo lunari sedecim, vicesima die mensis Februarii que erat feria sexta Xl\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 me\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ante dominicam oculi hora completorii per artium magistrum Magni Pirgman plebanum in Pfronten tunc penitenciarium generalem domini episcopi Augustani domini Johannis comitis de Werdenberg partimque sub expensis eiusdem per manus aliorum pro quo sit laus et gloria deo per infinita seculorum secula. Amen. M\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [agnus]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [irgman]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Miseraciones domini super omnia opera eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Zwischen Text und Schlussschrift eingeschobener Vers: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Versus<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Esurit ars / decreta tument\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Wa\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 l\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia Nr. 5910 u. 1517; Proverbia Nr. 8069.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Vgl. P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Michaud-Quantin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sommes de casuistique et manuels de confession au moyen age (XII-XIV si\u232 \'e8cle). Montreal 1962, S. 118. Dort Hinweise auf die \u220 \'dcberlieferung des Textes. Drucke nicht nachgewiesen.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

