\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Modus quidam emendandi publicos peccatores obseruatus in indulgenciis plenariis pro sancta cruciata per Innocentium papam concessum pro partibus Alemanie et precipue in dyocesi Augustensi obseruatus< 1. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Fornicatio simplex notoria emendetur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Etc. (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 20. Item alii incendarii remissionem habeantur ut homicide casuales.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et sic de aliis secundum diuersitatem casuum \u8230 \'85 pro manifestis dumtaxat peccatis pro mei ac aliorum manuductionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 concepta etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
