\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jhesus Maria. 1494 natiuitatis Marie.- {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petiuisti a me pridem, domine prestantissime iurium licentiate approbatissime, quatenus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tibi describerem modum penitentiarum satisfactionalium prout iniungere consweui quando pridem in officio publico penitentiarie \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 In redempcionem minus efficienter taxate penitencie etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hec sunt, Cristofore, Clamer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\~?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cognomento, in partibus Tridentine dyocesis plebane sagacissime ac pontificis presentis licenciate dignissime que ego Magnus Pirgman plebanus insufficiens \u8230 \'85 describere cognoui \u8230 \'85 que ad rogatum meum dignetis pie suscipere et in erratis excusare \u8230 \'85 me tibi recommendo etc. Ex Augsburgo manu propria cicius festinando ac describendo ad te hec dedi 21. die mensis Octobris et anno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 gracie \u8230 \'85 nonagesimo quarto etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

