\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Praefatio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quomodo plerique diuersos modos habent confitendi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , vnus prolixius alius breuiorem \u8230 \'85 ita etiam interdum confessores satis tediosi reddantur, cogitaui subsequentem modum exemplarem ponere presertim pro sacerdotibus et istis qui uel quottidie uel frequenter confitentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 1485 in fine Augusti per Magnum Pirgman\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Reverende pater velitis audire rationem peccatorum meorum propter deum etc. Mi pater, ego reus omnium malorum meorum et maximus peccator confiteor onipotenti deo \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 uel quam assigno vobis ex priuilegio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et licentia superiorum etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 leer.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

