\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Text des Evangeliums: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In principio erat verbum \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 nec ipsum arbitror mundum capere eos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui scribendi sunt libros.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Expliciunt ewangelia Johannis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Anschlie\u223 \'dfend zwei Dicta (von der Haupthand): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Aqua non ad montes sed currit ad ualles. Propheta ait: Ve his qui trahunt peccta sua \u8230 \'85 cum peccata que facta sunt cooperuntur aliis peccatis.- Quid prodest aquirere in hoc seculo quidlibet temporale transitorium \u8230 \'85 et ve ei qui ceciderit quia in mare trahetur.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

