\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit epistola super prophetiam beate virgnis Hildegardis speculum futurorum temporum< Honorabilibus viris semper in Christo diligendis magistro Reymundo scolastico et magistro Ruthero canonicos sancti Stephani in Moguntia frater Gebeno dictus prior Cisterciensium in Eberbach. Si quid potest peccatoris oratio \u8230 \'85 antequam in manibus multorum verius publice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 tur \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >Explicit epistola et incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 prologus< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 De antichristo nostris temporibus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 diuersi diuersa proponentes \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 sicut dicit scriptura in manu domini sumus. Ipsi h\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [onor] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 g\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [loria].\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text\~: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De eo quod sancta Hildegardis obscure et inuisitato stilo loquitur in libris suis< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Libros beate Hildegardis plurimi legere fastidiunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et horrent \u8230 \'85 non est locucio prophetarum secundum suam uel audientium voluntatem sed secundum voluntatem spiritus qui loquebatur in illis etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: J. B. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Pitra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Analecta S. Hildegardis opera, in: Spicilegium Solesmense. T. VIII. Montecassino 1882, S. 483-485. \endash  Zum Autor Gebeno v. Eberbach vgl. \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 LThK 4, Sp. 308 und die dort verzeichnete Literatur.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

