\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [P]rimum quidem dicere est circa quid et de quo, textus libri est. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Incipit liber priorum Aristotelis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  et diuiditur primo iste liber in duas [partes] \u8230 \'85 Sic est finis primi libri priorum finitus in vigilia Michahelis anno domini 1355 etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >Secundus liber< (am Rande). [I]n quantis ergo figuris. Postquam Aristoteles in primo libro agit (\~?) de sillogismo (\~?)\~ \u8230 \'85 et in hoc terminatur glosa libri priorum lecta et finita (\~?) a reuerendo magistro Kekone regenti Auguste anno domini M\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  CCC\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  LVI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  proxima die sabati ante conuersionem sancti Pauli.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  51a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  Vgl. dazu \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lohr, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 a. a. O.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 und \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ma\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 kowski,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  a. a. O., S. 16, Nr. 3 u. S. 133.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

