\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit glosa suppositionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < Prologus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Circa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 principium huius libri sicut\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 aliorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sunt aliqua premittenda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et per modum dubiorum dissoluenda. Et primo notandum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod suppositio non est aliqua entitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\~; Text (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): [E]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 xpedit vt terminorum. Iste liber prima sui diuisione diuiditur in 3 capitula \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 que saluabit et in aliis etc. Et sic est finis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Markowski\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  a. a. O. S. 29, Nr. 14.}

