\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Quatuor evangelia cum prologis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Evangelium secundum Matthaeum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Prologus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Matheus autem ex Judea sicut in ordine ponitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 590: (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alius prologus in Matheum< Matheus cum primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 predicasset ewangelium in Judea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 589; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primum capitulum Mathei< Liber generationis \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 ego vobiscum sum omnibus diebus usque ad consummationem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  seculi.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit Matheus ewangelista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  An  den Seitenr\u228 \'e4ndern Angabe der Perikopen f\u252 \'fcr den liturgischen Gebrauch  sowie Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung in den anderen Evangelien (Synopse).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Evangelium secundum Marcum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prologus in Marcum< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Marcus ewangelista dei electus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et beati Petri in baptismate filius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 607.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit Marcus ewangelista. Primum capitulum Marci< Initium ewangelii Jhesu Christi filii dei \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 et sermonem confirmante sequentibus signis etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit Marcus ewangelista.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Evangelium seundum Lucam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit prologus in Lucam ewangelistam< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Lucas natione Syrus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anthiocensis arte medicus discipulus apostolorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 620.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item alius prologus in Lucam< Quoniam quidem multi conati sunt ordinare narrationem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Lc 1,1-4).\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit Lucas capitulum primum< Fuit in diebus Herodis regis \u8230 \'85 et erant semper in templo laudantes et benedicentes deum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit Lucas ewangelista.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Evangelium secundum Johannem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prologus in Johannem ewangelistam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Hic est Johannes ewangelista}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vnus ex discipulis dei qui virgo electus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 V\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 gl\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 .  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 624.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sequitur primum capitulum Johannis< In principio erat verbum \u8230 \'85 nec ipsum arbitror mundum capere eos qui scribendi sunt libros etc. Deo gratias. Per istos sermones sancti ewangelii indulgeat nobis dominus noster Jhesus Christus vniuersa delicta nostra. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Expliciunt ewangelia quatuor ewangelistarum per me Johannem Z\u252 \'fcckenr\u228 \'e4unst feria quarta post diem sancti Nicolay anno domini etc. 1432 jar etc.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

