\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Ablassbrief: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vrbanus episcopus seruus seruorum dei. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Significamus tam presentibus quam futuris}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod orationem presentium suffragia dicens est penitus suppositus a canonicis horis vrgente necessitate. Insuper centum quadraginta dies vere indulgencie \u8230 \'85 misericorditer in domino relaxamus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Recompensatio horarum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Domine deus omnipotens o sancta atque indiuidua nobilissima trinitas \u8230 \'85 o Adonai miserere nostri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hora matutinali< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 O rex glorie virtutum triumphator omnipotens}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pro nobis miseris nocturnis horis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hora prima< Gloria et honor laus et felicitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 o largitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. Zu jeder Hore gibt es ein ersatzweise zu verrichtendes Gebet. Endet (222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Hora completorii< O saluator o redemptor o liberator \u8230 \'85 Tu domine deus noster circa occasum solis oblatus es \u8230 \'85 vt in te eternaliter felici iocunditate requiescat. Cui soli debetur honos laus et gloria atque iubilatio per infinita secula seculorum. Amen. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallelhs.: Wien, Dominikanerkonvent, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cod. 30/30.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash  Vgl. dazu F. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Czeike\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Verzeichnis der Handschriften des Dominikanerkonventes in Wien bis zum Ende des 16. Jahrhunderts. Wien 1952
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

