\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus de regulis iuris diuini Francisci Maronis doctoris illuminati< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Justus dominus et iustitias dilexit equitatem videt vultus eius. In psalmo Xo (8). Quia regule}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  videntur diui diriuate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ab eius iustitia sumuntur sicut regule eterne \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 Bricht ab (312\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) bei Regula 10: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Decima regula est ista: Deus pro iudicio est quod ad remunerandum bonum \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 sed contra istam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 regulam instantur quadrupliciter: Primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  //.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  312\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -322\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
