\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Prologus\~: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [P]ostquam opusculum quoddam uelut exemplum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  meditandi de ratione fidei cogentibs me precibus quorundam fratrum \u8230 \'85 istud uero proslogyon idest alloquium nominaui. -\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Capitulatio. - (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text\~: [E]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ia nunc homuncio fuge paululum occupaciones tuas \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 donec intrem in gaudium dominio mei qui est trinus et unus deus benedictus in secula. Amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
