\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Capitulatio: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt capitula primi libri de spiritu et anima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < [Q]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vid sit animus et quid ratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et quid ratiocinatio. Quid anima uidet uisibilia per corpus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. - (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prologus: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 liber de spiritu et anima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [Q]uoniam dictum est michi ut me ipsum cognoscam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\~;  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cap.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Kapitelz\u228 \'e4hlung von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand am Rande nachgetragen) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quid est animus et quid ratio et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quid ratiocinatio< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Animus est substantia quedam rationis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  particeps regendo corpori\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui ibi commendat memorie a ratione iudicata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [z\u228 \'e4hlt in PL als Cap. XXII]. - (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipiunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 capitula secundi libri de spiritu et anima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < [D]e intellectu et eius acceptione multiplici \u8230 \'85 Etc. - >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber secundus de spiritu et anima. De intellectu et eius acceptione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < [D]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ixit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 A\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [l]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pharabius: Nomen intellectus multis modis dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 [Dieses Kapitel fehlt in PL zwischen Cap. XXII und XXIII]\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 illicita concupiscat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit liber secundus de spiritu et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 anima. Incipiunt capitula tercii libri< De multiplici dignitate condicionis humane\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85Etc. - >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber tertius de dignitate multiplici \u8230 \'85< Tanta dignitas humane conditionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. Endet: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 apposuit dolorem sc. peregrinationis siue ex disiderio patrie sue et uisionis dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quem cernere finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [in PL Cap. L]. - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit liber de spiritu et anima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
