\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Roberto da Lecce (Caraciolo)}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : De misericordia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\~?). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Tu autem fornicata es cum amatoribus multis vnde reuertere vbi supra (Jer 3, 1). Dilectissimi et deuotissimi in Christo vt magis appareat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et reluceat amor dei erga nos, debemus notare qualiter deus ab eterno ordinauit redimere \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85Reuertere ad redemptorem tuum \u8230 \'85 vt cum ipso in vnitate diuinitatis sue viues et regnas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Tu autem fornicata es \u8230 \'85 Jer. 3 capo. vt supra. Nullus namque sine deo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  viuere possit nec aliud boni operari \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 Et sic patent 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 es\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  amores quos nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dignetur nobis concedere trinus et vnus. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Etc. (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Cherubin da Spoleto}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : De virginibus\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 De virginibus preceptum non habeo \u8230 \'85 Ia ad Cor. 7. capo. Etsi non omnes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  valeant amplecti virginitatis decorem \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 et valeant lucrari regnum celorum in quo viuit et regnat deus per\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 infinita secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Etc. Letzter Sermo (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Roberto\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 da Lecce: De iudicio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Audiui vocem vnius aquile volantis per medium celum dicentis magna voce: Ve ve ve habitantibus in terra. Apoc. 8 (13). Ego sum astrictus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , dilectissimi et deuotissimi in Christo Jhesu, a vinculo sancte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 caritatis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 Endet mit einem ganz auf Italien bezogenen Schluss (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\~: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 et non relinquent in te lapidem super lapidem eo quod non cognouisti \u8230 \'85 Sed posset dicere Ytalibus sicut Jhesus dicit super Jerusalem: O Ytalia plora et sic de singulis prouinciis et ciuitatibus quia hinc ad paucum tempus si viuas videbis Ytalia et alias prouincias cum oculis tuis habere multa mala\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut timeo defici et paulatim etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- 153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. - Ein Teil der Sermones (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) konnte unter den Franziskaner-Handschriften bei C. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Cenci\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Manoscritti francescani della Biblioteca Nazionale di Napoli. T. 1. 2. Grottaferata 1971, nachgewiesen werden.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

