\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -239\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Sermones}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Exiit qui seminat semen. Luc. 8 (5). Non enim uerbis multis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  opus est ut ad declarandum presentis ewangelii ystoriam audiencium corda excitem \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 et nos isto tempore dei uerba audire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut hic concedat nobis gratiam Christus et in futuro gloriam. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - (233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Alius sermo de uerbo dei< Conuertimini et agite penitenciam ab omnibus iniquitatibus uestris. Ezechielis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 18 cap\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (30). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Est iam hora ut unusquisque se preparet ad suscipienda onera penitencie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Celum et terra transibunt uerba autem mea non preteribunt hoc ille etc. Amen. -\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (235\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sermo de contricione< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Ecce mulier erat in ciuitate peccatrix. Luc 7o capo (37). Tantam equidem uirtutem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  habet contricio \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 quam  contricionem nobis concedere dignetur qui pro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nobis passus est ut nos perducat ad regna celorum qui cum patre \u8230 \'85 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- 240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

