\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sermo de ira dei< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Audiui vocem vnius aquile volantis per medium celi \u8230 \'85 Apoc. 8 (13). Si nostre uires}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quid valerent contra deum merito excusacione redderentur \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 timemus et exterminemus ipsam iram ut mereamur ipsam euitare et gratiam optinere in presenti et gloriam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in futuro. Amen.- Factum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 est sermo de ira dei fr. R\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [oberto]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . ord. minorum. Aliud thema: Timete deum. Apoc. 14. - >Sequitur sermo de flagellis fr. R< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Audiui uocem vnius aquile \u8230 \'85 Apoc. 8 (13). Ego sum astrictus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dilectissimi in Christo Jhesu a uinculis sc. caritatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Identisch mit dem Sermo 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , nur ist der dortige Schluss: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O Ytalia plora \u8230 \'85 defici et paulatim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , hier viel weiter gef\u252 \'fchrt (248\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -250\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) als Anklage gegen die Sittenverderbnis der oberitalienischen St\u228 \'e4dte Mailand, Padua, Florenz trotz der Bu\u223 \'dfpredigten von Albert de Sartiano, Jacobus de Martha, Johannes de Capistrano. - (250\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo de sancta pace< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Inquire pacem et persequere eam Ps. 33. Fugiunt quem sepe numero}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  multi pacis dulcedine et amenitate obtentu \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 vt valeas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 intrare in graciam dei et in fine habere gloriam. Amen. Fr. R\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - Etc. (270\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -274\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo de resurrectione (von anderer Hand): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Nolite expauescere \u8230 \'85 Scribuntur hec verba Mt vltimo (28,10). Ibi et  in ewangelio occurrentis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  festiuitatis \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 consequitur misericordiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in presenti et resurrectionem gloriosam in futuro in secula seculorum. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  - 275\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -279\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. -
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (280\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo bonus de spe. fr. R< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Diuitibus huius seculi superba non sapere}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 . }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Primum ad Thi}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [motheum] }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 6}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  (17). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Nobis positis in hac uita}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  miserabili \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 de miseria ad summam felicitatem vna cum patre et filio et spiritu sancto esse dignabimur in secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Cenci\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  a. a. O. S. 446 [Cod. VII.D.22]. - (284\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De timore sermo< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Vidi alterum angelum uolantem per medium celum \u8230 \'85 Apoc. 14 (6). In quibus uidendum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dilectissimi in Christo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jhesu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85- (290\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -291\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sufficiant erga\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\~?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 deum et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [   ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - (295\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sermo de adoracione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Dominum tuum adorabis et ei soli seruire. Mt 4 (10). Est etiam ewangelium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  presentis dominica. Reperitur in ewangelio dilectissimi in Christo Jhesu quod magna multitudo que\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in hora diui cultus \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 et habebitis graciam in hoc mundo et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [in futuro] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 gloriam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - (298\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Von anderer Hand\~: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo de anthechristo zelato< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Cum videritis abhominationes desolacionis \u8230 \'85 Mt 24 (15). In hoc sanctissimo ewangelio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dilectissimi \u8230 \'85 saluator mundi annunciat magnam desolationem \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 sed reuelata facie gloriam domini contempletur qui cum patre et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 spiritu sancto \u8230 \'85 in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - Ob alle Sermones von Roberto da Lecce  stammen, war nicht nachzuweisen. - 305\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -307\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
