\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Vtrum angelus in primo instanti sue creacionis fuerit malus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  actu proprie voluntatis. Resp. Quot adeo paruula mora fuit inter creationem angeli et lapsum quod pro nichilo reputatur \u8230 \'85 Queritur vtrum angelus post creacionem suam per cognicionem, suam naturalem cognouit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 diuinam essenciam in seipso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. Letzte Quaestio (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Queritur {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 vtrum baptismus flaminis sicut baptismus fluminis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sufficiat ad salutem. Arguitur quod non \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 etsi sic decederet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 secundum quod dampnatur hoc est quia purificatus est baptismo fluminis et caret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\~?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
