\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -235\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Ps.-Bonaventura}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Tractatus de via vel dieta salutis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Hic incipit dieta uel via salutis in quo docentur decem diete mediate quibus peruenire possumus ad eternam salutem. Sequitur thema etc<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Prooemium: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Hec est via, ambulate in ea nec ad dexteram nec ad sinistram declinate. Ysaias 3 (21). Magnam misericordiam facit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui viam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 erranti ostendit maxime in nocte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Capitulatio; (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Cap. I\~: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Primo nota de peccato in communi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et est sciendum \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 ad quam nos perducat et participes faciat dominator illius choree Jhesus Christus filius virginis qui cum patre \u8230 \'85 per infinita secula seculorum. Amen. -\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit dieta salutis per me Wilhelmum Stimler tunc temporis plebanus in Greffelfing. Anno domini 1478 in otaua apostolorum Petri et Pauli quasi hora completorii.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Vgl. zur Verfasserfrage u. a. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Distelbrink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bonaventura, S. 132 Nr. 124 (Nennt als Autor: Guillaume de Lanicia). - B.-G. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Guyot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ,  La dieta salutis de Jean Rigaud, in: A. Fr. H. 82 (1989), S. 360-393, hier\~: S. 380.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

