\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Triplex est vnccio exterior et duplex interior< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Unxit te deus tuus oleo letitie. Dicitur psalmo (44,8). Item nota quod triplex}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est vnccio sc. exterior et interior. Exterior triplex est prima in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 baptismo \u8230 \'85 liniens wlnera peccatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - (236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De effectu sumptionis corporis Christi< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Panem de celo prestitisti illis \u8230 \'85 Dicitur in psalmo (77,24). Ad litteram hec dicta}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sunt de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 manna \u8230 \'85 per peccatorum inquinamentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - (237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De condicionibus accedencium ad communionem< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Primo debet homo accedere contritus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad communionem \u8230 \'85 ut se indignum iudicet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 homo participacione corporis et sanguinis domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - 238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -241\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 leer.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

