\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Secuntur themata dominicalia per circulum anni. Prima dominica in aduentu domini< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Abiciamus opera tenebrarum \u8230 \'85 Ad Romanos 13 (12). In aduentu magni regis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et principis expurgantur sordes et parantur vestes \u8230 \'85 in festis precipuis. De hac veste require in mteria de caritate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica secunda< Deus autem spei replet vos omni gaudio. Ad Rom. 15\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (13). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quoniam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 a viris perfectis specialiter et spiritualiter sunt debiles curandi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. (435\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\~\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >In dominica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 XXV< Faciet iudicium et iustitiam in terra. Jerem. 22\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bonus pater familias seruis suis predicet  minas \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  docet nos Jeremias vestigia obseruanda. Require materia de iustitia et preceptis.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

