\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Post themata dominicalia secuntur nunc themata de sanctis et primo de apostolis< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Maiorem hac dilectionem nemo habet ut animam suam poneret quis pro amicis suis. Johannes 15 (13). Conswetum est in ecclesia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut in magna festiuitate pulsantur campana\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc.  Endet (435\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) mit: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [sc. de virginibus]< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quam pulchra est casta generatio cum claritate. Sapiencia 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Consweuit homo mirari propter tria specialiter \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  debemus esse contemplacione radiosi. Require in materia de contemplacione etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - 435\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
