\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Praefatio: >[Epistola Hiero]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nimi Damaso< Beatissimo papae Damaso Hieronimus. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Origenes cum ceteris libris}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  omnes vicerit \u8230 \'85 cum sic possint placere que parua sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- Homilia prima\~: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Translatio sancti Hieronimi de tractatu Origenis in epithalamicis< De cantico canticorum tractatus. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Quomodo didicimus per Moysen}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 et eris uere diues in sponsi domo sponsa formosa cui est gloria in saecula saeculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit omelia secunda< Ab eo loco in quo scriptum est: Nardus mea dedit odorem suum \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 deprecemur ut digni efficiamur sponsi sermone sapientia Christo Jhesu cui est gloria et imperium in saecula saeculorum. Amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck\~: PL 23, 1117 A \endash  1144.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

