\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omnis sapientia a domino est et cum illo fuit semper\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Glossa marginalis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hrabanus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Omnis sapientia etc. (Ecl 1,1). Incipit ab eterna dei sapientia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  que Christus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text endet mit (Ecl 51,38): \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Operamini opus uestrum ante tempus et dabit uobis mercedem uestram in tempore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 suo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Glossa interlinearis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Operamini opus uestrum: ambulate dum lucem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 habetis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ante tempus: iudicii. Et dabit uobis mercedem: remunerationem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eternam. In tempore suo: iudicio. tempore suo metemur non deficientes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit Ecclesiasticus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck:  PL 113, 1183-1232. \endash  Vgl.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB 11806 (Glosse Hrabanus zugeschrieben).
