\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo bonus de beata uirgine< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Astitit regina a dextris tuis etc. (Ps 44,10). Regina celi et terre}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est beata uirgo Maria que hodie ad dexteram dei astare cepit in gloria \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 inclinamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ac plenas ad te suspiramus ad te preces in celum transmittamus. Rogemus ergo deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kaufvermerk (s. o.).
