\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Speculum humanae salvationis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit prohemium cuiusdam noue compilationis cuius nomen et titulus est speculum humane saluationis< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Expediens uidetur et vtile quod primo in hoc prohemio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  exponatur de quibus materiis et hystoriis in quolibet capitulo dicatur. Et qui diligenter hoc prohemuim perstuduerit de facili totum librum quasi intelligere poterit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In XLV. cap. agitur de VII gaudiis eiusdem gloriose virginis et terminantur capitula huius libelli et volumiis. Predictum prohemium de contentis huius libri compilaui et propter pauperes predicatores apponere curaui, quod si facte nequiuerint totum librum comparare si sciunt hystorias possunt ex ipso prohemoi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 predicare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  Hier beginnt der von J. Lutz und P. Perdrizet edierte Text, der von da ab mit der Hs. \u252 \'fcbereinstimmt. Prologus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Ad iustitiam erudiunt multos}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , fulgebunt isti quasi stellas perpetuas eternitates. Hic est quod ad eruditionem multorum decreui librum compilare \u8230 \'85 ut gratum tibi faciat. Amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primum capitulum de casu Luciferi< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Incipit speculum humane saluationis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in quo patet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 casus hominis et modus reparationis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Endet mit Septem gaudiis BMV: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vt sine fine merear gaudio sempiterno frui. Quod nobis omnibus prestare dignetur dominus Jhesus Christus qui cum patre et spiritu sancto est in perpetuum benedictus. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finito libro sit laus et gloria Christo.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck\~: J.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Lutz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  u. P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Perdrizet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Speculum humanae salvationis \u8230 \'85 (s. o.), S. 1-99.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

