\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo bonus de animabus< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Beati mortui qui in domino moriuntur (Apc 14,13). In hiis uerbis beatus Johannes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  duo facit: Primo beatos nos mortuos ostendit \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 postquam egressi sunt requiescumt a laboribus suis ad quam patriam nos perducat qui in celis uiuit et regnat. Amen.
