\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prologus (= Epistola VIII ad Accam episcopum in expositione evangelii secundum Marcum): >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prologus Bede presbiteri in Marcum euangelistam< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 In expositionem evangelii secundum Marcum opitulante}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ipsa euangelica gratia scripturi primo que fuerit eidem Marco causa euangelii scribendi \u8230 \'85 et corporis et animi fragilitatibus apud pium iudicem intercessores existere dignemur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit prologus.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  Capitulatio (Summarium evangelii): >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cap< Esaye testimonio Johannes angelus idest nuntius appellatur et predicatio eius baptismusque refertur. >II< Christus predicans baptizatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ubi trinitas panditur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 XLVII< Resurrectionis ac passionis eius perinde breuiter ueritate monstrata \u8230 \'85 adque ad dextris confessio uel discipulorum predicatio signis sequentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 indicatur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit C\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [apitulatio oder Compilatio?].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  Expositio evangelii secundum Marcum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit expositio Bede presbiteri super euangelium Marci< Initium evangelii Jesu Christi filii dei. Sicut scriptum est in Esaya propheta: Ecce mitto angelum meum ante faciem tuam qui preparabit uiam tuam. Conferendum hoc euangelii Marci principium principio Mathei \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 cognoscitur quo seruos perducet per formam serui ut liberi contemplentur formam domini.- Explicit expositio Bede  presbiteri super Marcum evangelistam.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: CC SL 120, S. 431-648. \endash  Capitulatio auch in \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bruyne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sommaires, S. 282-286 unter C. \endash  Vgl. auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ste\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 g\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 m\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB 1613.}

