\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Isidorus Hispalensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 De ortu et obitu patrum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Praefatio\~: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit quorundorum sanctorum nobilissimorumque uirorum ortus uel gesta cum genealogiis suis>  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 In hoc libello indita sunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 ad memoriam redeunt dum breue sermone leguntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic explicit prologus.- >Incipiunt capitula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (zweispaltig\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 )< I. Adam. II. Abel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit capitulatio de nouo testamento< LXIIII. Zacharias et Elisabeth. LXV. Joannis baptista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt capitulae libri huius. Incipit ortus uita uel obitus sanctorum patrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui in scripturarum laudibus efferuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Textbeginn: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Adam protoplautus (!) et colonus paradisi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que est in tribu Juda inter Dothain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [et] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Balmon.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit ortus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 uita uel obitus sanctorum patrum qui habentur in ueteri testamento\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Das Kapitel \u252 \'fcber die Machab\u228 \'e4er fehlt.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit eorum qui sunt in nouo testamento< Zacharias et Elisabeth ante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 deum iusti steriles in iuuentute, fecundi in senio requiescumt in Hierusa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [le]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 defunctus est atque sepultus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit liber de ortu uel obitu \u8230 \'85 qui sunt in nouo testamento.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck\~: PL 83, 129 B \endash  156 B. 
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

