\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Isidorus Hispalensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Allegoriae quaedam sacrae scripturae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit liber de interpretatione quorundam nominum ueteris nouique testamenti. Incipit praefatio< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Domino meo et dei seruo Orosio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  episcopo Ysidorus quaedam notissima nomina legis et euangeliorum quae sub allegoria imaginariae obteguntur \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed tuo commisi corrigenda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iudicio.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit praefatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ex veteri testamento: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Adam figuram Christi gestauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Machabei septem qui sub Anthiocho grauissima perpessi tormenta \u8230 \'85 et glorie celestis coronam accepit.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item de nouo testamento< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Quattuor evangeliste dominum Jhesum Christum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sub quattuor animalium uultibus figuraliter exprimunt \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 Septem discipuli cum quibus dominus post resurrectionem conuiuasse describitur \u8230 \'85 refectione saturabuntur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit liber plenitudinis noui et ueteris testamenti.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck\~: PL 83, 97 B \endash  130 B.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

