\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipt liber primiorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [statt: Prooemiorum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de libris noui et ueteris testamenti plenitudinem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quam in canone catholica recepit ecclesia iuxta uetustatem priorum  traditionem ista est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < Prologus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 In principio uidelicet quinque libri Moysi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Genesis, Exodus \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 in eis parua premia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [statt: prooemia] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 narrationum subiciamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . [Ohne Unterbrechung beginnen 30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  die Prooemia]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Genesis iuxta fidem historiae describit fabrica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [m] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mundi et hominis conditionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 fedus quoque amitiarum cum Romanorum duces\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 actaque legationum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item prefationes librorum noui testamenti< Euangeliorum predicatio quamuis quadriferia sit \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 flumen etiam baptismi mundum uitae dominum Jhesum Christum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit liber praemiorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [statt\~: prooemiorum].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck\~: PL 83, 155 B \endash  180 A.
