\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  Vollst\u228 \'e4ndiger Evangelientext in mittlerer Spalte. Endet 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit ewangelium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 secundum Matheum. V. II. D. CC\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Datierung?].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  Argumentum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec causa Matheum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [   ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 compulit: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Cum facta esset in Palestina persecutio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dispersi carentes doctoribus \u8230 \'85 quod operum Christi scribere historiam ut ubique esset\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 statum fidei totius  secum haberent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 7496.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rbc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prologus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [Matheus cum primo predicasset ewangelium \u8230 \'85] }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 a quibus ibat ad memoriam reliquit \u8230 \'85 in aquila\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 exprimitur diuinitatis sacramentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glossa marginalis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Liber generationis (Mt 1,1). Hebrei uoluminibus suis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a principiis notum imponunt ut liber genesis ut dicitur liber generationis Ade\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rbc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 (zu Mt 1,16) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exemplo Marie liquet fidelibus coniugatis \u8230 \'85 sed custodito\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mentis affectu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  //. Hier bricht die Glosse ab.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Druck: PL 114, 63 A-70 A.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 l\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 11827\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4.14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Glossa interlinearis:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Jhesu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 1,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Saluatoris non perditoris quod fuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Adam. Christi. uel ipse est qui et Messias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 [umfangreiche Interlinearglosse] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut eum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cognosceret et qui eius stirpe fuerat promissus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Interlinear- und Marginalglosse gehen ineinander \u252 \'fcber.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vgl.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 11827\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

