\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Prothema (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Exodus grece, exitus uel egressus latine}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Odos enim uia, hinc odoporion i. e.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 itinerarium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 6626, 1 [Ps.-Petrus Lombardus]; 11782\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hrabanus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 In Pentateuco excellit Exodus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in quo pene omnia sacramenta quibus ecclesia instruitur \u8230 \'85 os\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non comminetis ex eo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 117821.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Glossa marginalis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Vndecim filii Jacob qui cum eo in Egyptum ingressi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sunt immo duodecim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 addito Joseph \u8230 \'85 Isidorus: Erant igitur etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Ex 1,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 LXX anime i. e. LXXX discipuli cum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jacob i. e. Christo \u8230 \'85 Isidorus: Quo mortuo etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Ex 1,6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sic postquam uerus Joseph pro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 omnibus gustauit mortem \u8230 \'85 Origenes: Quo mortuo etc. Si moriatur in te Joseph i. e. si mortificationem Christi in te suscipias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nubes quoque domini incubabat  diem tabernaculo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ex 40,36). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus: Notandum est res mirabilis multum quod nube descendente et implente tabernaculum que tamen gloria domini dicitur \u8230 \'85 super tabernaculum manebant ubi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 castra posuissent, nube per diem et flamma per noctem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 11782\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Glossa interlinearis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec sunt nomina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ex 1,1): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Que scripta sunt in celo. Filiorum Israel:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [vi]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dentium. Qui impressi sunt: Secundum illud: In innocentia mea ingressus sum etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 25,1) \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nec poterat Moyses\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ex 40,33): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Populus Judaicus. Ingredi tectum federis: Secreta scripturarum. Nube operiente: Profunditate scripture. Omnia: Corda migrantium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?).\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer, au\u223 \'dfer unten: Laudatio etc. (wie in Clm 3744). Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 11782\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 13.14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Die sehr umfangreiche Glosse ist eine Katene aus V\u228 \'e4terzitaten. Zitiert wird aus Werken von: Origenes, Hrabanus, Gregorius, Augustinus, Isidorus, Avicenna (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Strabo (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Orosius (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Beda (54 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ff.), Cassiodorus (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

