\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Liber Genesis cum glossa}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Katenenartig aus den Schriften der Kirchenv\u228 \'e4ter entnommenen Zitaten zusammengesetzte Glosse. Zitiert werden: Alcuinus, Augustinus, Beda, Gregorius, Hieronymus, Isidorus, Strabo.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prothemata: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Isidorus< Mistica: In principio fecit deus celum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Gn 1,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Spirituales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui celestia meditantur. Et terram i. e. carnales terrenum hominem imitantes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 11781\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 22\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Gregorius< Querendum est quomodo deus cuncta simul\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 condidit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , EB 11781\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 28\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Augustinus< In narratione rerum factarum non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 omnia secundum figuratum tantum intellectum accipitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 11781\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 26\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Beda< Moyses in hoc libro de inferiori mundo ad instructionem hominis agit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 11781\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Strabus< In principio \u8230 \'85 Moises in uno principio temporis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mundum a creatore factum refert\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 l\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 11781\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Es folgen: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  RB 11781\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 24.25.4.5.31.30.7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glossa marginalis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Augustinus< In principio fecit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Gn 1,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Non dixit: In principio dixit deus: Fiat celum etc. sicut dixit: Fiat lux \u8230 \'85 auersa a sapientia dei stulte et misere uiui.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mystice: In principio creauit deus celum eos scil. qui celestis imaginem portauerunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 11781\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 29.35\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Beda< Terra erat inanis et uacua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Gn 1,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quid uel quale celum in principio cum terra tectum est ostendit: Hoc enim de terra subdit quod de celo intelligi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 uoluit \u8230 \'85 quomodo uel quando factum sit postea dicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deus uisitabit uos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 asportate uobiscum ossa mea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Gn 50,24). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Augustinus< Asportate ossa etc. Joseph sicut pater eius terram promissionis tota mente desiderabat \u8230 \'85 per gratiam Christi peruenire merebitur ad spem diuine contemplationis cuius adeptio est letitia. Vnde adimplebis me letitia cum ultu tuo.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glossa interlinearis: [In] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 principio creauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Gn 1,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Filio quo humanato patuit qui essent celestes qui terreni. Creauit tamquam omnium creatorem. Terra: Corporale sine omni qualitate quam apparet in materia formata. Carnales sc. qui terrenum hominem necdum deposuerunt.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deus: pater.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Celum: i. e. spiritales qui celestia meditantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 repositum in loculo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Gn 50,25). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In quo perhenni uite reseruatur. In Egipto: Huius uite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 11781\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 38\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  St\u252 \'fcckweise identisch mit PL 113, 62-182. \endash  109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

