\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Hec est conformatio veteris et novi testamenti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et qualiter prophetie fuerunt omnes in Christo adimplete. Et sic omnes figure ut infra patebit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Incipiendo a prima lege et a creatione}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  mundi \u8230 \'85 >Figura< De matre Sampsonis sterilis est et absque liberis / sed concipiet et pariet filium. />Prophetia< Ecce virgo concipiet et pariet filium. / >Ewangelium< Ecce concipies in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 utero et paries filium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. (78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Schreibervermerk: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 F\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [r.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ominicus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 V\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [illicus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 1461 Patauii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Endet (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ecce tabernaculum dei cum hominibus et habitabit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cum eis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Finitur 23. Septembris. F\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [r.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ominicus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 V\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [illici].
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

