\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Der Anrede nach wurden die Sermones innerhalb einer Klostergemeinschaft gehalten.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Dicite filie Syon ecce rex tuus venit tibi. Verba proposita Mt 21 [5] sunt scripta}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in ewangelio aduentus domini currentis dominice pronunciata in quorum serie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (\~?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et doctrina. Domini ac patres fratresque karissimi, dulcissima laudis modulo multipharie commendatur nostra sacra theologia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Der Text ist streng gegliedert. Abschnitte beginnen stets mit: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dixi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Die Collatio endet (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad cuius eterni amplexus iocunditatem nos perducat rex glorie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Collatio (von gleicher Hand wie die vorhergehende): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Reuerendissimi patres fratresque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in Christo prestantissimi. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Iuxta sententiam sapientis, Eccl. 24 [1] capo invenio quod in tribus est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  beneplacitum spiritui meo i. e. spiritui sancto ideo conformiter me habendo ad presens tria facere intendo: Quantum ergo ad primum occurrit verbum Mt 22 cap\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  originaliter scriptum  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 recipit nos in eterna tabernacula que possidere nos faciat Jhesus Christus \u8230 \'85 benedictus.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Questio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Vtrum via in 4 codicibus sententiarum contenta possit probari}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  absque clauo gratuito\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et sequitur quod esset variabilis quod est falsum et heresis et tantum de questione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

