\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (Am Rande:) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Questio prima. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Vtrum caro factum sit fruicionis beatifice immediatum obiectum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex  thesauro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [   ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 memorie paterne fecunditatis producitur filius in diuinis. Conclusio ista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (am Rande) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Contrarium 1. Verbum proprie dictum est actum intellectus expressum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (am Rande:) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Contrarium 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Verbum si proprie et uocionaliter sumitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. Endet (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\~: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex quibus omnibus sequitur \u8230 \'85 quod verbum incarnatum est fruicionis immediatum obiectum.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

