\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Edicta ludicra data ex castro St\u228 \'e4rckenberg: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Nos N. dei gratia omnium regnorum monarcha}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  regumque invictissimus necnon tocius machine mundialis rector ac summus macrobius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 omnibus regnorum prouinciarum seu terrarum principibus tribunis thyrannis satrapis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nostre magnificencie gratiam pariter et fauorem. Cum nostram potestatem regiam \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sub pena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dupli nostro erario indefectibilem inviscandum. Datis ex nostro castro \lquote Notenberg\rquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [ersetzt durch: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 St\u228 \'e4rckenberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  die olimpiadis quinta hora quasi septima circa gallicantu so man die gleser lert.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Invictissimo ac gloriosissimo generositatis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et magnificentie tytulorum inenarrabilium decore \u8230 \'85 benedictionem omni gencium celi rorem terre pinguedinem \u8230 \'85 Quis enim o rex gentium te non timeret \u8230 \'85Tu enim es rex regum \u8230 \'85 que reddere poterit vnicuique iuxta opera sua. Datum celerrime ex castro nostro Notenberg per comitem de Bretenfels qui apud imperatoriam maiestatem solum prestulatur omnium ex caritate non ficta.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

