\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [H]ec dies boni nuntii est. Ita scribitur quarto Regum libro}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  7\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 mo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [7,9] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 capitulo. Patres venerandi fratresque in domino Jhesu predilecti. Inter insignes atque preclarissimas solempnitates quas sancta nostra ecclesia nobis instituit celebrandas \u8230 \'85 quia hec dies boni nuntii est quam nobis deuote peragere et solempniter festinare concedat qui in eternum viuit et regnat. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De nomine virginis Mariae: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Nomen virginis Marie (Lc 1,27). Hoc verbum quod pro collationis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  huius sumitur exordio legetur hodie in diuersorum sacro misterio et scribitur originaliter Luce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1,27). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Reuerendi patres fratresque \u8230 \'85 Non tam patrum meorum auctoritas non tam ordinis nostri laudabilis auctoritas \u8230 \'85 Cuius participes nos faciat Chrstus virginis filius in secula sempiterna cum patre et spiritu sancto benedictus. Amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  Feria quinta hebdomadae sanctae in lotione pedum: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Qui lotus est non indiget nisi ut pedes lauet, scribitur Jo 13}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [10] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cap\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et legitur in hodierne diei ewangelicali officio atque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 statim recitabitur in peragendo sollempniter mandato dominico\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad penitenciam perducar claritatis diuine prestante domino nostro \u8230 \'85 deus vnus benedictus in eternum. Amen.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer, au\u223 \'dfer kurzem \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 lateinisch-deutschem Glossar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Die neun Stufen der Engelshierarchie: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Angelus \endash  Engel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 archangelus \endash  Erzengel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; Etc. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Seraphim \endash  die brennenden\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

