\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prologus domini Innocentii pape de opere sequenti< Domino patri karissimo P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [etro] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dei gratia Portuensi episcopo Lotharius indignus diaconus gratiam in presenti et gloriam in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 futuro. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Modicum ocii quod inter multas angustias}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\~;  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic incipit liber Lotharii leuite et cardinalis quem composuit de vilitate conditionis humane qui postea Innocentius papa tertius dictus est. De miserabili ingressu progressu hominis< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18  Quare de uulua matris egressus sum }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Endet mit Kap. XX des 3. Buches\~: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod nichil proderit dampnandis< Tunc non proderunt opes \u8230 \'85 frigus et cauma sulphur ignis ardens in secula seculorum. Amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (241\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Einschub: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De proprietatibus Romanorum< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Ante omnia sunt sapientes Romani}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 faciant malum, bonum autem facere nesciunt \u8230 \'85 dissimilatores et malignissimi proditores.-\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit liber Lotharii leuite qui postea Innocentius papa tercius.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck\~: PL 217, 701 B-746 C. \endash  Krit. Ausgabe: M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Maccarrone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Lotharii Cardinalis (Innocentii III) de miseria humane conditionis. Lucani 1955. Diese Hs. hier gef\u252 \'fchrt unter der Sigle \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 M\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

