\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit formula deuotissima audicionis misse cum quibusdam oracionibus intermixtis. Et primo prologus etc< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Atria domus tue sancte ego peccatorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  meorum omnium reus et conscius et sola tue pietatis confidencia, clementissime pater, ingredior \u8230 \'85 per graciam tuam descendam iustificatus in domum meam. Amen. - >Alia oracio deuotissima< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Flecto genua cordis et corporis mei}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in eleuacione oculorum \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 quia totam uitam Christi ante passionem et post passionem breuiter includit. Amen. - Finis est huius operis. -\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
