\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt oraciones deuote de passione domini ad omnes horas. Primo ad vesperas dehinc ad completorium< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Domine Jhesu Christe fili dei uiui fons imperscrutabilis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dulcedo ineffabilis \u8230 \'85 qui pro nobis miseris peccatoribus hora diei vespertina discipulis tuis corporis et sanguinis tui misteria tradidisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\~; (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Sequitur oracio ad completorium< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Domine Jhesu Christe fili dei viui anxiatorum spirituum consolacium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. Endet mit einer Oration ad completorium\~: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et pone me iuxta te vt cum angelis uideam te per infinita secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - 24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

