\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De beata virgine Maria< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Intacta mater quam deus pre omnibus dilexit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. Sechs Gebete.- (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Incipit sequentia predulcis de beata uirgine Maria et ubi estiuo tempore canitur ibi grando et tempestas non habent nocendi potestatem. Et eciam ualet pro omni necessitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 corporis et anime< Aue uirgo stella maris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 AH 10 Nr. 96. Es folgen Gebete zu verschiedenen Marienfesten: (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) AH 10 Nr. 47; (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) AH 23 Nr. 118; (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Chev. 1879; (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) AH 54 Nr. 236. (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 249. (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 218. 2. (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 225. (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 245; (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) AH 55 Nr. 232; (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) AH 54 Nr. 248; (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) AH 50 Nr. 244; (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) AH 54 Nr. 21. (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 285. 250; (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) AH 10 Nr. 136; (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) AH 55 Nr. 37; (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Chev. 9093; (114\plain \f1\super\lang