\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Seitenr\u228 \'e4nder bedeckt mit Exzerpten und Schemata. [I]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 n libro de moribus: Beate certe uiuere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 volumus omnes. Beatus autem nec ille dici potest qui non habet quod amat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\~; [M]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ulti multa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sciunt seipsos autem nesciunt alios inspiciunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\~; (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [A]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nima insignita dei imaginis decorata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 similitudine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\~; (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [P]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 recium est uidere deum, viuere cum deo, esse cum deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\~; [C]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vm ad orandum siue ad psallendum deo ecclesiam intras fluctuancium cogitacionum tumultum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 exterius relinque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\~; (11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Salomon in Prov< Os stulti pascitur imperitia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Prv 15,14) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 idest uacuitate et falsitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\~; (Am Rande:)\~ >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Super de virgine< Audi filia et uide et inclina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 aurem tuam et obliuisce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Ps 44,11).
