\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Expositio moralis< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Legitur in libro Genesi quod patriarcha Jacob}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  diligebat filium suum Joseph \u8230 \'85 vt in paschali festiuitate misterii corporis et sanguinis Christsi digne participes fieri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mereamur prestet dominus etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\~; (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Precepit dominus Salomoni regi facere \u8230 \'85 edificare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sibi domum in Jerusalem \u8230 \'85 in qua illius temporis populus sacrificetur et oblata offeretur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\~; (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [N]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vnc uidendum quibus gradibus a terra itur ad celum. Qui credit in unum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 deum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\~; (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sacerdotibus<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~ [P]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 er legem iudicas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\~?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sacerdotes. Scriptus est quoniam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iudicium durissimum hiis qui presunt fiet. Sap. VI\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (6) \u8230 \'85; (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De adventu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (am Rand)< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quando venit plenitudo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 temporis.  Adventus Christi dicitur plenitudo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\~; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Secunda de adventu< Hora est iam nos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 etc. Quatuor monet apostolus opera noctis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\~; (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item de eodem< Hora est ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Eccl. XXII\~: Hora surgendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\~; (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec frequenter meditata generant amorem dei< Quinque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sunt que si frequenter  et fideliter cogitantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\~?) \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et primum regnum ipsum queretis ut in ewangelio docet Jhesus Christus dominus noster qui est benedictus in secula. Amen. -\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De ligno scire bonum et malum ne comedas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Gn 2,17)< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prudencia carnis est lignum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sciencie boni et mali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\~; (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quatuor sunt peccata quorum clamor ascendit ad dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

