\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Non ita [oder\~: idem\~?] ordo est apud grecos}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  que integre sapiunt et fidem rectam sectantur epistola VII que canonice nuncupantur \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 nec sancti scripture hereditatem poscentibus denegabo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - Glossa ordinaria (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Quatuor fuerunt expositores super epistolas canonicas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Beda, Clemens, Didimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [J]acobus cognomento iustus filius Marie sororis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  matris domini post passionem ab apostolis Ierosolimorum ordinatus episcopus unam de VII epistolis canonicis scripsit \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 ultimam Adriani tytulum habuit notissimum. - Canonice dicuntur epistole uel quia in canone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ecclesiastice scripture recepte sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quia in circumcisione ordinatus erat, Jacobus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 apostolus curauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Catholice dicuntur hee epistole\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sub nominibus apostolorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
