\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Beginn des Bibeltextes: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jacobus dei ac domini nostri Jhesu Christi seruus XII tribubus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Iac 1,1).-  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glossa marginalis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Omne gaudium etc. (Iac 1,2). Ne indignemini si mali}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in mundo florent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85Etc. Endet (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) zu Iac 5,20: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Salvabit animam. Quidam codices habent: Saluabit animam suam a morte. Et uere quia qui errantem corrigit per hoc ampliora gaudia uite celestis acquirit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - PL 114, 680 B. - Glossa interlinearis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jacobus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jacobus. celebris  persona. Seruus. Officium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 celebre. XII tribubus. Non omnibus sed aliquibus de omnibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
