\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Temporibus quibus cepit ecclesia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quidam de gentilitate qui transierant ad iudaismum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hos confortat apostolus. Scripsit eis a Roma tempore Claudii cesaris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 l\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 11847. - (11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glossa marginalis\~: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Petrus apostolus Jhesu Christi electis aduenis (I Pt 1,1). Aduene latine grece proseliti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sic appellabant Judei illos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. Endet (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) zu I Pt 5,13: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 est in Babilone \u8230 \'85 in Babilone. Romam Babilonem uocat \u8230 \'85 non potest esse immunis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  PL 114, 679 B -688 D. -  (11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glossa interlinearis\~: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Petrus. Celebre nomen. Secundum dei prescientiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Non meritos sed quos presciuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85- (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod prenominatis ecclesiis scribo omnibus per\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 orbem terrarum ecclesiis scribo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
