\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Epistola prima Jacobi apostoli< Jacobus apostolus dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. - (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glossa marginalis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 A perfectioribus incipit de extrinsecis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  temptacionibus \u8230 \'85 Omne gaudium etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Iac 1,2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ne indignemini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 si mali in mundo florent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. Endet (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) zu Iac 5,20\~: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quidam codices habent:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Saluabit animam suam a morte \u8230 \'85 gaudia uite celestis sibi conquirit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - PL 114, 671 B \endash  680 B. - (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glossa interlinearis\~: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jacobus. Celebris  persona. Apostolus. Officium celebre. Duodecim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tribubus. Non omnibus sed aliquibus de omnibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. Endet (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) zu Iac 5,20: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 aspectu interni iudicis superstitione melioris uite abscondit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
