\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Epistola Petri apostoli< Petrus apostolus Jhesu Christi electis aduenis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Pt 1,1).- (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Temporibus quibus cepit ecclesia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quidam de gentilitate qui transierant ad iudaismum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hos confortat apostolus. Scripsit autem a Roma tempore Claudii cesaris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 11847\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glossa marginalis\~: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Aduenis electis (I Pt 1, 1) i. e. aduenis dispersis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jerosolimis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\~; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Aduene latine grece proseliti. Sic appellabant Judei illos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. Endet (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) zu I Pt 5,13: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Romam Babilonem vocat \u8230 \'85 non potest esse immunis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - PL 114, 679 C \endash  688 D. - (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glossa interlinearis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Petrus. Celebre nomen. Secundum prescientiam dei. Non meritis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed quos presciuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 - (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod prenominatis ecclesiis scribo omnibus per orbem terrarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ecclesiis scribo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
