\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Glossa marginalis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Simon (II Pt 1,1). Istam eisdem quibus et primam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  epistolam electis proselitis dispersionis \u8230 \'85 hereticis non cedant. Commendat personam scribentis.- Coequalis sibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cognoscit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85Etc. Endet (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) zu II Pt 3,16: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nullus veteris vel noui testamenti liber in quo heretici non aliquid  peruerterint \u8230 \'85 qualis huius palea de ecclesia tolluntur vnde ad suam ipsorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 traditionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - PL 114, 689 A \endash  694 C. - (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glossa interlinearis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Simon.Obediens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sc. fidei. Petrus. Agnoscens veritatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 - (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) zu II Pt 3,18\~: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Maxime cum diu desideratus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 uidebitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
