\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Scripserat Johannes evangelium aduersus dogmata}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hereticorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que inplentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pro caritate dei et proximi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - De \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bruyne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Pr\u233 \'e9faces S. 260 Nr. 12. - \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 811. - (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In principio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 epistole ad commendationem sermonis \u8230 \'85 quibus scribit insinuat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glossa marginalis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Quid fuit (I Io 1,1) in uero esse deitatis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quod audiuimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Etc. Endet (49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) zu I Io 5,21: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Custodite. Cum testimonium perfectionis in multis perhibuerit illis \u8230 \'85 mente retinuerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - PL 114, 693 D \endash  704 D. - (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glossa interlinearis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod fuit. In principio erat verbum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Io 1,1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed eundem in carne audierunt et uiderunt discipuli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85(49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) zu I Io 5,21: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 custodite uos a doctrinis hereticorum qui speciem sanctitatis sibi assumunt \u8230 \'85 qui etiam mundum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  deo \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 proponunt ydolatri sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . - Abweichend von \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 11849\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
