\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2. 74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Guilelmus Peraldus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Eruditionis religiosorum libri VI}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Incipit prologus in librum eruditionis religiosorum< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Erudire Jerusalem ne forte recedat anima mea a te \u8230 \'85 Jeremie VIo (8). Jerusalem 2m nominis interpretationem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  que est pacifica uel visio pacis specialiter significat religionem que intendit paci pectoris \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ego in ordine fratrum predicatorum minimus de benignitate saluatoris non de propriis viribus confidens presens opus ad dei gloriam et humilium profectum compilare volui \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ; (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Primus liber diuiditur in quatuor partes \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Capitulatio libri primi: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Incipiunt capitula que sunt XV< Prima pars \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Etc. \endash  Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Incipit liber eruditionis religiosorum, prima pars huius libri de gratia in educatione de seculo facta. Capitulum primum< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Qui gratiam acceptam non agnoscit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 Item Bernhardus loquens de celesti ciuitate: O ciuitas celestis \u8230 \'85 O quam gloriosa dicta sunt de te ciuitas dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  Unmittelbar anschlie\u223 \'dfend eine Aufz\u228 \'e4hlung s\u228 \'e4mtlicher Kapitel des Gesamtwerkes, nach Kapiteln geordnet. \endash  182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Hain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  12394. \endash  Vgl. Th. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Scriptores Ordinis Praedicatorum medii aevi. Bd. 2. Rom 1970 Nr. 1625.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \par}

