\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2. 292\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -295\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Varia ex iure canonico}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Ohne \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Item nota de modo obseruandi interdicti quodlibet memoriale pro similibus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sciendum est quod quando vniuersitas, populus, ciuitas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  locus vel terra est ecclesiastico interdicto supposita \u8230 \'85;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (293\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Questio de pollutione nocturna< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Vtrum nocturna pollutio inpediat communionem seu celebrationem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Responditur secundum sanctum Thomam in 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  di. q. Ad hoc ut homo digne accedat ad sacramentum eukaristie tria requiruntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; (293\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Missa celebraturus sex consideret< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Ad missam celebrandam sex considero attendenda}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Primum rationis distinctio respectu veritatis vt sciat quid quis recipere debeat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; (294\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Dictum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Beda Venerabilis< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sacerdos qui est sine peccato mortali}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  et in bono proposito si non celebrauerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 De fructibus missae: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Secuntur duodecim fructus misse< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Ecce ego vobiscum sum \u8230 \'85 Mt 28 (20). Johannes de sancto Geminiano dicit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : Sicut corpus nichil ualet sine societate anime ex eo quod caret vita naturali attestante Aristotele primo De anima \u8230 \'85
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (295\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) De donis spiritus sancti: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Apprehendent 7}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17\cf1 tem}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1  mulieres virum vnum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  in die illa dicentes: panem nostrum comedemus et vestimentis nostris operiemur tantummodo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 nomen tuum invocetur super nos aufer obprobrium nostrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ysae 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beatus doctor ecclesie Gregorius inter cetera sic ait: Quociens sacra eloquia nobis talia verba proferunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  virginem beatam deuote salutemus dicentes ei mente serena: Aue Maria gratia plena etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  (295\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Introductio sermonis< Gratianus in quadam epistola, dispensanda est predicatio pro loco et tempore et auditorum capacitate quasi rara fuerit non sufficit si assidua vilescit etc. \u8230 \'85 Apprehendent 7tem mulieres virum vnum \u8230 \'85 (Is 4,1). Venerabiles in Christo et deuoti patres, scribit nobis \u8230 \'85 beatus Gregorius in Moralibus \u8230 \'85 nomine 7\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 tem\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  dona spiritus sancti denominatur sibi.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  296\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -298\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.}

