\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Dominica quinta ante natiuitatem domini. Lect. sancti ewangelii secundum Johannem< In illo tempore: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Cum subleuasset oculos Jhesus \u8230 \'85 (Jo 6, 5). Et reliqua. >Omelia Heimonis de eadem lectione< Quoties legimus dominum ex paucis panibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 Oculi enim domini in scripturis duplicem habent significationem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Bis hierher bei PL als Hom. CXL abgedruckt. Fortsetzung in Hom. XLIX (= PL 118, 287 A): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Aliquando enim dona spiritus sancti significant \u8230 \'85 venturus est iudicans de viuis ac mortuis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Hom. I (= PL 118, 11 B); (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) II; (171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) III; (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) VII; (177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) IX \endash  XII; (193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) XIV; (204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) XV bricht ab (207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) mit: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 designauit dicens per Micheam: Et tu Bethleem in terra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  // (= PL 118, 112 C). Rest der Spalte und Versoseite leer. 208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Fortsetzung der Homilie (PL 118, 113 D) mit: // \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 esset uoce patris audiuit: Oportet te fili gaudere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Hom. XIII; (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) XVII; (217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) XVI; (220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) XVIII; (228\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) XIX; (235\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Hom. XX geteilt. 1. H\u228 \'e4lfte endet: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Declinate a me, maligni, et scrutabor mandata dei mei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Ps 128). Die 2. H\u228 \'e4lfte als eigene Homilie (237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ): >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Item secundum Matheum< In illo tempore: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Ascendente Jhesu in nauiculam \u8230 \'85 (Mt 8, 23). >Omelia Heimonis de eadem lectione< Solet enim in scripturis sacris }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 eorum malignitatibus non adherent.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (PL 118, 147 B- 150 B und 150 B- 154 B). \endash  (240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) XXXIV; (270\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) XXXV; (271\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) XLII (etwas abgewandelter Schluss: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 non auditor obliviosus factus sed factor operis: Hic beatus in regno suo erit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ); (280\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) XLIX (kleiner Zusatz 287\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -288\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ); (288\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) LVI: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica quinta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [in quadragesima] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 lectio sancti euangelii secundum Johannem > In illo tempore: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Dicebat Jhesus turbis Judeorum \u8230 \'85(Jo 8, 46) >Omelia Heimonis de eodem lectione< Postquam dominus Judeos conuicit }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 Qui enim corporaliter homo inter alios homines se abscondit, homo uerus est.. \endash  >Explicit hyemale domini Heimonis. Deo gratias. Anno domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  XXXII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 <. \endash  295\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -303\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer. }

