\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Incipiunt interpretationes hebreorum nominum interpretante sancto Hieronimo< Aadat apprehendens uel apprehensio / Aad testificans uel testimonium / \u8230 \'85Zvzim consiliantes eos uel consiliatores eorum. \endash  Expliciunt interpretaciones nominum hebreorum etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  Autorschaft ungekl\u228 \'e4rt. \endash  465\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Besitzeintrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Matheus Marschalcus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 canonicus Augustensis XV\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 c\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 XXIX\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  Familienwappen, dar\u252 \'fcber \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 M M\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  465\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.
