\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Incipit liber sancti Augustini de doctrina christana<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Prologus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sunt praecepta quaedam tractandarum scripturarum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  quae studiosis earum video non incommode posse tradi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Liber primus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Duae sunt res quibus nititur omnis trac[ta]tio scripturarum\u8230 \'85 >Liber primus Aurelii Augustini de doctrina christana explicit<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit liber secundus< Quoniam de rebus cum scriberem premisi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit de doctrina Christiana liber secundus. Deo gratias<.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit liber tertius de eadem re< Homo timens deum uoluntatem eius in scriptures sanctis diligenter inquirit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit liber tertius de doctrina Christiana. Amen<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Fol. 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  enth\u228 \'e4lt nur die letzten 5 Zeilen des Buches. Der Rest des Bl. ist herausgeschnitten.
