033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tabula sermonum de dedicatione templi.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tabula super sermones per quadragesimam.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  (216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tabula de exemplis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et sic est finis huius libri.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  Schreiberschlussschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qui ego virginum mihi | finem facito tutum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
