\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Thomas de Aquino: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Contra errores Graecorum ad preces papae Urbani editus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Liber contra errores grecorum. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >L<Ibellum ab excellentia uestra mihi exhibitum, sanctissime pater Urbane papa}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , diligenter perlegi ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... uel que ad fidei assertionem utilia esse possent, sed ad ea que premissa sunt, credo, fere omnia possunt reduci. Explicit.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Sancti Thomae Aquinatis Opera omnia (Leonina) 40A, Rom 1968, S. 21, Nr. 20, S. 36 f., \u167 \'a7 29, S. 38 f., \u167 \'a7 32 (Stellung der Hs. im stemma codicum), S. 71-105 (Ed.).}

