\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24    Thomas de Aquino: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Expositio in Symbolum Apostolorum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jncipit simbolum expositum a fratre Thoma de Aquino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >C<Redo in unum Deum. Primum quod est necessarium christiano cuilibet}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , est fides, sine qua nullus dicitur uere christianus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vnde et signanter in fine omnium ponitur: uitam eternam, ut semper magis memorie imprimatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Apostolisches Glaubensbekenntnis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In summa sciendum est, quod secundam quosdam sunt duodecim articuli fidei, sex de diuinitate, scilicet quod unus Deus in essentia et ideo dicit: Credo in unum Deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 jnde uenturus iudicare uiuos et mortuos. Explicit simbolum.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Sancti Thomae Aquinatis Opera omnia (Leonina) 44, in Vorbereitung. \endash  P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mandonnet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sancti Thomae Aquinatis opuscula omnia 4. Paris 1927, S. 349-388.}

