\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24    Thomas de Aquino: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 De articulis Fidei et Ecclesiae sacramentis ad archiepiscopum Panormitanum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jncipit summa edita a fratre Thoma de Aquino de articulis fidei et ecclesie Sacramentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >P<Ostulabat a me uestra dilectio ut de articulis fidei et ecclesie sacramentis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  aliqua uobis compendiose pro memoriali transcriberem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 secundum illud\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Corinthiorum xv: \u8250 \'9bSeminatur corpus animale, surget corpus spirituale\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Cor 15,44). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad quam gloriam perducat nos pater et filius et spiritus sanctus. Amen. Explicit.
