\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jncipit liber de perfectione spiritualis uite editus a fratre Thoma de Aquino ordinis predicatorum. Capitulum primum. Que sit auctoritatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 intentio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Q<Voniam quidam perfectionis ignari, de perfectionis statu uana quedam dicere presumpserunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 aperitur ueritas et falsitas confutatur, secundum illud Salomonis: \u8250 \'9bFerrum ferro acuitur, et uir exacuit faciem amici sui\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Prv 27,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
