\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jncipit Liber contra inpugnantes Dei cultum et religionem. Capitulum primum. Quidam sit actoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 intentio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  (220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kapitelverzeichnis. \endash  (220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus primus. Capitulum primum. Prohemium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >E<Cce inimici tui sonuerunt, et qui te oderunt, extulerunt caput ... (Ps 82, 3-5). Omnipotens deus amator hominum suo amore nobis utitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Super populum tuum malignauerunt consilium; et cogitauerunt aduersus sanctos tuos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut per eos pluribus possunt proficere ad salutem; et nisi hoc facerent, essent merito arguendi. Vnde dicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || [Textabbruch: endet c. 19, \u167 \'a7 3].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
