\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Jacobus Ziegler}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 De solemni festo paschae ad veteres collatio}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Dedicatio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Videri plerisque possim, ne negocium a nemine ex me praesens postulatum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , ultro autem quasi quaesitum, inquo disputarem sumpsisse mihi proptereaque praeteriri a lectore, ut superuacuum posse \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 per quae coronidem proprium libellum, cuius sententia confirmata haberetur ex superiorum tractatione.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pars prima. Moses Exodi duodecimo< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Loquimini ad vniuersum coetum filiorum Israel}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Ex 12, 3). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Paulo post: Et seruabitis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  eum  vsque ad quartam decimam diem mensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Ex 12, 6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sequitur. Sequitur: Habebitis \u8230 \'85 nullumque seruile opus facietis in eo. >Anatholium< Est ergo in primo anno initium primi mensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85- (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Pars tercia. Coronis< Lvnae quartae decimae mensis primi obseruandae religio non minor sit christianis quam Judeis fuit. Christi enim passi et resurgentis memoria \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hic si nihil aliud contulerim certe posuerim in considerationem, num alia ratio qualis est explicata sequenda a motu lunae et hebdomada azymorum potius videatur.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Druck: Jacobi Ziegleri Landaui conceptionem in Genesim mundi et Exodum commentarii. Basileae apud Joannem Oporinum, 1548. S. 179-224. Nach eigenh\u228 \'e4ndigem Besitzvermerk in dem Exemplar der BSB geh\u246 \'f6rte dieses 1574 dem Augsburger Canoniker Johann Georg von Werdenstein.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \par}

