\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Collectio sermonum Piper}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  unten) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Salue virgo regia nobili prosapia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[20].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >S<imili pena seruus cum domino est afflictus. Sapiencie xv (Sap 18,11). Modo filius dei condolens humano generi vexillum sancte crucis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in medio mundi constituit, ut ad hoc signum dispersi et a deo diuisi congregarentur et a dyabolo eruerentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et quia sic similis fuit, christo in pena iustum fuit, ut similaretur sibi in gloria. Rogemus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Repertorium 4, S. 564, Nr. 195. \endash  Weitere Predigten, z. T. mit abweichendem Textschluss: Nr. 196-202. \endash  (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De sancto Nicolao: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Idem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >A<ffer manum tuam et mitte in latus meum etc. (Io 20,27). Benigni homines et amici habent modum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , unde uident aliquem ex caris amicis suis cecidisse in aliquam passionem, solent eos instruere, quomodo euaderent suam passionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quomodo omni anno in festo ipsius communicat omnis sine mortalibus peccatis existentibus. Rogemus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Parallelhs.: Innsbruck, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Cod. 71}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Nr. 203-205. \endash  (11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De sancto Iohanne evangelista: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iohannis ewangeliste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >D<Ilectus meus et ego illi. Cantice ii\u176 \'b0 (Ct 2,16). Uerba ista possunt esse christi loquentis ad beatum Johannem ewangelistam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quia Johannes speciali amore dilectionis iunctus fuit christus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 recedente autem luce fouea plena manna inuenitur. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Vgl. Nr. 113 und Innsbruck, UB, Cod. 71, 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Nr. 206, 207 (expl. 13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  mit Textzusatz: ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut uicissitudinem amicicie christo proposse suo redderet. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \endash  Nr. 208, 209 (expl. 14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 legitur de ipsis: figebant gladios in guttura eorum, ridebant: \u8250 \'9bSic et tu secundum et tercium membrum collige etc\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rogemus dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .) \endash  Nr. 210-212, 213 (expl. 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 sed gaudium celi numquam terminatur, ad quod nos perducat, qui uiuit et regnat in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .) \endash  (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De sancto Paulo: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pauli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >C<onuertimini ad me in toto corde uestro. Iohelis ii\u176 \'b0 (Ioel 2,12). Dominus ostendit nobis bonitatem suam in quatuor}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Primum est, quod rogat nos conuerti, secundum, quod omni hora paratus est recipere penitentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et bene ostendit dicit: Conuertemini ergo ad dominum, ut numquam ab eo separemur. Rogemus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vgl. Innsbruck, UB, Cod. 71, 35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Nr. 214, 215 (expl. 18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut uno die liceret uel maneret in regno celorum. Hoc aduertit beatus paulus et conuertit se ad dominum et secutus est dominum et ab eo suscepit gloriam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (expungiert) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 coronam uite eterne. Oremus sanctum paulum, ut pro nobis oret ad dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .) Vgl. Innsbruck, UB, Cod. 71, 38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Nr. 216 (expl. 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 legitur de ipso, quando decollaretur quid faceret, lac loco sanguinis de corde suo manauisset. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \endash  Nr. 217 (expl. 20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quando non offenditur ipsam pacem et ueniam obtinet peccatori impetrando\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dic exemplum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rogemus dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .) \endash  Nr. 218, 219. \endash  (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In purificatione BMV: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Idem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >EC<ce mitto angelum meum, qui preparabit viam ante faciem meam etc. Matthei iii\u176 \'b0 (Mt 11,10). In uerbis istis quattuor notantur. Primum est, quod deus dedit (expungiert) dicit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : \u8250 \'9bEcce ego mitto angelum meum etc.\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut nos cum illo et ipse nobiscum usque in finem perseueret. Rogemus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vgl. Innsbruck, UB, Cod. 71, 45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Nr. 220, 221, 124 (expl. 24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et eum dominus in uirtute miraculorum hic potes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dicere miracula si placet. Rogemus dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .) Vgl. Innsbruck, UB, Cod. 71, 49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Nr. 222-224, 126 (expl. 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 unde licet me non uideas, tamen sum semper circa te, ecce quanta felicitas. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Vgl. Innsbruck, UB, Cod. 71, 53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Nr. 127 (expl. 28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et intrauit aliud desertum, ubi incognitus hominibus mansit et ideo bene dicitur de eo, qui fuit domino dilectus et hominibus. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Vgl. Innsbruck, UB, Cod. 71, 55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Nr. 226-233, 129 (expl. 35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia mihi spiritus sanctus in hoc indicauit uel reuelauit, quod et sic factum est et sic patet, quoniam exaltatus fuit in penitentia. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \endash  Nr. 234 (expl. 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  mit Zusatz: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 liberauit a dracone cum viginti milibus, qui conuersi sunt ad dominum. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \endash  (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[17].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >N<Otandum est, quod lacrima procedens de oculis deuoti cordis quatuor bona facit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Primo intrat potenter ante aspectum domini et reconciliat deo peccatorem quam prius propter peccata sua deus dampnare diposuerat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et extingwit jehennam participem, facit omnium bonorum operum, ascendit usque ad celos, descendit usque ad infernum et sic peccatorem reconciliauit. Rogemus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  Nr. 235, 131, 132 (expl. 39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et quia ipsum dilexit tota trinitas merito et nos ipsum debemus diligere, quia potest nos mundare in corde et anima. Vnde rogemus beatum marcum, ut pro nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .) \endash  Nr. 236 (expl. 40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sic predicacio beati marci dicit Ewangelium eius multos, qui curtauerunt uiam deserti huius mundi et reduxunt. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \endash  Nr. 237 (expl. 40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 deinde statutum est ab ecclesia et firmatum, ut hec letania generaliter obseruetur. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \endash  Nr. 134 (expl. 41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et quia istis duobus modis stetuerunt coram domino in die iudicii, stabunt contra peccatores in magna constantia. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \endash  Nr. 238, 239 (expl. 42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et hoc figuratum est in hester: nullus enim potuerit introire ante regem nisi uestitus regia ueste. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \endash  Nr. 136, 240, 241, 137 (expl. 45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et sic consules et pontifices credentes cum omni potentia apostolus baptizauit et sic patet eius triplex martirium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .) \endash  Nr. 242, 140 (expl. 46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et ibidem eum protinus combussiuerit et sic amiciciam dei consecutus est. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \endash  Nr. 243 (expl. 47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ille autem ab angelo solutus iuxta quendam fluuium se inuenit et ibi orans anima deo reddidit. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \endash  Nr. 244 (expl. 47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quando ista concupiscat, vnde si uis ista consequi, tunc imiteris doctrinam sancti Johannis et fac penitentiam de peccatis tuis. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \endash  Johannes Contractus, Sermones de sanctis, De sancto Iohanne baptista. Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Repertorium 3, S. 441, Nr. 111 (expl. 48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tamen magni esse dicuntur aput dominum propter passionem quam pro christo sustinuerunt uoluntarie. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \endash  Nr. 245 (inc. 48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Erit magnus coram domino etc. Luce (Lc 1,15). Nota quod angelus gabriel commendat eum a duobus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Primo commendat eum a magnis operibus, que fecit deus cum ipso et antequam nasceretur in hunc mundum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 ). \endash  (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De sancto Iohanne baptista: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Idem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Erit magnus coram domino etc. (Lc 1,15). Luce 1\u176 \'b0 verbibus Johannes magnus dicitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quia eius conceptio fuit miraculosa, nam de senioribus et sterilibus parentibus ortus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 vox amatoria, ut ibi quibus duas tunicas etc. Vox certificata, ut ibi nam enim securius ad radicem est posita, scilicet arboris. Expone. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \endash  Nr. 247-249. \endash  (52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De sancto Procopio abbate Pragensi: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Procopii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[19].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >O<ptaui et datus est michi sensus, uocaui et uenit in me spiritus sapientie. Sapiencie (Sap 7,7). Uerba ista applicantur beato procopio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , de quibus gloriatur dicens \u8250 \'9boptaui\u8249 \'8b id est rogaui, \u8250 \'9bsensum\u8249 \'8b id est sapientiam, non sapientiam, que pertinet ad gloriam huius mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et de sancto procopio legitur, quod fratribus suis predixit mortem suam, debebat expelli de monasterio sicut dictum. De quo legitur, quod quicumque inuocauerit nomen domini, saluus erit. Et de sancto procopio: Quicumque ipsum inuocauerit, pure exaudietur, quibus patre dignetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Nr. 250 (expl. 54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 item ad spiritus confortationem per doctrinam, quia per suam doctrinam multos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in fide confortauit et conuertit ad dominum etc. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \endash  Nr. 252. \endash  (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In diuisione apostolorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >E<stote ergo prudentes sicut serpentes et simplices sicut columbe (Mt. 10,16). Docuit noster dominus discipulos suos simplicitatem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , ut essent simplices sicut collumbe \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 o homo, taliter debes facere in voluminibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , ubi debes hesitare, ubi omnes sancti habitant, illuc nos perducat pater et filius et spiritus sanctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Nr. 253-256. \endash  Sermones anonymi de tempore, De Maria Magdalena. Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Repertorium 8, S. 560, Nr. 116. Parallelhs.: M\u252 \'fcnchen, BSB, Clm 2631 (expl. 59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sequamur nos fratres hanc mulierem, quantum possimus, ut ad non hanc gratiam sicut et ipsam et in celo gloriam consecuta fuit. Ad quod nos perducat. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \endash  Nr. 257-259, 148 (expl. 61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que sanctus Jacobus dixerat, intimauit: Ecce quomodo christus sanctum Jacobum in miraculis decorauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .) \endash  (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancta anna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[21].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >U<irgam uirtutis tue emitte<t> dominus ex syon. Psalmi (Ps 109,2). Gloriosa presentis diei festiuitatem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , qua beata anna genitricis dei marie mater sanctissima de terris transiuit ad celi pallatia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in iocunda mentis deuocione et cordis sinceritate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sicut enim de monte descendit in valles ros et pluuia sic ab utero gloriose huius domine descendit ros lucis gratie scilicet maria ad nos peccatores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Nr. 261 (expl. 62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 o quali tripudio omnem celestem illam ierusalem credendum est ineffabiliter iubilando hodie exultasset. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \endash  Nr. 262-267 (expl. 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de peccatore illo, qui locutus fuit cum dyabolo, qui negauit fidem christianam et passionem domini, sed mariam negare noluit. Responsio supra. Et ideo rogemus dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .) \endash  (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De assumptione sancte Marie: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Idem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Legimus quod rex salomon fecit sibi thronum de ebore grandem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et uestiuit eum auro purissimo et per ui gradus ascendebat ad eum, quatuor collumpne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pure argentee erant, que tronum sustentabant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 rogamus te mater, ut benedicas operibus nostris, ut per hoc acquiramus mercedem eternam. Rogemus ergo dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Idem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Nota quod christus fuit cum matre sua in triplici statu suo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : dum esset in matris utero, ipsam sanctificauit, dum ueniret in mundo, ipsam ab omni peccato confirmauit, dum recederet de mundo, ipsam tantam gloriosam et illuminosam infecit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ecce sapor totum mundum delectauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Nr. 268-274. \endash  (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De sancto Egidio: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Egydii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >E<vge serue bone et fidelis, intra in gaudium domini tui etc. (Mt 25,21). Luce. Nota qui wult fidelis esse deo eius, ut sis fidelis in tribus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , in quibus sanctus egydius fidelitatem domino conseruauit. Primo est seruanda domino fidelitas in promisso, ut soluamus, quod in baptismo domino promisimus siue preter baptismum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ubi choros\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  angelorum eius animam in celum feruencium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  testati sunt, quam plurima modulamina audiuisse. Rogemus ergo ipsum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Nr. 275-283 (expl. 80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 o quanta largitas fuit in ipso, quod non tamen res sed etiam corpus suum largiebatur pro domino duo. Rogemus dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .) \endash  Nr. 284-285. \endash  (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De archangelo Michaele: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Idem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[18].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Omnes enim sunt administratorii spiritus. Hebreorum ii\u176 \'b0 (Hbr 1,14). Hodie agamus festum omnium angelorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et propter plures causas. Primo, quia singulariter omnis hono<ra>re non possumus, isto die omnis simul honores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et decore mundissima est egressa, quam suscipientes angeli deduxerunt ipsam ad celum cum cantu angelorum et inter choros angelorum et martirum ipsam collocauerunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Nr. 286-299. \endash  (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De animabus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 M}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 <}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 ittite partes eis qui non preparauit sibi. Esdre}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 (IIEsr 8,10). }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Consuetudo est in mundo, quando aliquis usque ad mortem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in carcere cruciatur, mittit ad amicos suos dilectissimos, quibus maxime considit, aliquem fidelem nuncium, ut si inter omnes aliquis sit, qui misericorditer succurrat et ei aliquid maxime in sua necessitate transmittat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 uiuebat in paradysum, id est in celum, et sic patet, ut oraciones prosint illis, qui sunt in purgatorio. Rogemus ergo dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Repertorium 5, S. 432, Nr. 49; 8, S. 705, Nr. 50; 9, S. 535, Nr. 59, dort mit weiteren Parallelhss. \endash  (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >De animabus<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >M<iseremini et etc. Job (Job 19,21). Nota in honore penitencie pro tanto debemus iuuare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres nostros exemplo christi, qui penitencia peccatorum nostrorum portauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quam ipsi facient pro adiutoribus, qua ualerent oraciones omnium adiutorum pro eis facte. Vnde rogemus dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >De animabus<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[16].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >N<Ota quod uii dona dat deus anime sancte}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Prima die mortis dat sibi donum, quod pascit eam pane et sanguine corporis sui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vii\u176 \'b0 coronat eam in reginam. Psalmus: Qui coronat in misericordia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 102,4). \endash  (90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De animabus: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Idem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >G<audere cum gaudentibus, flere cum flentibus (Rm 12,15). Apostolus aperte et congrue conclusit nobis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in hiis uerbis beatus paulus fletus hodie, enim legitur ewangelium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de nupciis carnalibus, in que homines scilicet consueuerunt gaudere et hec nupcie signant nobis celestes nupcias, in que anime eternaliter gaudebunt cum christo sponso suo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut libarentur ieiuniis, oracionibus et eleemosynis, missis et dicit beatus gregorius: \u8250 \'9bQuod non est accepcius sacrificium deo communia spiritualium animarum\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Vgl. Cassiodorus Vivariensis, Expositio in psalterium, ed. PL 70, 369). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Unde orate dominum etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Nr. 301. \endash  (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De sancto Martino. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Idem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 E}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 <}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Cce sacerdos magnus, qui in diebus suis placuit deo etc. Sapiencie}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  (Sir 44,16). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 In propositis uerbis duo debemus notare de beato martino}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Primo dicitur de episcopo, quod temporibus suis fuit magnus in officii dignitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 beatus uero martinus fuit speculum subditorum suorum, quia fuit paciens et pudicus, meruit a domino audire: \u8250 \'9bEuge serue bone et fidelis\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 25,21). \endash  Nr. 302-307. \endash  (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >In dedicatione<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >E<t querebat uidere ihesum etc. (Lc 19,3). Ista uerba, que proposui, ea sunt Luce in hodierno ewangelio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de uno Judeo, qui uocabatur zacheus et nimium desiderabat uidere filium dei, sed \u8250 \'9bnon poterat prae turba, quia statura pusillus erat\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut si aliquid peccatum in corde nostro sic purgemus, illud per bonam operam, id est per ueram confessionem et ueram penitenciam. Rogemus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In dedicatione ecclesie: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Idem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >E<xcepit illum in domum suam gaudens. Luce xix (Lc 19,6). In istis uerbis tria notantur: Primo quod excepit eum, ii\u176 \'b0 ubi excepit, iii\u176 \'b0 qualiter excepit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Primo, quem excepit, quia ihesus christus saluator noster interpretatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 unde ipse dominus per Ieremiam dicit, \u8250 \'9bquid est hic dilectus meus in domo mea, facit scelera multa\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ier 11,15), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 talem ihesus christus contempnit ingredi, ubi sic expellitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || (Textabbruch). \endash  (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Schlussschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota quod iste liber inceptus est in XL, qua die canitur \u8250 \'9bsalus populi\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (=26. Februar 1383) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et finitus est post de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (expungiert) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 diem sancti Georgii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (23. April 1383) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 per manus Capitis de harawycz siue de Strakonycz anno domini M\u176 \'b0C\u176 \'b0C\u176 \'b0C\u176 \'b0lxxxiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Vgl. Colophons 1, S. 308, Nr. 2459 (mit falscher Lesung).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Im bayerischen Raum ist diese Predigtreihe unter dem Namen \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Flores de sanctis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  verbreitet. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium, S. 558-560, Nr. 113-148, S. 564-572, Nr. 195-307. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Beobachtungen, S. 21. \endash  Beschreibung der Parallelhs.: Katalog der Handschriften der Universit\u228 \'e4tsbibliothek Innsbruck. Beschrieben von W. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Neuhauser\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Teil 1. Cod. 1-100; Katalogbd., Registerbd. und lose Tafeln. Wien 1987. (Ver\u246 \'f6ffentlichungen der Kommission f\u252 \'fcr Schrift- und Buchwesen des Mittelalters: Reihe 2, Verzeichnisse der Handschriften \u246 \'f6sterreichischer Bibliotheken 4, 1 = \u214 \'d6sterreichische Akademie der Wissenschaften; Philosophisch-historische Klasse. Denkschriften 192), S. 214 f. \endash  Zu den unterschiedlichen Titelfassungen vgl. Lateinische mittelalterliche Handschriften in Folio der Universit\u228 \'e4tsbibliothek Augsburg: Die Signaturengruppe Cod.I.2.2\u176 \'b0 und Cod.II.1.2\u176 \'b0 1-90. Beschrieben von G. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u228 \'e4\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 gele\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Wiesbaden 1996 (Die Handschriften der Universit\u228 \'e4tsbibliothek Augsburg: Reihe 1. Die lateinischen Handschriften 1), S. 125.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

