\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Johannes Zinccius}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 De potestate daemonum , maleficorum et sagarum}}
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Praefatio doctissimi viri domini Johannis Zinccii<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1   (\u220 \'dcberschrift am Rande: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Satanae cum humano genere inimicitia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Etsi Christus saluator noster gloriosissima passione et crucis signo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  serpentis antiqui caput ita contriuerit, ut iam nihil potestatis in dei dilectis habeat penitus nisi quantum a deo ad electorum suorum bonum et incrementum ipsi conceditur, non tamen cessat Draco ille scelestus subinde caput erigere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >De quatuor hominum generibus quae se daemoni obstringunt, manifesto uel occulto pacto uel etiam prudentes. Caput primum< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Quatuor sunt hominum genera quae daemonis astu circumuenti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , se eius ministerio uel sua sponte, uel nescientes uel incauti se emancipant \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Es folgen 48 Kapitel. Das letzte (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >An sagae sint comburendae. Caput quadragesimum octauum< Hic uero ingens oritur etiam inter doctores rixa, an sagae sint comburendae. Exurgunt enim multi boni uiri zelo dei commoti aduersus sagas \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 Atque utinam corpora solum igne consumerentur animaeque Jesu Christo miserante, hoc igne purgatae saluae fierent. Quod faciat ille qui potens est omnes seruare a peccato immunes et statuere in conspectu gloriae suae incontaminatos. Cui soli seruatori ac redemtori nostro gloria, laus et magnificentia nunc et in imni saecula. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.}

