\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -296\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Augustinus Triumphus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Summa de potestate ecclesiastica}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -296\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >S<Anctissimo in Christo et Reuerendissimo patri et domino, Domino Johanni}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , sempiterna prouidentia pape xii frater Augustinus de Anchona ordinis heremitarum fratrum sancti Augustini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cum uoluntate ergo recta et justa faciat nos eternus Judex in suo conspectu presentari, ut saciemur eum apparuerit nobis gloria eius, que est benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (296\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Schlussschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Finitus est liber iste per manus fratris Johannis Hunnsheim ordinis fratrum heremitarum sancti Augustini pro tunc lectoris Friburgi oetlandie anno Domini M\u176 \'b0 cccc\u176 \'b0 xxxvij\u176 \'b0 quinta mensis Junii, que fuit quarta feria infra octavam corporis Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Aue mater, aue qua mundus soluitur, aue}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Que genitricis eue ue fecit esse breue.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Uerte folium et inuenies tabulam materie et questionum libri diligenter quotatam.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Stand uff gang essen, e\u223 \'df ist ymbi\u223 \'df zit, man rufth dir}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur tabula de ecclesiastica potestate.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW 3050, a2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -Z6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Lit.:\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , GQ 2, S. 1943-195 (diese Hs. S. 194, Anm. 1). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RC, Nr. 987,1 \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zumkeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Manuskripte, S. 77 f., Nr. 141, S. 244, Nr. 513 (dort auch als \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Huversheim?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  bezeichnet). \endash  LexMA 1, Sp. 1230. \endash  D. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schwenzer,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Summa de potestate ecclesiastica, in: Lexikon der theologischen Werke. Hrsg. von M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Eckert\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , E. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Herms\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  B. J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hilberath\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  und E. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 J\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ngel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Stuttgart 2003, S. 675.
