\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo de epyphania domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [S]Ignum magnum apparuit in celo (Apc 12,1). Apocalipsis xii\u176 \'b0. Beatus Bernhardus sermone 3\u176 \'b0 huius festiuitatis dicit sic}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Sollempnitas huius diei ab aparicione nomine accepit \u8250 \'9bEpyphania\u8249 \'8b, quippe apparicio est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 agnoscamus itaque in ipsum, per quem facta sunt tempora et celebrantes eius festa temporalia premia desideramus eterna, que nobis prestare dignetur, qui viuit et regnat deus per omnia secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lit.: P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schmitz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Les Sermons et discours de Cl\u233 \'e9ment VI., O.S.B., in: Rev. B\u233 \'e9n. 41 (1929), S. 15-34, ebd. S. 31, Nr. 70.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

