\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Thomas Ebendorfer von Haselbach}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Sermones V de passione domini}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [A]Nte diem festum pasce sciens Jhesus, quia venit hora eius etc (Io 13,1) \u8230 \'85 Crisostomus super Johannem tractans illud Johannis 10}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : \u8250 \'9bEt facta sunt encenia Jerosolimis et yemps erat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 si tu es Christus, dic nobis palam\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Io 10,22-24). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dicit omnibus, quod virtus homini bona maxime autem mansuetudo et humilitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut te digne collaudare nunc et in euum per interminabilia secula. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 2: [E]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gressus Jhesus cum discipulis suis trans torrentem Cedron\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Io 18,1) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sapiens ecclesiastes 3\u176 \'b0 dicit, quod omnia tempora tempus habent: \u8250 \'9bEst tempus flendi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (vgl. Ecl 3,2-4) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut purificati tibi propinquare et omnibus diebus vite nostre in gloria habitare. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 3: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur alius sermo in cena domini et in die parasceue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [S]Ciens Jhesus, quia venit hora eius \u8230 \'85 (Io 13,1) \u8230 \'85 Dominus Jhesus christus, dominus et magister noster, preciosum nostre redempcionis precium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vt purificati tibi propinquare et tecum in gloria habitare concedere digneris. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 4: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [L]Icet quilibet homo innumera receperit a deo beneficia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Pro quibus tenetur, deo gracias agere, ipsum diligere, ipsum totis precordiis amare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed eas facias distillare super nos miseros peccatores prestante domino nostro Jhesu Christo pro nobis hodie passo, qui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cum deo patre et sancto spiritu viuit et regnat in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 5: (im Fu\u223 \'dfsteg) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur residuum de passione domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [N]Vlli fidelium sane intelligenti dubium est, quin loqui deuocius de morte}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ideo dicit \u8250 \'9bSaxum magnum\u8249 \'8b, quod secundum Jeronimum ostendit non absque auxilio plurimorum sepulchrum potuisse veserari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vielm. reserari). \endash  116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Sermones 1-3 aus dem in der Pfarrei Perchtoldsdorf gehaltenen Predigtzyklus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Sermones de evangeliis de tempore (pars hiemalis)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , sermones 4-5 aus dem Predigtzyklus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Sermones de epistolis de tempore (pars hiemalis)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Zu sermo 4 vgl. auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lhotsky\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 72, Nr. 21. \endash  Parallelhs.: M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat18 2\u176 \'b0 Cod.ms. 134a}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -249\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Druck: Sermo 4: Thomas Ebendorfer, Sermones dominicales super epistulas Pauli. [Stra\u223 \'dfburg: Heinrich Knoblochtzer], P. 1: 1478 = BSB-Ink E-2,2, Bl. H3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -I5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Sermo 5: ebd. Bl. I5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -L2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lhotsky\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 75, Nr. 38,I (s. Nr. 2). \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Uiblein\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \u178 \'b2VL 2 (1980), Sp. 254-266, ebd. Sp. 255f., Nr. I.2. \endash  A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Haidinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / F. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lackner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Verzeichnis der Textanf\u228 \'e4nge zu den \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Sermones de epistolis de tempore. Pars hiemalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Wien 1991, Online-Ressource: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "http://www.ksbm.oeaw.ac.at/serm/th_eb/teephi.htm"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat19\cf1 http://www.ksbm.oeaw.ac.at/serm/th_eb/teephi.htm}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr. TEEPHI 053. T 26, TEEPHI 054. T 26. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., Verzeichnis der Textanf\u228 \'e4nge zu den \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Sermones de evangeliis de tempore. Pars hiemalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Online-Ressource: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "http://www.ksbm.oeaw.ac.at/serm/th_eb/teevhi.htm"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat19\cf1 http://www.ksbm.oeaw.ac.at/serm/th_eb/teevhi.htm}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr. TEEVHI 054 (T 25), TEEVHI 055 (T 26), TEEVHI 056 (T 25).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red157\green185\blue235;\red204\green238\blue221;\red201\green254\blue129;\red224\green224\blue224;}

