\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Thomas Ebendorfer von Haselbach}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Sermones de evangeliis de tempore, pars hiemalis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 57: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >M<Aria magdalene et maria Jacobi et salomee emerunt aromata vt venientes vnguerent Jhesum (Mc 16,1) \u8230 \'85 Precipua festiuitas inter ceteras}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  venerabilis toto orbe terrarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et impetravit orando coram ymaginem virginis. Vide in legenda Jeronimi de ipsa iterum. Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 58: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Maria Magdalena et Maria Jacobi \u8230 \'85 (Mc 16,1). Divina scriptura istam habet proprietatem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quod in una sui parte fideles amonet lacrimari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut ad plenam pietatis graciam te adjuuante pervenire mereamur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Textschluss abweichend). \endash  (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 59: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Surrexit non est hic (Mc 16,6). Quando diginitate festorum tocius anni clarius inspicimus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 exiuit de eius vtero, quando natus fuit in mundo etc. Rogemus ergo dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 59 (bis): [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 E]Xpurgate vetus fermentum, vt sitis noua <consparsio> sicut estis azimi (I Cor 5,7) \u8230 \'85 Hodiernam pascalem videlicet festiuitatem inter ceteras festiuitates christi precipuam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ostendit et saluatoris nostri resurrectio dedicatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  mit Schreibervermerk im Fu\u223 \'dfsteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 residuum sermonis quere in fine sermonum, ubi sequitur in ultima columpna \u8250 \'9bdiscipulis ostendere\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vt impetremus, deuocius dicamus: \u8250 \'9bO uere digna hostia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quesumus, te auctor omnium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in hoc pascali gaudio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 | ab omni mortis impetu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tuum defendas populum\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (AH 51, Nr. 83, S. 87, V. 5, 7). \endash  (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). Sermo 61: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [C]vm ergo esset sero die illa una sabbatorum (Io 20,19) \u8230 \'85 Dominus et saluator noster, postquam operatus est salutem in medio terre, id est in ierusalem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , pro nobis crucem sufferens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in quo oportet nos saluos fieri etc. et vitam eternam possidere, quam nobis prestare dignetur pater et filius et spiritus sanctus. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 62: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secundus sermo in octaua pasce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [A]Ccipite spiritum sanctum quorum remiseritis peccata remittuntur eis (Io 20, 22-23). Saluator noster christus dominus sicut omnia in sua passione ostendit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut declararet suam humanitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia tu deus protector noster es et solus gloriosus super omnem terram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 63: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [E]Go sum pastor bonus, bonus pastor animam suam dat pro ouibus etc (Io 10,11) \u8230 \'85 Licet multe sunt cause in particulari}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quare lites et turbaciones surgunt inter homines in mundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 plura de hoc vide in secundo sermone post octauam penthecostes, scilicet \u8250 \'9bHomo quidam erat diues etc\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 16,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rogemus ergo dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 64: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur sermo dominice 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  post festum pasce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [M]Odicum et non videbitis me, iterum modicum et videbitis me (Io 16,17) \u8230 \'85 Yminente hora, qua christus dominus voluit pro nobis crucis passionem et mortem pati}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod numquam auferetur ab eis, quod nobis prestare dignetur Jhesus christus benedictus in secula. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 65\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Sequitur dominica 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  post pasca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >U<ado ad eum, qui me misit et nemo ex uobis interrogat me, quo vadis etc (Io 16,5) \u8230 \'85 Diuina disposicione et prudencia ab eterno deus piissimus disposuit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nescitis, quia amicicia huius mundi inimica est Deo etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 66: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur dominica 5\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  post pasca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 A}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 <}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 men, amen dico uobis, quidquid pecieritis patrem in nomine meo, dabit uobis}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18  \u8230 \'85 (Io 16, 23-24) \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Quamuis multis modis homo seruiat deo et pro peccatis suis satisfaciat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et hoc eciam per sex menses factum est, ut patet ibidem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 67: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur sermo in die rogacionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >S<I quis ex uobis habet amicum etc (Lc 11,5) \u8230 \'85 Quo studio et quo affectu a nobis deus orandus sit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  secundum hugonem de sancto victore in suo tractatu \u8250 \'9bDe modo orandi\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et omnibus, qui sue dampnacionis causa uel occasio fuerunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 68: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur sermo in die ascensionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 R<Ecumbentibus vndecim discipulis apparuit illis ihesus etc (Mc 16,14) \u8230 \'85 Quia dies sanctus et sollempnis ascensionis domini nostri ihesu christi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hodie nobis illuxit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 per quam ad te ascendere mereamur tecumque colletari hic et in eterna secula. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 69: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur secundus sermo in die ascensionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [R]Ecumbentibus vndecim discipulis apparuit eis ihesus \u8230 \'85 (Mc 16,14) \u8230 \'85 Quanta sit presens festiuitas quanteque christianus in ea gaudere debeat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 spiritum mittat nobis sanctum in fine seculi, ipse quoque semper sit nobiscum. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  (191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo tertius in die ascensionis in epistola\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [P]Rimum quidem sermonem feci de omnibus \u8230 \'85 (Act 1,1) \u8230 \'85 Christus dominus post passionem suam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et resurrectionem transferre volens a presenti lacrimorum valle \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in contemplacione sue sanctissime humanitatis pascua eterne iocunditatis habeant, que nobis prestare dignetur ipse benedictus in secula. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Zu Ebendorfers Verfasserschaft vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lhotsky\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 76f., Nr. 40. \endash  (196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 70: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [C]Vm venerit paraclitus, quem ego mittam uobis a patre spiritum veritatis (Io 15,26) \u8230 \'85 Misericors pater, qui semper prope est inuocantibus eum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in veritate \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut oportet assistere coram eo. De istis et pluribus aliis vide in sermone dominice quinte post pascha\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallelhs.: Wien, Dominikanerkonvent, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat18 Cod. 167/137}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Haidinger \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 / \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lackner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr. TEEVHI 057 (T 28) \endash  TEEVHI 070 (T 37). Vgl. Online-Ressource: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "http://www.ksbm.oeaw.ac.at/serm/th_eb/teevhi.htm"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat20\cf1 http://www.ksbm.oeaw.ac.at/serm/th_eb/teevhi.htm}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (s. Nr. 3).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

