\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Kopftitelzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit summa magistri Johannis vrbach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Schreibervers: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Ne scribam uanum, maria duc mihi manum<}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Walther, Proverbia, Nr. 16093a). \endash  (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >A<d laudem dei animarum salutem curatorumque simplicium breuem et simplicem direccionem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  infra scripta ex textu iuris canonici doctorum dictis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 secunda uero pars principalis subdiuiditur in septem, sicut septem sunt ecclesie sacramenta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De practica modis et instruccionibus tribus uti et se habere possit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et primo de actu audicionis confessionis ac interrogacionibus considerantibus et cautelis in eo faciendis et adhibendis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >S<i iuxta legis sentenciam ciuilis in perorantibus causas rerum prophanarum iuris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pena eciam benedicentis secundas nupcias mitigata est per quandam extrauagantem, que incipit \u8250 \'9bConcertacionem antique\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (VI 2.15.8.). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit directorium magistri iohannis vrbarch decretorum doctorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <.
