\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -264\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Gerardus de Vliederhoven}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Cordiale quattuor novissimorum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus, qui intitulatur Cordiale tractans de quatuor nouissimis videlicet de morte naturali, de Judicio finali, de pena Jehennali, de gloria celesti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De quatuor nouissimis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >M<emorare nouissima tua et in eternum non peccabis \u8230 \'85 (Ecl 7,40). Sicut dicit beatus Augustinus libro suarum meditacionum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : \u8250 \'9bPlus uitanda est solius peccati feditas, quam quelibet tormentorum immanitas\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 40, 948) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 uere, uere, \u8250 \'9bgens absque consilio est et sine prudencia, vtinam saperent et intelligerent et nouissima prouiderent\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Dt 32,28-29). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tractatus qui intitulatur cordiale tractans de quatuor nouissimis, que iugiter in memoria debent retinere, scilicet mors naturalis, Judicium finale, pena iehennalis et gloria celestis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: HC 5691 = 5695; GW 7469; BSB-Ink G-110,1, Bl. a1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -i8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Z. 9. \endash  Lit.:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 J. A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mulders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  in: DSAM 6 (1967), Sp. 283. \endash  M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Dusch\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , De veer utersten. Das Cordiale de quatuor novissimis von Gerhard von Vliederhoven in mittelniederdeutscher \u220 \'dcberlieferung. K\u246 \'f6ln, Wien 1975 (Niederdeutsche Studien 20), S. 51*, Nr. 114 (diese Hs.). \endash  R. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 By\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 n\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Late medieval Eschatology: Gerard van Vliederhoven\rquote s \u8250 \'9bCordiale de IV novissimis\u8249 \'8b, in: Proceedings of the Leeds Philosophical and Literary Society. Literary and historical section 17,2 (1979), S. 55-65.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Ders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ., in: \u178 \'b2VL 2 (1980), Sp. 1217-1221.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

