\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 264\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -304\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (207-247)   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Ps.-Thomas de Aquino}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Sermones de sacramento corporis Christi}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Modus procedendi in sermones de sacramento corporis domini nostri ihesu christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. (264\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >D<e sacrosancto corporis domini locuturi sacramento}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  proponimus donante deo procedere tali modo: Primo ponimus illud circa que sunt principaliter notanda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ualebit utilis esse ad animarum firmandam fidem, informandam uitam et deuocionem excitandam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tituli sermonum. \endash  (265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -304\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermones 1-32: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sacramento corporis christi sermones. Et primo de tribus causis institucionis huius sacramenti. Thema generale scilicet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >U<enite, comedite panem meum et bibite uinum meum, quod miscui uobis (Prv 9,5). >N<ota hiis dominus nos inuitat ad salutare conuiuium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Thimotheus 4: Exerce te ipsum ad pietatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (I Tm 4,7-8), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad quam nos perducat, qui est benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Schlussschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Completum est hic tractatus de corpore christi per me Johannem tunc temporis plebanus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 (!) hospitalis maioris in augusta Anno domini M\u176 \'b0cccc\u176 \'b0xxxvi\u176 \'b0 in vigilia marie magdalene\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= 21. Juli). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Laus deo, pax uiuis, requies eterna sepulcris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium 5, S. 608-611, Nr. 412-444. \endash  Druck: Beati Alberti Magni Episcopi Ratisbonensis de sacrosancto corporis Domini sacramento sermones. Hrsg. von G. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Jacob\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Regensburg 1893, S. 1-201. \endash  Sancti Thomae Aquinatis opera omnia. Bd. 7: Aliorum medii aevi auctorum scripta 61. Hrsg. von R. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Busa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  S.J. Stuttgart, Bad Cannstatt 1980, S. 667-684.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

