\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 305\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -305\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Tres fructus eucharistiae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >D<ominus pascit nos corporis sui cibacione. Joannes 6: Ego sum panis uiuus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , qui de celo descendi etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Io 6,51). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic panis ex tribus granis conficitur, scilicet corpore, anima et divinitate \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs14  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et proficit etiam in redempcionem et ibidem post pauca subiungitur et \u8250 \'9bqui multa redimat modico precio\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ecl 20,12)|| (Textabbruch). \endash  305\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

