\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alter tractatus de Judeis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >S<cimus, fratres, quod diuersa est opinio Judeis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quibus uidetur, quod christiani errant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et magnum meritum propter hoc adepti sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >I<ntituletur ergo iste liber contra iudeos. Judeus dicit: uos christiani temere creditis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dicit Judeus: Conuertat nos deus. Respondit christianus: Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
