\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Questio de indulgencia bona ualde sequitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <.{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18  >Q<ueritur, utrum indulgencie date in uita ista possint prodesse animabus in purgatorio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Et respondetur, quod sic. Racio: Omnes existentes in sinu militantis ecclesie possunt recipere indulgenciam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed existentes in purgatorio non peccant, licet paciantur, ergo non sunt omnino de sinu militantis ecclesie. Et sic directe non potest recipere indulgenciam, sicut uisum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
