\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1. Vorderer Deckelspiegel (Papier)   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Regula vitae spritualis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In conuiuio sacerdotum sunt precipue sex obseruanda que habentur dis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [tinctio] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 XLIIII >Conuiuia< Primo vt videlicet vita absentum non mordeatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 6\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 to\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  vt in principio et in fine deo laudes referuntur etc. \endash  >Modus legendi abbreuiatorum terminorum iuris< Ac \endash  Accursius. Al \endash  Albertus \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Etc. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vin \endash  Vincentius. \u167 \'a7 paragraphus.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Inhaltsverzeichnis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 der gesamten Handschrift: Invocatio Mariae. \endash  Anrufung des Hl. Geistes: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Veni sancte spiritus \u8230 \'85 qui per diuiersitatem linguarum cunctarum gentes in virtute fidei congregasti. Alleluia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Das Inhaltsverzeichnis nennt 17 Texte jeweils mit Folioangabe. \endash  I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De somniis et providentia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scribitur libro 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  sententiarum distinctio 7 conclusio 3 in glosa de sompnio etc. Ad illud quod obicitur de sompniis in quibus prouidentur futura dicendum \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 quod precognitio futurorum incontingentium aliter habeatur quam a deo nisi per aliquam coniecturam etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De septem gaudiis in celebratione noui sacerdotis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Notandum quod septem sunt gaudia in celebratione noui sacerdotis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Primo gaudet ecclesia militans nouo adiutore \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 gaudemus igitur et exultemur in eius sacra et noua clebratione quod eius intercessio pro nobis placat deum nunc et in perpetuum. Amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \par}

