\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipiunt quidam articuli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [229] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 qualiter vnusquisque prespiter seu confessor se debeat regere erga sibi subditos etc< 1. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Queritur si quis haberet plura beneficia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  et uellet dimittere ante mortem viuens et perswasim cognatorum suorum beneficia teneret et non resignaret \u8230 \'85 si autem sint pauperes et modicum receperunt a defuncto dent eciam minus iuxta consilium discreti confessoris. Etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit de diuersis articulis siue materiis qualiter vnusquisque confessor debeat se regere in confessione erga sibi confitentes. \endash  Corrigantur articuli perscripti per iuris peritos. \endash  >Sequitur registrum super has predictos articulos 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ordinem< Absolutio quomodo fiat. 107. Absoluere an habeant religiosi. 64 \u8230 \'85 Vsura an possit remitti a dante vsurario. 98. Et sic est finis. \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
