\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Nota ex decretis sanctorum pontificum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . [Ex] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominico Gradensi patriarche< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Erubescant impii et aperte nos intelligant iudicio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  sancti spiritus eos qui in tribus gradibus sacris presbiteratus \u8230 \'85 positi mulierculas non abiecerint et caste non vixerint excludere ab eorundem graduum dignitate\u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Etc. \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Concilio autem Cartaginensi cap\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  II< Episcopos, diaconos \u8230 \'85 qui sacramentis diuinis inseruiunt continentes in omnibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [esse] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 debent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gregorius omnibus per regnum Italicum< Si qui sunt presbiteri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 qui in crimine fornicationis iaceant interdicimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 Etc. Es werden weiter zu diesem Thema zitiert: Decreta Nicolai Minoris, Origenes super homilia de zizania, Augustinus in tractatu de honestate mulierum. Das Florilegium schlie\u223 \'dft: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ergo non sit tibi verecundum fugere si castitatis palmam desideras obtinere. Hec Augustinus etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \par}

