\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Casus episcopales< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Incestum faciens deflorans aut homicida}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  / sacrilegus patris (?) percussor et sodomita \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Papales< Ad papam feriens clerum, falsarius, vrens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Quatuor peccata in celum clamantia< Clamitat in celis vox sanguinis \u8230 \'85;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Peccata in spiritum sanctum neremissibilia< Diffidens, desperans \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ; (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nota sumarie casus papales< Falsarii literarum apostolicarum \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Casus episcopales< Hereticorum, Judeorum, Saracenorum familiares et fautores qui audiunt laycos predicantes uel potestatem non habentes \u8230 \'85 Medici adhibentes curam infirmis antequam sunt confessi et prouisi sacramentis aut prouideri nolentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nota casus specialiter reseruatos licet quis habeat auctoritatem episcopalem non tamen habet in subsequentibus< Repaptisatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 reconfirmatus, reordinatus \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 Omnis coiens cum sanctis monialibus. Omnis clandestine contrahens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  Endet (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) mit zwei Schemata \u252 \'fcber: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ego sum via veritas vita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

