\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 14. 164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Simon de Rosenberg}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (?):\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Viridarium presbyterorum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Praefatio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Quilibet sacerdos debet maxime studere et ardenter legere in isto libello qui docet eum viam veritatis \u8230 \'85 in presenti libro per auctoritates sanctorum orthodoxorum< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Miror de clericis cuius ordinis sint}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Habent enim gestus cum militibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; (164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Capitulatio. \endash  Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Incipit primus liber dictus Viridarium presbyterorum et stella clericorum et primum capitulum tractat de dignitate sacerdotali< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Hoc est preceptum meum \u8230 \'85 Omne mandatum de sola dilectione est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 Non est tamen attendendum quid homo faciat sed quo animo faciat. \endash  Explicit Viridarius presbyterorum de bonis et electis presbyteris quomodo debent se regere \u8230 \'85 et quere rosas et flores in isto paruo libello quod\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [quasi ?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in viridario paradisi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Incipit secundus liber de malis presbyteris quomodo possint venire ad penitentiam et misericordiam dei. Deinde secuntur singula capitula istius subsequentis libelli. De malis sacerdotibus 1\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cap< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Quasi stella matutina in medio nebule (Ecl 50,6) i. e. peccatorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 filio dei ad uitam concoronamur. Amen. \endash  Explicit liber viridarii presbyterorum necnon et stella clericorum in die Agathe virginis 1467 etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bloomfield,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  Inicpits Nr. 3074. \endash  E. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Stahleder\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Die Handschriften der Augustiner-Eremiten und Weltgeistlichen in der ehemaligen Reichsstadt Windsheim. W\u252 \'fcrzburg 1963, S. 127 f. Hs. 75, 232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . \endash  Parallelhandschrift: F. M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bartos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Catalogus codd. manu scriptorum Musei nationalis Pragensis. P. I. Prag 1926, Ms. XIV. E. 6, fol. 1-22. Darin wird Simon von Rosenberg als Verfasser genannt. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \par}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Verdana;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red157\green185\blue235;\red157\green185\blue235;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 15. 186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat18\cf1 Innocentius, Papa, III.}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 De miseria humanae conditionis libri III }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >In Christi nomine amen. Incipit liber iste de miseria hominis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [seu] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 humane conditionis editus a Lothario dyacono cardinali sanctorum Sergii et Bachi qui postea Innocentius papa quartus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 appellatus est<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Capitulatio trium librorum. \endash  (187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Prologus< Domino ac patri karissimo etc. Portuensi episcopo Lotherius indignus dyaconus gratiam in presenti et gloriam in futuro. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Modicum ocii quod inter multas angustias}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  nuper ea quam nostis occasionem captaui \u8230 \'85 ut per illud humilis exaltetur. \endash >Explicit prologus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit liber de miseria hominis cap\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  primum< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Jeremias: Ve michi nascenti, ve nato, ve morienti \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1  (Paraphrase von Jr 20). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Si talia de se locutus est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ille quem deus sanctificauit \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 fames et sitis, frigus et cauma, sulphur et ignis ardens in secula seculorum. Amen. \endash  Explicit.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Druck: PL 217, 701-746. Nova Editio M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Maccarone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Lugano 1955. \endash  Vgl. zum Verfasser \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 LThK 5, Sp. 687-689.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \par}

