\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 16. 210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 De praerogativis missae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Sequitur de missa< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Prerogatiuas multas habet missa}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Primo quod celebratur a ieiunis. Secundo quod tantum in ecclesia nisi quando fiat sub tentorio propter causam \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 N. Ego baptiso te in nomine patris et filii et spiritus sancti. Amen. \endash  Explicit in die S. Gregorii anno etc. LXVII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \par}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Verdana;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red157\green185\blue235;\red157\green185\blue235;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 17. 213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Diversi textus et regulae circa missam}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Oratio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Suscipe domine Jhesu Christe me famulum tuum N. in auxilium miserationis tue et aperi os cordis \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 indulgentiam consequi merear per dominum nostrum. Amen. \endash  Finis.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Exhortatio parua in cena domini< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Exhortor accedentes ad altare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  dei volentes sumere corpus domini mei Jhesu Christi, vt accedant pura conscientia \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 quod ex ista sumptione consequi possumus gratiam in presenti \u8230 \'85 qui viuit et regnat cum deo patre \u8230 \'85 Amen. \endash  Vt eo salubrius accedatis dicatis publicam confessionem: Confiteor etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer. \endash  (214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Propheta< Vtinam saperent dampnandorum multitudinem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 3 Schemata. \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Ecclesiastes IX\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (10) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 capitulo< Quodcumque potest manus tua \u8230 \'85quo tu properas. \endash  O homo dilige vitam presentem non in se sed quia preparatoria \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Etc. \endash  (215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Gedicht: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Per nullam sortem poteris repellere mortem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  / cur caro letatur que vermibus esca paratur / \u8230 \'85 Regnum celorum requies est plena bonorum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Proverbia Nr. 21226 (zitiert diese Hs.). \endash 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Sacerdos celebraturus missam vadat ad aliquem locum secretum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  et recolligat in animo suo mala que patitur \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 Sicut Bonauentura conpilasse dicitur que consideranda sunt circa celebrationem huius sacramenti vide in sequenti folio signo tali [] verte folium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (= 216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Schema: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Sequitur informatio et ammonitio quorundam sacerdotum / nimis incaute celebrantium / conpilata ab egregio doctore et cardinali Bonauentura ordinis fratrum minorum< Generalis contritio super obmissis \u8230 \'85 commissis \u8230 \'85 conswetis \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Einschub: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Nota versus de effectibus sacramenti dominici< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Augeo. micio. mitigo. terreo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 Etc. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Augeo potest dicere Christus gratiam / micio i. e. mite facio \u8230 \'85 ad quod nos perducat dominus noster et regnat deus per omnia secula seculorum. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Initia Nr. 1746.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

