\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Nota de dedicatione< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Vidit Jacob in somnis scalam stantem super terram \u8230 \'85 Gen 28 (12). Loquitur in Genesi quod Esau persequentem Jacob}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  fratrem suum pro primogenitis suis \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 uocatur dedicatio refugii quando electi omnes congregabuntur in illam supernam Jerusalem que est mater nostra ad quam nos perducat etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (226\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Alius sermo in dedicatione< Zachee festinans descende \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Lc 19,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hodie \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 vt pro nobis interpellaret non voce sed miseratione quod nobis prestare etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  Es folgen vier weitere Sermones zum gleichen Anlass.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >De sancto Johanne baptista< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Erat enim magnus coram domino \u8230 \'85 Luc. 1o (15). In hiis verbis Christus exprimit excellentiam sancti Johannis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 Et quia magna opera fecit beatus Johannes propter deum ideo dominus commendat eum in magnis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (?).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

