\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >C<ristus assistens pontifex futurorum bonorum scribitur ad hebreos. Circa proprium sanguinem introiuit semel in sancta eterna redempcione inventa (Hebr 9,11-12). In uerbis istis circa ministrorum misterium nostre redempcionis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , de quo ab ista dominica vsque ad pascam ait mater ecclesia, tria nobis insinuatur: Primum est dignitas siue nobilitas redempcionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed prebende bonorum integrabuntur in celo, cum dicitur vt supra: venite benedicti patris mei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 25,34). \endash  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium 2, S. 485, Nr. 32 (T23). \endash  Parallelhs.: Innsbruck, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat18 Cod. 393}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Textschluss abweichend).}

