\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Auctoritates theologicae secundum ordinem alphabeti}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt auctoritates secundum ordinem alphabeti et sunt theologicales de diuersis materiis. Et primo de amore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 A\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ugustinus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Nil tam durum atque ferreum, quod non amoris igne vincatur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bernardus: Ve tibi, quicunque es, qui desideras ad lucem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (statt: lutum) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 reuerti, aduerti ad uomitum. Putas, quia placidos habebis in iudicio, quos modo tanto et tam sperato priuare uis gaudio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Bernardus Claraevallensis, In vigilia nativitatis Domini, sermo 2, c. 6, ed. PL 183, 93C). \endash  (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Schlussschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt auctoritates theologicales collecte per archydiaconum Inferioris Marchie Styrie, finite per me Thomam Lurl, vicarium sancti Bartholomei Sub anno nativitatis domini 1433 in die sanctorum Cypriani martyris et Justine virginis gloriose\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (26. September 1433).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Sentenzensammlung zu alphabetisch geordneten Stichw\u246 \'f6rtern (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 amor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 xpistus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). \endash  Parallelhs.: Eichst\u228 \'e4tt, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat18 Cod. st. 224}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

