\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Ps.-Thomas de Aquino}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Sermones de sacramento corporis Christi}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tituli sermonum: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt tytuli sermonum de corpore christi Magistri thome de aquino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  (78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermones 1-32: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo primus de tribus causis institucionis sacramenti corporis christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >U<Enite, comedite panem meum et bibite vinum, quod miscui uobis. Prouerbiorum ix (Prv 9,5). >H<iis uerbis dominus nos inuitat ad salutare conuiuium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 primo ad thymotheum 4: Exerce te ipsum ad pietatem; pietas enim ad omnia utilis est, promissionem habens uite, que nunc est et future\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Tm 4,7-8), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad quam nos perducere dignetur Jhesus christus, dominus noster, beate et gloriose marie virginis fructus et filius, qui uiuit et regnat cum deo patre in vnitate spiritus sancti per omnia secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Schlussschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt sermones de corpore christi xxxii\u176 \'b0 compilati per Reuerendum doctorem beatum thomam de aquino, Anno etc. 33 finiti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zu Druck und Lit. vgl. die Angaben zu Clm 3762, 264\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -304\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

