\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Sermones varii}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >M<odicum et iam non videbitis me (Io 16,16). Karissimi, in hoc ewangelio iam audito quattuor}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tanguntur cuilibet necessario consideranda \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sic vidimus in ciuitate domini nostri, quod oculus non vidit nec auris audit nec in cor hominis ascendit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 2: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >S<uscipite insitum verbum (Iac 1,21). Nota, quod dicit super illud Johannes vii}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Sermo meus non capit in uobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Io 8,37). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo dei est, ut habeamus, qui capit, dum capitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in futuro a morte gehenne Joannes uiii: Amen, amen dico tibi, si quis sermonem meum servaverit etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Io 8,51). \endash  (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 3: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >C<Um venerit ille arguet vos (vgl. Io 16,8). Nota, quod spiritus sanctus tria facit per spirituales viros}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , in quibus habitat, malos angit, bonos instruit, glorie christi intendit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bernhardus: Cadit asina, et est qui subleuet; cadit anima, et nemo est qui excogitet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Bernardus Claraevallensis, De consideratione, li. 4, \u167 \'a7 20; Druck: Opera omnia, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  3, S. 464, Z. 4-5), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9bsed adhuc transibunt greges ad manum numerantis\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ier 33,13), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ubi est grex, qui datus est tibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 4: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [E]stote factores uerbi (Iac 1,22). In epistola hodie inuitant fideles ad quatuor}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Primo ad obedienciam, cum dicitur \u8250 \'9bEstote factores\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 id est exposicionem \u8250 \'9buerbum dei\u8249 \'8b, unde Gregorii: Uerbum dei tunc mens reuera intelligit, cum in eo semetipsam querit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 5: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [P]etite et accipietis, ut gaudium sit plenum (Io 16,24). In hoc ewangelio specialiter nos hortatur ad oracionem dominus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 gaudium vestrum nemo tollet a uobis, quia claudetur ianua, ne illuc intrahere valeat inimicus nec exire amicus, ecce gaudium plenum, ad quod ducat nos ihesus cristus. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  (179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 6: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [Q]uis vestrum habebit amicum (Lc 11,5). Sancta mater ecclesia contra pestes morborum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , que solent accidere temporum propter exuberanciam viciorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut quietam et tranquillam vitam agamus in omni pietate et castitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 7: [P]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 etite et accipietis, querite et invenietis, pulsate et aperietur vobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Io 16, 24; Mt 7,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hoc ewangelium in letaniis legitur, quando adorandum dominum convenimus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et mane loquitur, non est mecum, id est diuites seculi amari et turbidi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 8: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [V]enite, ascendamus ad montem domini et ad domum dei Jacob et docebit nos vias suas et ambulabimus in semitis eius, quia etc (Is 2,3). In hiis verbis ammonet nos propheta egredi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de tenebroso squalenti carcere huius mundi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nam sicut ait Sulpicius: Jerosolimus episcopus, cum ibi postea constructa fuisset locus, non potuit pauimento sterni, ymmo mora collocancium marmora resiliebantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 9: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [V]iri galileij, quid statis aspicientes in celum (Act 1,11) et sunt uerba angelorum consolancium animos discipulorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de christi absencia desolatos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vnde libera mentis perspicacio in speculo sapiencie\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf19  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cum ammiratione suspensa, hac non erudicio sed iniunctio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 docet, non scienciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 10: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >H<Ic Ihesus, qui assumptus est a vobis (Act 1,11). Et ideo non dolendum, sed gaudendum et iubilandum est nobis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 secundo in nomine ihesu omne genu flectatur celestium, terrestium et infernorum, Ysaie xlv: Michi curuabitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 omne et iurabitur omnis ligwa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) (vgl. Is 45,23). \endash  (183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 11: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >R<Ecumbentibus undecim discipulis (Mc 16,14). Octo diuinis operationibus hunc diem sanctum colimus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quis appendit totius digitis molem terre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || (Text bricht ab). \endash  184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Predigten f\u252 \'fcr die Zeit zwischen Ostern und Pfingsten. \endash  Einzelnachweise: (Sermo 1) Peregrinus de Oppeln, Sermo in dominicam tertiam post pascha. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium 4, S. 552, Nr. 55 (T31). \endash  (Sermo 3) Parallelhs.: Neapel, BN, Cod. 398. \endash  VIII.A.20, 125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; vgl. C. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Cenci\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  OFM, Manoscritti francescani della Biblioteca Nazionale di Napoli. Rom 1971 (Spicilegium Bonaventurianum 8), Bd. 2, S. 690. \endash  (Sermo 5) Parallelhss.: M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, 2\u176 \'b0 Cod.ms. 132, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, M.p.th.qu. 43, 147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  (Sermo 6) Parallelhss.: M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, 2\u176 \'b0 Cod.ms. 132, 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, M.p.th.qu. 43, 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Lucas de Bitonto, Sermones in ascensione Domini aus dem Predigtzyklus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Narraverunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : (Sermo 7) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium 4, S. 57, Nr. 106 (T33). \endash  (Sermo 8) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium 4, S. 58, Nr. 113 (T36). \endash  (Sermo 9) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium 4, S. 58, Nr. 115 (T36). \endash  (Sermo 11) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium 4, S. 58, Nr. 116 (T36).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

