\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 225\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Sermo super Act 2,4 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Repleti sunt}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >R<Epleti sunt omnes spiritu sancto et ceperunt loqui varijs lingwis, Actum 2\u176 \'b0 (Act 2,4) et in epistola hodierne festiuitatis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Hodierna dies est dies quinquagesima a dominica a festo pasce \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sexto ad docendum ignaros, quod notatur, cum dicitur: \u8250 \'9bille docebit vos omnem veritatem\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Io 16,13) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quam eciam et nos doceat christus dei filius in secula seculorum benedictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

