\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1. I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Hymmonides}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  (Johannes Diaconus Romanus): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Versus de Gregorio Magno ad Iohannem VIII. papam}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine sanctae et indiuiduae trinitatis incipit prologvs Iohannis diaconi ad Iohannem reverendissimvm sanctae apostolicae sedis pontificem de institutione, vita, doctrina sive miracvlis beati Gregorii romani pontificis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >S<uscipe romuleos, pastor uenerande triumphos | >G<regorii sancti suscipe tui}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 da mihi sub pedibus posse iacere tuis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Vgl. BHL 3642. \endash  Druck: PL 75, 59D-62A. \endash  Poetae Latini aevi Carolini IV. Teil 3: Supplementa. Ed. K. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Strecker\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Berlin 1923, ND 1998, S. 1068 (diese Handschrift, Sigle: M\plain \f1\sub\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). \endash  Lit.: G. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Arnaldi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Giovanni Immonide e la cultura a Roma al tempo di Giovanni VIII., in: Bullettino dell'Istituto Storico Italiano per il Medio Evo 68 (1956), S. 33-89, ebd. S. 50, Anm. 3 (diese Hs.).}

