ra templum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et hoc est, quod dicit: \u8250 \'9bOportet hec fieri, sed nondum est finis\u8249 \'8b. Tu autem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Mt 24,6). Teildruck: BSB-Ink B-848,1, Bl. 564\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -564\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Cum ergo persequentur vos in vna ciuitate, fugite in aliam< (Mt 10,23). >S<Ancti euangelij sentencia nichil habet in se contrarietatis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , si profundius deum inuestigetur intencio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut persecucionis et tribulacionis occisio fieret euangelij seminarium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tu autem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Parallelhs.: Innsbruck, UB, Cod. 56, 251\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Paulus Diaconus, hom. 73. Druck: PL 95, 1537C-1539B; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Barr\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 319.
