\line Lectio 1-8: (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Q<Via beati martiris N. solempnia celebramus oportet, fratres karissimi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , ut congrua deuocione congruisque moribus ad hec nos preparemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed absolutus ad requiem ac per hoc manifestissima racione iudicio subesse vicisse est non perire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Parallelhss.: Clm 4509, 175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Innsbruck, UB, Cod. 56, 253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >I<Vstissime, fratres karissimi, sollempnitas beati N. martiris ymnis celestibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  diuersarum professionum honoratur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 nec ab aduersancium minacia pertimescit nec a seuissima rabie perturbatur prestante domino nostro \u8230 \'85 in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Parallelhss.: Clm 4509, 174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Kremsm\u252 \'fcnster, Stiftsbibl., CC 114, 194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) PD II 118; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Gr\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 goire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 475, Nr. 118. \endash  (51\pla