 ierosolimam concinebant: Osanna filio dauid benedictus, qui uenit in nomine domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hunc fideliter prudenterque laborantem amplioris gracie donat, illum desidias molles et marcida luxu ocia sectantem ex eo, quod dederat, priuat.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Parallelhss.: Kremsm\u252 \'fcnster, Stiftbibl., CC 114, 248\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -252\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Schaffhausen, Ministerialbibl., Min 70, 286\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
