\line >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo Beati Ambrosij episcopi de corpore christi feria sexta post diem corporis christi. Lectio prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. In Form einer Predigt zusammengestellte Lehrs\u228 \'e4tze zum Sakrament der Eucharistie aus dem Decretum Gratiani, De consecratione:{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18  >P<Otest ab aliquo, dilectissimi, queri uel dici, 1(109v, Z. 13-110r, Z. 18) aliud video in preiacenti sacramenti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ; quomodo tu asseris, ut corpus christi accipiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vere ergo illius carnis sacramentum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (De cons. D.2 c.69 \u167 \'a71-3. Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Friedberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 1339-1340). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 19-28) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Quociens ergo hunc panem sumitis et bibitis hunc calicem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut diligeremus eum iam a morte liberati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (De cons. D.2 c.71 \u167 \'a71. Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Friedberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 1341-1342f). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 30-110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 22) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[17].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Vtrum autem sub figura, an sub ueritate hoc misticum calicis sacramentum fiat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 aut certe obsecrationes fidelium petitiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (De cons. D.2. c.72. Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Frie\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 dberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 1342\endash 1343). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 23-37) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Omnia, quecumque uoluit dominus, fecit in celo et in terra}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf8  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et iterum: panis, quem ego dabo, caro mea est, pro mundi vita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (De cons. D.2 c.74. Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Friedberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 1344-1345). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 37-44) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Cottidie communionem eukaristie accipere nec laudo, nec vitupero}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed hoc de illo dico, quem mortalia peccata non grauant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (De cons. D.2 c.13. Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Friedberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 1318-1319). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 1-42) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Quia igitur corpus assumptum ablaturus erat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 et maxime mente totum haustu interioris hominis assume\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (De cons. D.2 c.35. Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Friedberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 1325-1326). \endash \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24  7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 42-111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 13) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 In christo semel oblata est hostia ad salutem sempiternam potens}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod factum est: \u8250 \'9bHoc enim facite\u8249 \'8b ait, \u8250 \'9bin meam conmemorationem\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (De cons. D.2 c.53. Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Friedberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 1333). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 13-18) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 In sacramentorum oblacionibus, que inter missarum sollempnia domino offeruntur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia vtrumque ex latere eius in passione profluxisse legitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (De cons. D.2 c.1. Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Friedberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 1314). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 18-28) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Calix eciam dominicus vino et aqua permixtus debet offerri}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 salutis nostre sacramentum negligitur, quod aqua significat\plain \f2\lang1033\fs16 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (De cons. D.2 c.7 \u167 \'a71. Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Friedberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 1316). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 30-112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 8) {\fi