\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 legenda de beata virgine in diebus sabbatorum seu aliis per circulum anni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Lectio 1-3: (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 1-124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 21) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >L<oquamur aliquid de laude sacratissime marie virginis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sine dolore puerpera dei eterni amica, soror et ancilla, sponsa, mater et filia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 22-125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 1) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Hec est ciuitas fecunda exultacione vniuerse terre}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , de qua propheta commemorans homo inquit: \u8250 \'9bNatus est in ea et ipse fundauit eam altissimus\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 86,5) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non est sanctus vt est dominus, nec est sancta ut mater eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 1-39) Anselmus Cantuariensis, oratio 54. Druck: PL 158, 960B-961B. \endash  (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 39-126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 7) Anselmus Cantuariensis, oratio 55. Druck: PL 158, 961C-962C. \endash  (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 8-127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 7) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rabanus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < (am Rand): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >R<ecolite ergo deformacione primi hominis noui propter creantem deum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et purissimam intemerate virginis animam ingressus aut egressus non violauit sed illuminauit deitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 8-129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 17) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rabanus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >A<Ve gracia plena, dominus tecum benedicta tu in mulieribus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , aue virgo mater deifica, aue summa et perpetua virgo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 aut ad placandam iram vindicis, quam teque meruisti existere mater eiusdem redemptoris et iudicis ihesu christi, domini nostri, qui viuit \u8230 \'85 . Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 8-130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 12) Bernardus Claraevallensis, Sermones de tempore. In adventu domini, sermo 2, dist. 4-5. Druck: Opera omnia, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  5, S. 173, Z. 8-174, Z. 22. \endash  (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 13-130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 40) Bernardus Claraevallensis, Sermo \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De duodecim praerogativis B. V. Mariae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Druck: PL 183, 429C-438C; Opera omnia, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Leclercq \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 5, S.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  262, Z. 12-274, Z. 20\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (mit erheblichen K\u252 \'fcrzungen). \endash  (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 1-33) Bernardus Claraevallensis, In assumptione BMV, sermo 4, c. 8-9: De quatriduo Lazari et praeconio Virginis. Druck: Opera omnia, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Leclercq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  5, S. 249, Z. 17-250, Z. 15. \endash  (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 34-131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 9) Bernardus Claraevallensis, Sermones in die pentecostes, sermo 2, c. 4. Druck: Opera omnia 5, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lec\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 lerq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 167, Z. 22-S. 168, Z. 8. \endash  (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 19-30) Bernardus Claraevallensis, Sermo in nativitate beatae Mariae Virginis. Druck: Opera omnia 5, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Leclerq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 288, Z. 3-12. \endash  (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 31-132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 24) Bernardus Claraevallensis, Homiliae super \u8250 \'9bMissus est\u8249 \'8b, homilia 2, c. 2-4 (expl.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 scrutare scripturas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), c. 11 (inc.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vides quam pulchre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). Druck: Opera omnia 4, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Leclerq\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 22, Z. 9-23, Z. 23, S. 28, Z. 23-29, Z. 4. \endash  (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 25-132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 21) Ps.-Ildephonsus Toletanus, sermo 12: De sancta Maria. Druck: PL 96, 279D-280D. \endash  (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 22-133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 26): Ps.-Ildephonsus Toletanus, sermo 8: In laudem BMV. Druck: PL 96, 269C-271C. \endash  (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 27-133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 20) Ps.-Ildephonsus Toletanus, sermo 9: De assumptione BMV octavus. Druck: PL 96, 271C-272C. \endash  (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 21-134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 11) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >C<Ommemoracionem virginis precipue venerantes, dilectissimi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quantis dei plena muneribus quam reuerenda angelicis potestatibus, quantis etiam sit ab omnibus sanctis excolenda honoribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod beatissima genitrice maria interueniente preterire dignetur, qui \u8230 \'85 viuit \u8230 \'85 per omnia secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 12-134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 1) Fulbertus Carnotensis, Sermo 4: De nativitate BMV. Druck: PL 141, 323A-324B. \endash  (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 2-135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 13) Anselmus Cantuariensis, oratio 50: Ad sanctam virginem Mariam. Druck: PL 158, 948C-950B. \endash  (135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 14-136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 23) Anselmus Cantuariensis, oratio 51: Ad sanctam virginem Mariam. Druck: PL 158, 950B-952C. \endash  (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 24-138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Anselmus Cantuariensis, oratio 52: Ad sanctam virginem Mariam. Druck: PL 158, 952D-959B. \endash  (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 8) Anselmus Cantuariensis, oratio 49: Ad Dei matrem. Druck: PL 158, 946B-948B. \endash  (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 9-140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 10) Ps.-Aurelius Augustinus, sermo 208: In festo assumptionis BMV. Druck: PL 39, 2130-2134 (mit erheblichen Auslassungen). \endash  (140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 11-141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 2) Ps.-Flaccus Alcuinus, homilia 3: De nativitate perpetuae virginis Mariae. Druck: PL 101, 1301D-1308A (mit erheblichen Auslassungen). \endash  (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 3-141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 4) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur antiphona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >S<Ancta regina celi, mater Domini domina mundi, que nullum despicis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , nullum derelinquis, noli nos despicere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui pro nobis nasci dignatus est ex te virgine benedicta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Aue spes nostra dei genitrix maria, que meruisti portare regem celorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui totum orbem a sua mundat iniquitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Sancta maria virginum piissima, suscipe vota seruulorum assidua}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut tibi semper referamus laudes, quam dei summi colimus genetricem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Suscipiat benignissima gemitus captiuorum, clamores peregrinorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , suspiria inuicem vota virginum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quas vides amore celestis sponsi flagrare atque eius nupcias sitibundo corde desiderare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 O regina dulcissima virginum, miserere omni ex pio affectu venerancium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et in petra omnibus veniam peccatorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in quo lauantur omnia contagia delutorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 O femina super feminas omnes benedicta, que virum omnino non cognouisti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et dominum in tuo vtero baiolare meruisti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut deleas, quidquid deliquimus, in terris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Beata dei genitrix, dum tuo nos obsequio interesse prospicis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , ardencius nobis subuenire festina benignissimum filium tuum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 succurre, domina, fidelibus omnibus impetrans nobis et illis sine fine mansura vite perennis gaudia. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Parallelhs.: Uppsala, UB, C4, 20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Z. 5-12) Oratio: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De beata virgine. Oracio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >O< intemerata et in eternum benedicta, singularis atque incomparabilis virgo dei genitrix maria}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , gratissimum dei templum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et esto nobis peccatoribus pia in omnibus auxiliatrix\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Predigten f\u252 \'fcr das kleine Marienoffizium (auch bezeichnet als \u8250 \'9bmarianischer Samstag\u8249 \'8b). \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Lit.: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Barr\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Un plaidoyer monastique pour le samedi marial, in: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Rev. B\u233 \'e9n.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  77 (1967), S. 375\endash 399. \endash  H.-J.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Feulner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in \u179 \'b3LThK 7 (1986), Sp. 1006f. \endash  D. von \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Huebner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: Marienlex. 4 (1992), S. 681f.
