\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit speculum beate marie Virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Q<Voniam, ut ait Jeronimus, \u8250 \'9bnulli dubium, quin totum ad gloriam et laudem dei}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pertineat, quitquid\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 digne genitrici eius in pensum fuerit\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  te corde et ore saluto salutansque dico: Aue maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermones 1-18: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >A<Ue maria, gracia plena, dominus tecum, benedicta tu in mulieribus et benedictus fructus ventris tui (Lc 1,42). Audi, dulcissima virgo maria, audi noua, audi mira}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vt sine fine nobis concedat dulcedine sua frui ille liberalissimus communicator sui benedictus fructus ventris, qui est in secula benedictus. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Register.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB, Nr. 2017. \endash  Druck: Speculum beatae Mariae virginis fratris Conradi a Saxonia. Ed. Collegium S. Bonaventurae. Quaracchi 1904 (Bibliotheca franciscana ascetica medii aevi 2), S. 1-277. \endash  Conradus de Saxonia. Speculum seu Salutatio Beatae Mariae Virginis ac Sermones Mariani. Ed. P. de \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Alcantara Martinez\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Grottaferrata 1975 (Bibliotheca franciscana ascetica medii aevi 11), S. 141-504. \endash  Lit.: G. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stamm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \u178 \'b2 VL 5 (1985), Sp. 247-251, ebd. Sp. 250, Nr. 3.}

