\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Formula honeste vite quam beatus Bernardus scripsit Gerhardo suo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Beatus Bernardus de vita laudabili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18  }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >P<etis a me, mi frater, quod numquam a suo prouisore audiui aliquem petiuisse}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod mihi deesse cognosco et profectus tuus gaudium meum est et corona mea in domine. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
