\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Raimundus de Pennaforti}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 De sententia excommunicationis cum additamentis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Johannes de Friburgo}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Confessionale seu Tractatus de instructione confessorum}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Definitio excommunicationis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Q<Vero, quid sit excommunicacio. Respondeo secundum Raymundum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  eodem titulo, \u167 \'a7 ix \u8250 \'9bSequitur\u8249 \'8b.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Excommunicatio est a qualibet licita communione vel legittimo actu separacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 et hec dicitur minor excommunicacio. De utraque, scilicet maiori et minori, habetur iii q. iiii \u8250 \'9bEngeltrudam\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Decr. Grat., C.3 q.4 c.12], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 extra eodem \u8250 \'9bSi quid\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Decr. Greg., X 4.39.59]. (Raim., De paen., ti. 33, \u167 \'a7 9; Druck: Sp. 746). Parallelstellen: Summa host., \u167 \'a7 3 \u8250 \'9bQuot sunt\u8249 \'8b; Thomas, 4 Sent., dist. 18, q. 2, art. 4, qc. 1 co; Raim., De paen., ti. 33, \u167 \'a7 59. \endash  (205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De sententia excommunicationis maioris: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 In quibus casibus incidat quis ipso facto ex iure in sententiam excommunicacionis maioris}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Respondeo secundum Raymundum \u167 \'a7 10 \u8250 \'9bUtraque\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Utraque excommunicacio tam maior quam minor intelligitur quinque a iure, quinque a iudice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nec in qualitate negociorum de clerico, quicquam ostendit, si tertio amonitus ab episcopo suo se non correxerit, extra eodem titulo \u8250 \'9bContingit\u8249 \'8b ii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Decr. Greg., X 5 39.45]. (Summa host., li. 5, de sent. exc. \u167 \'a7 4; Druck: Bl. 671\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). Parallelstellen: Raim., De paen., \u167 \'a7 11. \endash  (205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De sententia excommunicationis minoris: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >C<irca minorem excommunicacionem quero, quando quis eam incidit ipso facto}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Respondeo secundum Raymundum, \u167 \'a7 xix \u8250 \'9bMinor autem\u8249 \'8b et secundum hostiensem, \u167 \'a7 viii \u8250 \'9bQuis possit\u8249 \'8b. In prouerbiorum dicendum,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod minor excommunicacio siue suspensio infligitur quam cito peccatum mortale comittitur eciam sola cogitacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nono, in quolibet notorio peccatore, nam et viuus et mortuus, repellitur a sacramentis ecclesie, nisi penituerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . [\u8230 \'85]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In omnibus casibus predictis absolui potest quilibet a proprio sacerdote\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Raim., De paen., ti. 33, \u167 \'a7 18; Druck: Sp. 757-759). Parallelstellen: Summa host., De sent. exc., \u167 \'a7 12; Raim., De paen., ti. 33, \u167 \'a7 23. \endash  (206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De confessione generali: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >V<trum per confessionem generalem deleantur peccata venalia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Respondeo secundum thomam, quod sic quia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quando actus caritatis contra venialia dirigitur, ea quasi suo contrario delet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nec satisfactionis iniunctio, sed solum oracio misereatur. Satis cum hiis concordat Petrus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Thomas, 4 Sent., dist. 21, q. 2, art. 1 ). \endash  (207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >U<trum elemosina sit magis satisfactoria vel oracio vel ieiunium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Respondeo secundum thomam in scriptis dist. xv dicendum, quod elemosina virtute in se concludit orationem et ieiunium et duplici ratione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et 1 thy iiii 4 \u8250 \'9bPietas ad omnia valeat\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Tim 4,8). (Thomas, 4 Sent., dist. 15, q. 2, art. 2, qc. 2). \endash  (207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Johannes de Friburgo, De instructionibus confessorum: (207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Admonitiones generales. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >C<Vm aliquis petat suam confessionem audiri}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quem antea numquam audisti in foro confessionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 secundum beatum Augustinum: \u8250 \'9bEst officium confessoris\u8249 \'8b, ut patet de pe di vi \u8250 \'9bqui vult\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Decr. Grat., De poen. D.6 c.1] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et in summa confessorum eodem titulo q. lxxxvii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Druck: Johannes de Friburgo, De instructionibus confessorum. Druck:{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "http://mdzx.bib-bvb.de/bsbink/Exemplar_I-564,1.html"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat19\cf1  Hain 9248; }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 BSB-Ink I-564,1, Bl. a2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -a6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De absolutionibus. De iniunctione paenitentiarum in extremis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >C<Ompleta confessione cum scilicet confitens de nullo peccato}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  amplius memor est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et testamenta celeriter expediant frequenter admonicionibus impulsabis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Druck: ebd., Bl. e4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -e8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Schlussschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit confessionale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zusammenstellung von Beichtrichtlinien f\u252 \'fcr den Pfarrklerus auf der Grundlage der von Raimundus de Pennaforti verfassten \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Summa de paenitentia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , li. 3, tit. 33, 9-23; Zitate und Exzerpte weiterer Autorit\u228 \'e4ten als Parallelstellen genannt. \endash  Siglen und Druck: Raim., De paen. = \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Raimundus de Pennaforte, Summa de paenitentia. Ed. J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Ochoa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  et A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Diez\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . Rom 1975 (Universa Bibliotheca Iuris. B. Volumina. 1,B). \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Summa host., De sent. exc. = De sententia excommunicationis, aus: Henricus de Segusia (Hostiensis), Summa aurea. Lyon: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Thibaud\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Payen,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  1537. \endash  Thomas, Sent. = Scriptum in quattuor libros sententiarum magistri Petri Lombardi. \endash  Lit.: J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Goering\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The internal Forum and the Literature of Penance and Confession, in: Traditio 59 (2004), S. 175-227, bes. S. 216-225.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Verdana;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red157\green185\blue235;\red157\green185\blue235;\red201\green254\blue129;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -227\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Compendium de sacramento eucharistiae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Quaestio 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 >U<Trum sacerdos quilibet possit absoluere penitentem agentem in extremis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Respondeo secundum thomam et petrum, quod sic, nam in articulo mortis omnibus peccatis et sentenciis permittitur absolucio a iure\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (vgl. Thomas, 4 Sent., dist. 18, q. 2, art. 5, qc. 1), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vide supra, eodem titulo, q xxxii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Raim., De paen., ti. 33, \u167 \'a7 32; Druck: Sp. 772-773). \endash  (212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Quaestio 2: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 >Q<Vot modis venialia remittuntur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Raim., De paen., ti. 34, \u167 \'a7 60; Druck: Sp. 864-865). \endash  (227\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Quaestio 86: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tem queritur, quod sacramentum infra hec quatuor sacramenta, scilicet baptismum, confessionem, eucharistiam et matrimonium, sit excellencius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Raim., De paen., ti. 24, \u167 \'a7 7; Druck: Sp. 663). \endash  Schlussschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et sic est finis huius opusculi. Sit laus deo. Explicit compendiosum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de sacramento eucharistie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Kompendium von 86 Quaestionen f\u252 \'fcr den pastoraltheologischen Gebrauch mit Fragen u. a. zum Wesen der Eucharistie sowie zu ihrer Stellung innerhalb der Sakramente, ferner mit Richtlinien zur Erteilung und liturgischen Feier des Sakraments, insbesondere zur Beschaffenheit der Hostie und des Weins, sowie mit Angaben der Gr\u252 \'fcnde, die zum eingeschr\u228 \'e4nkten Zugang oder Ausschluss von der Eucharistiefeier f\u252 \'fchren. \endash  Parallelstellen: Alb., De corp. dom., dict. 3, tract. 2, c. 2-3, dist. 6, tract. 2, c. 1, dist. 6, tract. 4, c. 2-3; Thomas, 4 Sent., dist. 8, q. 1-2, dist. 8, q. 1, art. 4, dist. 9, q. 1, art. 1-5, dist. 10, q. 1, art. 4, qc. 3 co, dist. 11, q. 2-3, dist. 12, q. 1, art. 3, q. 2, art. 1-2, q. 3, art. 1-2, dist. 13, q. 1, art. 1-2; Thomas, III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Sum. theol., q. 74, art. 3 ad 2, q. 80, art. 7-8, q. 83, art. 6 ad 2-6; Raim., De paen., ti. 24, \u167 \'a7 7, 11-13. \endash  Siglen und Druck: s. 205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , weitere: Alb., De corp. dom. Druck: Beati Alberti Magni \u8230 \'85 opera omnia. Ed. A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Borgnet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Bd. 38: Liber de sacramento Eucharistiae. Paris 1890. \endash  Petr. Lom., 4 Sent. = Petrus Lombardus, Libri quattuor sententiarum, li. 4. \endash  Thomas, Sum. theol. = Thomas de Aquino, Summa theologiae. \endash  Initien der Quaestionen 3-85 im Initienregister.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

