\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Johannes de Fonte: Conclusiones in quattuor libros Sententiarum. [Augsburg: G\u252 \'fcnther Zainer, 1477-76]. Sign. BSB: 2\u176 \'b0 Inc.s.a. 461 a (BSB-Ink I-391,2; HC (Add.) 7225).}

