\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Thomas Ebendorfer von Haselbach}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Exemplarium decalogi}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1.-9. Gebot: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >COgitatum habe in preceptis Dei et in mandatis eius maxime assiduus esto<. Ita scribit sapiens Ecclesiastici sexto (Sir 6,37). Hoc clamant lex et prophete}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , sic loquitur Dominus per Moysen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 peccat contra hoc preceptum, eciamsi Dominus non sit a viro cognita patet per glosam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Devotus vir super isto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Non concupisces\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || (Textabbruch). \endash  69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
