\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jncipit prologus in preceptorium fratris Johannis Nydere sacre theologie professoris ordinis fratrum predicatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >D<Ecalogi legem sacratissimam primum diuinitus prothoplastorum insertam cordibus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut eterne sapiencie, a qua bona cuncta procedunt, pro premio copulari in patria tandem merear. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit preceptorium divine legis. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Svnt igitur tria principaliter prenotanda preceptorum preambula}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 donec intrem in gaudium Domini, qui es\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (korr. aus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 trinus et vnus Deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit preceptorium divine legis per fratrum Johannem Nider compilatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
