\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -300\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Augustinus Ayrmschmalz de Weilheim}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Quaestiones in II librum Sententiarum Petri Lombardi}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog zum Kommentar:{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18  >Lecturus< domino cooperante libros sententiarum et in primis inchoando secundum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , antequam veniam ad textum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dum cecidit a potestate in impotenciam, de quibus questionibus iste secundus liber plenus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Dist. 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Creatorem omnium rerum insinuans scriptura}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eisque concretorum atque contingencium sequatur documentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Kommentar: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Incipit liber secundus, in quo magister determinat de rerum creacione}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et earum ornatu et dotacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hic concludit, quod circa triplex genus creature sua versatur intencio, scilicet circa spiritualem creaturam non vnitam et circa spiritualem vnitam et circa corpoream tantum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (294\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -296\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Dist. 44: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ost predicta consideracione dignum occurrit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sic enim deus precepit, ut in malis nulli potestati obediamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Kommentar: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Superius determinauit magister de peccato quantum ad originem et actum, quia ut dicit philosophus: Potencias per actus cognoscimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et rex regum et dominus dominancium, cuius potestas non aufferetur, nec regnum corrumpetur in secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (296\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -297\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Buch 3, Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Iam nunc hijs intelligendis atque pertractandis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut Samaritanus ad wlneratum, medicus ad infirmum, gracia ad miserum accedat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Kommentar: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Hic continuat se ad dicenda in libro sequenti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , dicens, quod nunc intendendum est, que pertinent ad misterium verbi incarnati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 ne amore hominis veritati fiat preiudicium. Hec Bonauentura. Et sic est finis, laudetur deus sublimis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (297\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -300\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Registrum. \endash  Schlussschrift\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Anno domini m\u176 \'b0 cccc\u176 \'b0 lxiiij\u176 \'b0 In vigilia ascensionis beatissime marie uirginis. Finitus est liber iste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (14. August 1464). \endash  301\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -307\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lit.: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 V. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Redlich\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Tegernsee und die deutsche Geistesgeschichte im 15. Jahrhundert. M\u252 \'fcnchen 1931 (Schriftenreihe zur bayerischen Landesgeschichte 9), S. 30f. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RC 1, Nr. 82. \endash  S.  J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Livesey\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Medieval Latin Aristotle Commentators, in: Bulletin de Philosophie m\u233 \'e9di\u233 \'e9vale 43 (2001), S. 95-132, ebd. S. 100. \endash  CALMA 1, S. 493, Aug 4.
