\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Notae variae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 1. Wortfelder: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 latria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 theusebia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dulia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  2. Pollutio nocturna: a) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pollucio tunc est peccatum mortale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Crimen habet noctis pollucio iam iacuisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ebrius aut primo meditatus turpe fuisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2 Verse). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Initia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Nr. 3445\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . b) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Pollucio tantum est peccatum veniale}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Crimen abest, tua si natura superflua \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tollit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 aut si debilior vacua se ventre resoluit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (3 Verse). \endash  3. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec sunt tenenda a quolibet sacerdote celebrante diuina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 O Sacerdos, corpus tuum cottidie efficitur sepulchrum christi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non apperiens os suum et non habet in ore suo redargutione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (9 Verse). \endash  4. Casus episcopales: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qui facit incestum deflorans aut homicida\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pontificem, super hiis semper devotus adibit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (6 Verse). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia, Nr. 15482. \endash  5. Casus papales: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Papa clerum feriens, falsarius et urens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Soluitur et\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quisquis audet celebrare ligatus, id est excommunicatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia, Nr. 13956. Danach Erkl\u228 \'e4rung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Sunt enim aliqui casus, in quibus percuciens clerum non est excommunicatus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nec indiget absolucione. Primus casus est, si causa discipline ut magister, prelatus uel presbyter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 septimus, si transfierit ad actum penitus contrarium, scilicet ad bigamiam uel miliciam. In hiis percuciens clerum non incurrit excommunicacionem, ut patet in hiis uersibus:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Officium lesusque pater doctorque propinquus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Affectu dominus vis et correctio laudis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quisquis sic conceptus, si sit moderamine rectus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): 6. Trinubium sanctae Annae seu de tribus Mariis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Anna habuit tres viros, scilicet Joachim, Cleopham, Salomam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quibus genuit unam Mariam, ista genuit christum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallelhss., Druck und Lit.: (2b)\plain \f3\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Darmstadt, ULB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat18 Hs 27}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  (3) Auch als \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Notabile sancti Bernardi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  bezeichnet. Br\u252 \'fcnn (tschech. Brno), M\u228 \'e4hrische LB - UB (tschech. Moravsk\u225 \'e1 zemsk\u225 \'e1 knihovna - Univerzitn\u237 \'ed knihovna, ehemals SVK = Staatliche wissenschaftliche Bibliothek),{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat18  Mk 110}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (I.48), 276\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Vgl. Catalogus codicum manu scriptorum Bibliothecae Dietrichs\plain \f4\lang1024\fs20 teinianae Nicolspurgensis = Soupis rukopis\u367 \'f9 mikulovsk\u233 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Dietrichsteinsk\u233 \'e9 knihovny. Beschrieben von V. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dokoupil\plain \f4\lang1024\fs20 . Prag 1958 (Catalogi codicum manu scriptorum in bibliotheca universitatis Brunensis asservatorum = Soupisy rukopisn\u253 \'fdch fond\u367 \'f9 Universitn\u237 \'ed \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 knihovny \plain \f4\lang1024\fs20 v Brn\u283 \'ec 2), S.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  213. \endash  (4) Vgl. P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Un recueil pol\u233 \'e9mique de Guillaume M\u226 \'e2con, in: Studia Gratiana 2 (1954), S. 621-642, Ed. ebd. S. 626 f. \endash  (5) Kremsm\u252 \'fcnster, Stiftsbibl., {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat18 CC 289}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .\plain \f3\lang1033\fs20  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Fill\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Kremsm\u252 \'fcnster 1,[1], S. 374\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Vgl. auch Clm 14011, hinterer Spiegel.\plain \f3\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash  (6) Halle (Saale), ULB, Qu. Cod. 207, 88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  K\u246 \'f6ln, StA, W 137, 223\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .
