\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -426\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Astesanus de Ast}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Summa de casibus conscientiae, li. 1-5}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad super benedicte trinitatis patris et filii et spiritus sancti precipuum laudis preconium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 per venerabilem valde virum, fratrem astexanum de ciuitate astensi, sacre theologie doctorem egregium prefati ordinis minorum compilata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 est Janue Anno domini m\u176 \'b0 ccc\u176 \'b0 xvi\u176 \'b0 ad deuotam instanciam Reuerendissimi in christo patris et domini Johannis gaytani, Romane ecclesie Cardinalis, cui scribit in hec uerba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Widmungsbrief des Verfassers an Kardinal Johannes Cajetanus de Ursinis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >R<euerendo in christo patri et domino, domino Johanni gaytano}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de urbe, diuina prouidencia dignissimo sacro sancte romane ecclesie Sancti theodori dyacono cardinali, frater astexanus de ast de ordine fratrum minorum eius humilis seruus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 valeat semper preclaritas magnificencie vestre ad dei honorem et ecclesie sue sancte edificacionem. Date Janue etc anno domini m\u176 \'b0 ccc\u176 \'b0 xvii\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rescriptio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >U<enerabili et religioso uiro, amico carissimo, fratri astexano de ciuitate astensi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ordinis fratrum minorum, iohannes miseracione diuina sancti theodori diaconus cardinalis salutem et sincere dilectionis affectum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quapropter dilectioni uestre graciarum plenas referimus acciones, toto cordis affectu, quod pro vobis gratum possimus offerentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prohemium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >B<onorum laborum gloriosus est fructus (Sap 3,15). Nullus autem labor est illo labore melior}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , qui animarum saluti proficit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et si oporteat alium fieri paragraphum in principio linee, infra predictam lineam fiat paragraphus et fiat semper, vbi est signatus in exemplari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber 1: (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kapitelverzeichnis Buch 1. \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Titulus 1: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De lege diuina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Dicturi ergo in hoc primo libro de decem preceptis moralibus de diuina lege}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , in qua ipsa continentur breuiter aliqua premittemus et primo de eius necessitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sicut et nunc layci transferunt ad clericatum et seculares ad religionem, licet sine hoc saluari possent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Titulus 47: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De lege humana non scripta, sed constituta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Einde considerandum de conswetudine et primo, quid est et unde dicitur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sic et conswetudo iuri uel priuilegio contraria reducitur ad concordiam per interpretacionem. Extra eodem cum dilectus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 1. 4.8). \endash  (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber 2. \endash  (178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -294\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber 3. \endash  294a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -294c\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (295\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Notae variae: zum Textbestand s. unten. \endash  (296\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -342\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber 4. \endash  (342\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -426\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber 5: (342\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -342\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kapitelverzeichnis. \endash  (342\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -343\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Titulus 1: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De virtute penitencie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 F\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inita quarta parte huius summe, que de sacramentis in communi et de tribus primis sacramentis, scilicet consecracione, eukaristia et baptisma, sequitur pars quinta, que est de sacramento penitencie et de sacramento unxionis extreme\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 prima virtus est per penitenciam perimere veterem hominem. In via vero prime formacionis fides est prior. Hec petrus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (424\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -426\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Titulus 41: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De extrema unctione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 C\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 onsequenter est considerandum de sacramento unctionis extreme. Primo de eius signacione et vnitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia quasi est alius status infirmitatis, licet non sit infirmitas alia simpliciter et in predictis concordant doctores. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (426\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Schlussschrift: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Finiti per dei laudem in vigilia wolfgangi Sub annis domini 1461\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < (30. Oktober 1461).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB, Nr. 1451. \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW 2758; BSB-Ink A-802,1. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , GQ 2, S. 425-427, hier S. 425, Anm. 1: diese Hs. \endash  J.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Dietterle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Summae confessorum sive de casibus conscientiae von ihren Anf\u228 \'e4ngen an bis zu Silvester Prierias (unter besonderer Ber\u252 \'fccksichtigung ihrer Bestimmungen \u252 \'fcber den Ablass). II: Die Summae confessorum des 14. und 15. Jahrhunderts bis zum Supplementum des Nicolaus de Ausmo, in: Zeitschrift f\u252 \'fcr Kirchengeschichte 26 (1905), S. 350-362. \endash  P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Michaud-Quantin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sommes de casuistique et manuels de confession au moyen \u226 \'e2ge (XII-XIV si\u232 \'e8cles). L\u246 \'f6wen 1962 (Analecta mediaevalia Namurcensia 13), S. 57-60. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Incipits Nr. 647. \endash  CALMA 1, S. 485, AST 1, Nr. 3.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

