\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Petrus de Tarantasia}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 In quartum librum sententiarum commentaria}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Haurietis aquas in< gaudio de fontibus salvatoris \u8230 \'85 (Is 12,3-4). In verbis istis duplex effectus sacramentorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , de quo in hoc quarto libro sententiarum agitur, sufficienter exprimitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tam culparum quam eciam penarum, prestante ipso samaritano redemptore humani generis, qui est benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Commentarius ad distinctiones 1 et 2: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9bSamaritanus etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 quid sit sacramentum. Sacramentum quattuor modis diffinitum inuenitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Magister diffinit sic: Sacramentum est sacre rei signum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sic itaque baptismus Johannis non equipollebat baptismo christi, ut fuit opinio magistri, sed tantum ad baptismum christi preparabat, quo suscepto nichilominus baptismum christi suscipere oportebat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Commentarius ad distinctionem 50: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9bHic oritur questio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic queruntur quatuor: primo de cognicione animarum separatarum generaliter \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9ba facie\u8249 \'8b, id est ab eius diuinitate, \u8250 \'9bper media\u8249 \'8b, scilicet per opera creacionis et recreacionis, \u8250 \'9busque ad pedes\u8249 \'8b, id est finalem statum mundi, \u8250 \'9buia duce peruenit\u8249 \'8b, christo scilicet, qui est via in exemplo, veritas in documento, vita in premio (Jo xiiii), ad quam vitam ipse, qui est via, nos perducat. Cui est honor et gloria in seculorum secula. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Schlussschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt questiones fratris petri super quarto sententiarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Questiones petri de Tarantasia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tabula operis precedentis videlicet questionum fratris petri de Tarantasia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB, Nr. 690. \endash  Druck: [Petrus de Tarantasia], Innocentii quinti pontificis maximi \u8230 \'85 in IV. librum sententiarum commentaria. Toulouse 1652. ND Ridgewood (New Jersey) 1964. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire 1, S.107 f.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

