\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Textus quarti libri Sententiarum, qui habet 50\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  distinctiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Distinctio 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >S<amaritanus enim wlnerato approprians}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , curacioni eius sacramentorum alligamenta adhibuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ingruente necessitate mortis ante octauam diem circumcidebant sine peccato filios, sicut modo in ecclesia fit de baptismo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -235\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Distinctio 50: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si mali in inferno peccabunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ic oritur questio ex premissis ducens originem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui a facie exorsus sedentis per media ad pedes usque via duce peruenit. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (235\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Schlussschrift: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit Textus quarti libri sententiarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 finiui In octaua sancti Johannis apostoli et ewangeliste sub anno domini 1446\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1. Juli 1446).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
