\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Inhalts\u252 \'fcbersicht: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tabula prima in dietam salutis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Verzeichnis der Kapitel: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tabula secunda diete salutis, in qua sunt diuisiones membrorum cuiuslibet capituli in qualibet dieta et sunt in vniuerso diete nouem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et capitula quinquaginta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (von anderer Hand \u252 \'fcberschrieben) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec materia esset predicanda per quadragesimam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  Prologus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Hec est uia, ambulate in ea neque ad dexteram neque ad sinistram< (Is 30,21). Magnam misericordiam facit, qui erranti viam ostendit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , maxime de nocte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 primo ergo in nomine domini agendum est de uiciis et primo in generali et postea in speciali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >P<Rimo ergo nota de peccato vel vicio in communi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Et est sciendum, quod peccatum est dictum, factum uel concupitum contra legem dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tercio debemus esse lucidi caritate, quere in materia de caritate et inuidia per contrarium etc. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Schlussschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit dieta salutis Anno domini 1449 feria sabati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
