\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Capitulatio: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 N isto libello sunt tres particule\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quartum de dotibus glorie paradisi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Dedicatio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >R<Euerendo in christo patri ac domino Raymundo diuina prouidentia sancte Valencie sedis episcopo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  suorum deuotorum minimus Guido de Monte Rocherii cum deuota et humili recommendacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 datum curoli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Teruel, Aragonien) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 anno domini Millesimo ccc\u176 \'b0 xxx\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prologus in librum, qui dicitur manipulus curatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Q<voniam secundum quod dicit propheta Malachias, ymmo dominus per Malachiam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Labia sacerdotis custodiunt scientiam et legem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Mal 2,7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Idcirco ne sacerdotibus legis euangelice contingat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut uideant ea, que circa suum officium sunt agenda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  (234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -303\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Partes 1-3: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit libellus, qui dicitur manipulus curatorum. Habet iii partes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iuiditur ergo presens opusculum in tres partes, in quarum prima agitur de hiis, que pertinent ad sacrorum administracionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Capitulum primum de institucione sacramentorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >S<ciendum ergo, quod omnia sacramenta noue legis fuerunt immediate instituta a christo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et pro peccatore ad dominum preces fundat, qui uiuit et regnat per infinita secula seculorum. Amen. 1449\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  304\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -305\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
