\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt excerpta de summa viciorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >D<Jcturi de singulis viciis, cum oportunitas se offert}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Incipiemus a vicio gule \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vitari autem non possunt nisi cognoscantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De viciis in communi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 T\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 riplici autem ratione ostendi potest vicia summa diligencia esse vitanda \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vicia sine modo et sine ordine persequenda sunt, quia modum et ordinem non habent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De vicio gule sunt autem xiv, que valent ad detestacionem huius vicii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >P<Rimum est hoc, quod natura dissuadet nobis illud vicium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Vnde legitur in sciencia naturali, quod inter animalia magnorum corporum nulli dedit natura tam paruum os secundum corporis quantitatem sicut homini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ultimo ad commendacionem silencii ualere potest illud sapientis: Locutum esse aliquando penituit tacuisse vero nunquam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Schlussschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt excerpta de summa vitiorum a chuonradus de Boppfingen conscripta et finita in die decollacionis sancti Johannis Baptiste Anno domini 1399\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Vgl. Colophons 1, S. 361, Nr. 2887. \endash  (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Register: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Notum sit omnibus Tabulam hanc legentibus, quod numerus cuilibet Auctoritati ascriptus numerum folii, in quo ipsa continetur, demonstrat, Littera vero sequens ipsam demonstrat auctoritatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit Tabula precedentis opusculi. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: GW 12055 (BSB-Ink G-525), li. II (Summa vitiorum), Fo. 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (A5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -S6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). \endash  Teiled.: C. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gutowski\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Le Trait\u233 \'e9 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 De Avaritia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  extrait de la Summa de Viciis de Guillaume Peyraut. Edition critique partielle et commentaire, in: Positions des th\u232 \'e8ses ..., Paris, Ecole des Chartes, 1975, S. 105-112 (nicht zug\u228 \'e4nglich). \endash  Lit.: A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dondaine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Guillaume Peyraut. Vie et \u339 \'9cuvres, in: Archivum fratrum praedicatorum 18 (1948), S. 162-236, hier S. 184-197 (mit Nennung der Hs.) \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Scriptores 2, S. 133-152, Nr. 1622 A und 6, S. 105f., Nr. II 133 (mit Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen zu Lit. und weiteren Textzeugen). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Incipits, Nr. 1628. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 R.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Newhauser\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The treatises on vices and virtues in Latin and the vernacular. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Turnhout\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  1993 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Typologie des sources du moyen \u226 \'e2ge occidental 68), S. 36, 127-130, 195f. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u178 \'b2VL 10 (1999), Sp. 1116-1129, zur Summa ebd. Sp. 1117-1119.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

