\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -272\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Guilelmus Peraldus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Summa virtutum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Inhalts\u252 \'fcbersicht: (oben in der Kopfzeile) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Distincciones capitulorum In summa virtutum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >P<Resens opus habet quinque partes principales}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Prima est de virtute in communi, secunda de tribus virtutibus theologicis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in duodecima parte tangitur de paciencia persecutionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 E\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 xpliciunt capitula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (links oben am Seitenrand in kleinerem Schriftgrad) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit summa seu opus de Virtutibus wilhelmi Episcopi Lugdunensis necnon ordinis fratrum predicatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Prolog: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ncipit prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod expediat uirtutem commendari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Cum circa utilia studere debeamus exemplo salomonis dicentis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Cogitaui in corde meo abstrahere a vino carnem meam ut animam meam transferrem ad sapienciam, donec viderem, quid esset utile filiis hominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ecl 2,3) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tercio de quattuor cardinalibus, quarto de donis, quinto de beatitudinibus. Explicit prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -272\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Partes I-V: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit Summa uirtutum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Capitulum primum. Virtutum commendacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >S<I separaueris preciosum a vili, quasi os meum eris (Ier 15,19). Preciosum est anima}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 presentes pressure sunt debita, quibus obligauerunt nostri parentes celestem hereditatem, ad quam nos perducere dignetur, qui uiuit et regnat per omnia secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: GW 12055; BSB-Ink G-525, li. I (Summa virtutum), fol. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (a1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -y6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). \endash  Lit.: A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dondaine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Guillaume Peyraut. Vie et \u339 \'9cuvres, in: Archivum fratrum praedicatorum 18 (1948), S. 162-236, zur Summa de vitiis et virtutibus ebd. S. 184-197, Nennung der Hs. S. 194. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Scriptores 2, S. 133-152, Nr. 1622 B und 6, S. 105 f., Nr. II 133 (mit Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen zu Lit. und weiteren Textzeugen). \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 R.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Newhauser\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The treatises on vices and virtues in Latin and the vernacular. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Turnhout\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  1993 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Typologie des sources du moyen \u226 \'e2ge occidental 68), S. 36, 127-130, 195 f. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u178 \'b2VL 10 (1999), Sp. 1116-1129, zur Summa ebd. Sp. 1117-1119.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

