\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog:{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18  >P<lures fuisse qui euangelia scripserunt ...}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sibi postea scribenda concludat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Interpretationes nominum in vetere et novo testamento: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >I<n abraham pater excelsus, ut dicitur \u8250 \'9bpater noster, qui es in celis\u8249 \'8b (Mt 6,9)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 n isaac gaudium, ut illud \u8250 \'9bnuncio uobis gaudium magnum, quod erit omni populo\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 2,10). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 n iacob supplantans ut est \u8250 \'9bnemo potest uasa fortis diripere nisi prius alligauerit fortem\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 12,29) ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Balaam hebreum populus uanus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Vgl. PL 93 1101D-1104B. \endash  (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber primus:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 In esaia legimus.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 \u8250 \'9bGenerationem eius quis enarrabit\u8249 \'8b}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18  (Is 53,8)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed scito, quod quantumcumque seminaueris tantum et messurus sis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Eivsdem liber comentariorvm \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in Matthevm explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit secvndus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >J<ohannes autem, cum audisset in uinculis opera christi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed a doctrina phariseorum et sadduceorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Finit comentariorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in Matheum explicit liber ii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit iii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >V<enit autem ihesus in partes cesaree filippi (Mt 16,13). Philippus iste est frater herodis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non quasi discipulus sed quasi temptator accedit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Comentariorvm \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in Mattheum explicit liber iii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber iiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >C<ongregatis autem pharisaeis \u8230 \'85 donec ponam inimicos tuos scabellum pedum tuorum (Mt 22,41-44). Qui ad temptandum ihesum ...}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in qua se scit futurum cum apostolis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit liber iiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. 
