\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >[I]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ncipit directorium per dominum Johannem Awrbach, Egregium doctorem decretorum compositum pro instruccione simplicium presbiterorum in cura animarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >A<D laudem dei animarum salutem curatorumque simplicium breuem et simplicem direccionem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  infra scripta ex textu Iuris canonici doctorum dictis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 secunda vero pars principalis subdiuiditur in septem, sicut septem sunt ecclesie sacramenta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De practica, modis et instruccionibus, quibus vti et se habere possit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et primo de actu audicionis confessionis ac interrogacionibus considerandis et cautelis in eo faciendis et adhibendis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >S<I iuxta legis sentenciam ciuilis in perorantibus causas rerum prophanarum iuris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pena eciam benedicentis secundas nupcias mitigata est per quandam extrauagantem, que incipit \u8250 \'9bConcertacionem antique\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (VI 2.15.8).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
