\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur tractatus de expedicione infirmorum, qui sunt in articulo mortis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [Q]Via circa infirmos maius est periculum, iam cum ipsis est consulcius procedendum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et intelligo per infirmos illos, qui sunt in articulo mortis constituti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 si est ibi aqua benedicta, asspergat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 infirmum et lectum ipsius circumquaque dicens: Exurgat deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <et dissipentur> \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inimici eius et fugiant qui oderunt a facie eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 67,2).
