\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 De oratione dominica}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit Tractatus bonus de Oracione dominica. Editus a Magistro Nicolao de dinckelsp\u252 \'fchel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >S<I quid pecieritis patrem in nomine meo, dabit vobis (Io 16,23) \u8230 \'85 Sanctus Crisostomus super illo Mathei 7\u176 \'b0}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9bPetite et dabitur vobis\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 7,7) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dicit: Petite et dabitur vobis, ut, quod ex hominibus consumari non potest, per graciam dei impleatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vt ab eo mereamur misericorditer exaudiri, maxime in peticione nostre salutis et beatitudinis sempiterne, quam nobis donare dignetur Jesus christus, dominus noster, qui cum patre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 12: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 E\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 t quia superius dictum fuit in principio exposicionis illius oracionis dominice, quod octaua condicio requisita ad exaudabilitatem oracionis est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vt sic ascendendo de virtute inchoata in virtutem perfectus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tandem mereatur videre deum deorum in syon, id est in celesti patria, quo nos perducat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, S. 175-179, diese Hs.: S. 178. \endash  Druck: R. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Damerau\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Der Herrengebetskommentar des Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl. Lateinische textkritische Ausgabe. Gie\u223 \'dfen 1971 (Studien zu den Grundlagen der Reformation 10), S. 1-139.}

