\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 De dilectione dei et proximi (De decem praeceptis)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit Tractatus bonus de decem preceptis Magistri Nicolai de dinckelsp\u252 \'fchel, doctore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sacre theologie egregio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)<. (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >S<cribitur Mathei 22\u176 \'b0, quod cum quidam legis doctor interrogasset dominum dicens}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Magister, quod est mandatum magnum in lege\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 22,36-40) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in hoc enim principaliter consistit nostra perfectio et meritum nostre salutis ac beatitudinis sempiterne, quam nobis concedat iesus christus dominus noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 11: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De Nominibus caritatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 N proximo dixi exemplariter aliqua de quiditate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 habitus caritatis et nominaui eam sex nominibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cuius beate et intuitive et beatifice fruicionis nos participes efficiat Jesus christus dominus noster, qui cum patre etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Schlussschrift: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et tantum de illis duobus preceptis et mandatis principalibus. Sequitur nunc de preceptis et mandatis decalogi, que deus dedit populo in monte synai in duabus tabulis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, S. 162-164, diese Hs.: S. 167. \endash  Druck der Sermones 1-3: B. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schnell\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , T. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Peuntner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8250 \'9bB\u252 \'fcchlein von der Liebhabung Gottes\u8249 \'8b. Edition und Untersuchungen. M\u252 \'fcnchen 1984 (M\u252 \'fcnchener Texte und Untersuchungen zur deutschen Literatur des Mittelalters 81), S. 356-383.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

