\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 De decem praeceptis decalogi}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >P<Reter precepta legis nature et communia, vt sunt illa}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Omne bonum est faciendum, nullum malum est faciendum. Non facias alteri, quod non vis tibi fieri, hoc facias alteri, quod tibi vis fieri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed hoc facit suaue, quoniam ipsorum est regnum celorum, quod est nobis largiri dignetur jesus christus dominus noster etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 12: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Decimum preceptum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ecimum mandatum est: Non concupisces rem proximi tui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Ex 20,17; Dt 5,21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pro quo notandus, quod sicut dixi in precedenti mandato, ita intelligitur in presenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut huiusmodi mandatorum obseruancia sit deo accepta et digna premio glorie sempiterne, ad quam nos perducere dignetur sancta trinitas et indiuisa vnitas, pater et filius et spiritus sanctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Schlussschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt decem precepta finita Wienne Anno domini 1431\u176 \'b0 in profesto sanctorum decem milium martirum et taliter collecta per doctorem eximium Magistrum Nicolaum de dinckelsp\u252 \'fchel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (21. Juni 1431). \endash  122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, S. 169-171, diese Hs.: S. 172.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

