\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 De vitiis et virtutibus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus de septem viciis et virtutibus eis oppositis. Editus a Magistro Nicolao de dinckelsp\u252 \'fchel sacre theologie professore egregio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >N<Vnc dicendum est de viciis et aliquibus virtutibus eis oppositis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Et est pro illo notandus, quod, vt docet Magister 2\u176 \'b0 sententiarum, distinctione prima: Deus a principio hominem ad hoc creauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 volo de singulis mortalibus aliquibus dicere et primo de superbia, que est primum peccatorum mortalium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 12a: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur de accidia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ostremo inter vicia capitalia dicendum est de accidia, pro quo notandus primo, quod accipiendo accidiam prout est peccatum speciale contra alia vicia distinctum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod talis adhuc scit loqui de spiritualibus, de quo sepe superbire incipit preferendo se aliis ex hoc, qui talia ignorant. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Schlussschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Finitus est iste tractatus Magistri Nicolai de dinckelsp\u252 \'fcchel de septem peccatis mortalibus et virtutibus eis oppositis in horburg Anno etc xxxv\u176 \'b0 in profesto Marie Magdalene\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (21. Juli 1435). \endash  244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -262\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, S. 192-195, zu den verschiedenen \u220 \'dcberlieferungsvarianten ebd. S. 195 (vorliegende Hs. \u252 \'fcberliefert die Kombination der Varianten 1 und 3), diese Hs.: S. 197.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

