\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >S<I quid pecieritis patrem in nomine meo, dabit vobis (Io 16,23) \u8230 \'85 Sanctus Crisostomus super illo Matheo 7}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9bPetite et dabitur uobis\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 7,7) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dicit: Petite et dabitur vobis, ut, quod ex hominibus consumari non potest, per gratiam dei impleatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut ab eo mereamur misericorditer exaudiri, maxime in peticione nostre salutis et beatitudinis sempiterne, quam nobis dare dignetur ihesus christus, dominus noster, qui cum patre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 12: [E]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 T quia superius dictum fuit in principio exposicionis istius orationis dominice, quod octaua condicio requisita ad exaudibilitatem orationis est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut sic ascendendo de virtute in virtutem tandem mereamur videre deum deorum in syon, id est in celesti patria, quo nos perducat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, S. 175-177, diese Hs.: S. 178. \endash  Druck: Vgl. die Angaben zu 3783, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

