\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 De vitiis et virtutibus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus de viciis et virtutibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 H}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 <}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Omo quidam fecit cenam magnam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18  \u8230 \'85 (Lc 14,16-17). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Postillam huius ewangelii require dominica secunda post penthecosten}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Sequens autem materia de septem peccatis capitalibus ad idem pertinet ewangelium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quam sepe habet bonum propositum, a quo facilime cadit propter paruam causam et leuem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 12a: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De accidia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ost ea, que dicta sunt prius de aliis peccatis capitalibus dicendum est nunc communiter de accidia, pro quo notandum primo, quod accipiendo accidiam prout est peccatum speciale contra alia vicia distinctum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 preferendo se ex hoc aliis, qui talia ignorant. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Schlussschrift (von anderer Hand): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tractatus de viciis et virtutibus magistri Nicolai dinckelsp\u252 \'fcl Egregii doctoris Winensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, S. 192-196, diese Hs.: S. 197. \endash  Zu Sermo 12a vgl. auch ebd. S. 165.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

