\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus de penitentia et partibus eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 E]Cce nunc tempus acceptabile (II Cor 2,6) \u8230 \'85 Duo sunt tempora hominis, unum iusticie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quod incipit in hominis morte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 contra triplex ius, naturale, ecclesiasticum et diuinum, a quo nos custodiat, qui sine fine viuit et regnat. Amen. Finis huius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
