\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De octo beatitudinibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. (176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >I<N ewangelio, quod legitur in festo omnium sanctorum et scribitur Mathei quinto}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Mt 5,1-12)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Enumerat dominus octo beatitudines et omnibus eis idem premium assignat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hic ex altari per gratiam et inter choros angelorum eterna gloria, quod omnibus nobis largiatur omnipotens dominus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 10: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 O\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ctaua et vltima beatitudo est paciencia, de qua dominus loquitur Mathei quinto: Beati, qui persecucionem paciuntur propter iusticiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mt 5,10) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod deo placeamus et mereamur peruenire ad beatitudinem eternam, largiatur nobis omnipotens deus in secula benedictus. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur tractatus de dilectione dei et proximi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (Von anderer Hand nachgetragen) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota, excerptum de tribulacione sufficienda. Dixit beata sincletice, ut habetur in vitis patrum, ut scribit Jeronimus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Si infirmitas nobis supervenerit, non contristemur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quia ad destruenda corporis desideria nobis proficiunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed gaudeamus, quia interiori homini nostro sanitas crescit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Valerius Sancti Petri de Montibus, De vana saeculi sapientia ex epistola de beata Echeria, c. 16. Druck: PL 87, 430D-431B.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, S. 187-189, diese Hs.: S. 190. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Synkletike (um 320-400) war eine aus Alexandria stammende Mystikerin.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

