\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus de decem preceptis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. (253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >P<Reter precepta legis nature communia, vt sunt illa}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Omne bonum est faciendum, nullum malum est faciendum. Non facias alteri, quod tibi non vis fieri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quoniam ipsorum est regnum celorum, quod et nobis largiri dignetur ihesus christus dominus noster etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (301\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -302\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 12: [D]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ecimum mandatum est: Non concupisces rem proximi tui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Ex 20,17; Dt 5,21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pro quo notandum, quod sicut dixi in precedenti mandato, itaque intelligatur in presenti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut huiusmodi mandatorum obseruancia sit deo accepta et digna premio glorie sempiterne, ad quam nos perducere dignetur sancta trinitas et indiuisa unitas, pater et filius et spiritus sanctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tractatus de decem preceptis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, S. 169-171, diese Hs.: S. 172.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

