\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Haselspach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de evangelio \u8250 \'9bHomo quidam fecit cenam\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < (Lc 14,16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 aliqua de uoluptate carnali et ut homines incitentur ad uirginitatem seruandam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et presertim de coniugio. Quot enim sunt, qui contra suam conscientiam infinitis modis adquiruntur diuicias iniuste spoliando, furando usuras, committendo fraudes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hoc tamen procul dubio nouimus, quia quisquis quotidie predictis horis officia in eius laudibus frequentare statuerit ad iutricem sibi et coassistricem ipsius iudicis matrem in die necessitatis adquirit. Hec petrus damiani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

