\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 303\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -304\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Notae variae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Haselspach: Nota,{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1  aliquando homines cicius moriuntur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , quia sunt superflui et neque aliis nec sibi utiles, quia non bene agendo proficiunt in virtutibus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  itaque similiter moriuntur pauperes, stulti et sapientes, vtiles et invtiles\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Soccus: Item {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 ad hebreos vi dicitur: Inpossibile est eos, qui semel illuminati sunt \u8230 \'85 (Hbr 6,4-6). Glosa \u8250 \'9bimpossibile\u8249 \'8b, id est difficile propter hoc talibus tepidis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et nec frigidus nec calidus incipiam te euomere de ore meo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (3) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Dicit enim apostolus prima thimothei 2\u176 \'b0: Mulieres in habitu ornato cum uerecundia et sobrietate ornantes \u8230 \'85 (I Tim 2,9), per quod datur intellegi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , quod sobrius et moderatus ornatus non prohibitur mulieribus, sed superfluus et inuerecundus et inmoderatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9bvisitabo super omnes, qui induti sunt veste peregrina\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (So 1,8), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sed iste vnus vestitur veste peregrina, qui nouo more et modo vestitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (4) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Dubitatur, vt virgines possint se ornare sine peccato, ut placeant viris}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Respondetur secundum Alexandrum, quod dulces sunt virgines, que volant in virginitate permanere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  virgo enim dum est, cogitet, que dei sunt, cum autem coniugata est, cogitat, quomodo placeat viro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (5) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Sunt autem plura, per que irreuerencia loco sacro siue sit cimiterium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  siue ecclesia exhiberi potest \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 et ponit ibi causam aliam, ne ubi est peccatorum venia postulanda ibi peccandi, occasio detur aut comprehendantur peccata committi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nr. 1: Thomas Ebendorfer von Haselbach. \endash  Nr. 2: Vgl. zu Conradus de Brundelsheim F.-J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Worstbrock\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \u178 \'b2VL 5 (1985), Sp. 147-153.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Verdana;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red157\green185\blue235;\red157\green185\blue235;}

