\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 305\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -330\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Petrus Reicher de Pirchenwart}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 De corpore Christi}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Assit in principio sancta maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. (305\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -309\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo A: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >O< Sacrum conviuium, in quo christus sumitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 gratia nobis pignus datur future glorie. Verba hec sunt matris ecclesie, ea per octauam corporis christi canentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod omnibus concedere dignetur panis iste uite, qui se nobis dedit in edulium animarum, et cum patre et spiritu sancto uiuit et regnat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (325\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -330\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo D: [O] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sacrum conviuium \u8230 \'85 . Venerabiles patres necnon dilectissimi fratres, sicut vestra dilectio in proximo sermone audiuit, quo ad terciam particulam thematis nostri sermones implentur gratia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 heretici audientes illam veritatem ecclesie et sanctorum doctorum, non credunt ecclesie certe non ex alio, nisi quia ex deo non sunt, sed magis ex patre dyabolo, a quo nos liberet deus trinus et vnus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, S. 317 f. \endash  Zu Petrus Reicher de Pirchenwart vgl. Clm 3768, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -311\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

