\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18  Gregorius Magnus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Regula pastoralis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kapitelverzeichnis. \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini nostri ihesu Incipit li\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ber regu]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 le pastoralis Gregorii pape vrbis R\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ome ad] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Johannem archiepiscopum ciuitatis Rauenn\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [atis]<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 P}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 <}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 astoralis cure me pondera}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  [fugere] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 delitescendo voluisse}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  benigna, frater karissime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ([ ] = erg\u228 \'e4nzt wegen Textverlusts durch Papierschaden) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut quia pondus proprium deprimit, tui me meriti manus leuet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Schlussschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  *\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 liber regule\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 * \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pastoralis beati Gregorii pape vrbis Rome. Finito libro sit laus et gloria christo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (*-* \u252 \'fcberschrieben wohl von der Hand des Conradus Kastner). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Finitus et scriptus est liber iste per me Conradum Storck, Canonicum collegii beate marie virginis in Eychstetten novo in die sancte Dorothee virginis et martiris anno etc millesimo quadricentesimo sexagesimosecundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ( = 6. Februar 1462). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Orate deum pro scriptore causa retribucionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Einf\u252 \'fchrung und Inhalts\u252 \'fcbersicht (wohl von der Hand des Conradus Kastner nachgetragen): >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ntencio libri pastoralis, cur et quomodo scriptus et editus est in epistola, que prologo anteponit, continetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in quarta, qualiter suam infirmitatem agnoscat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u179 \'b3CPL 1712. \endash  Druck: PL 77, 13-128. \endash  CC 144 B (in Vorbereitung). \endash  Lit.: R. W. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Clement\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , A handlist of manuscripts containing Gregory's \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Regula pastoralis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: Manuscripta 28 (1984), S. 33-44, ebd. S. 40 (diese Hs.).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

