\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Johannes Nider}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Consolatorium timoratae conscientiae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus, qui intitulatur consolatorium tymorate consciencie Reuerendi patris fratris Johannis Nider sacre theologie professoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog und Kapitelverzeichnis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [A]put disciplinas reperimus visicas (vielm. physicas) diuersis morbis corporum medicos}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tradidisse antidota varia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quando excuset et quando non excuset\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod consciencia primo modo capitur pro spe et ponuntur septem fructus bone consciencie. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Primo igitur animadvertendum est, quod consciencia vno modo sumitur pro re conscita}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 a cuiusmodi compilacione, si quisque, quod suum est, recipere velit, nichil aut modicum auctori manebit. Explicit presens materia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Hain 11808; M\u252 \'fcnchen, BSB, 4 Inc.s.a. 1340 b (BSB-Ink N-140,3). \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Scriptores 2, S. 501 f., Nr. 2535 (diese Hs.). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Incipits, Nr. 465 (ohne diese Hs.)\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash  Vgl. auch E. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hillenbrand\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \u178 \'b2VL 6 (1987), Sp. 971-977, ebd. Sp. 975, Nr. 14.}

