\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Q<VOniam, karissimi, in via huius vite fugientis sumus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , nostri dies sicut vmbra pretereunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et cum domino nostro ihesu christo vitam eternam possideatis, qui cum patre et spiritu sancto viuit et regnat deus per omnia secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Schlussschrift: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit Speculum mortis beati Augustini Episcopi memoriis hominum intime commendandis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
