\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Johannes Gerson}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 De vita spirituali animae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Kopftitelzeile: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus gersonis de vita spirituali anime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Widmungsvorrede: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >R<Euerendissimo in christo patri ac domino et sacre theologie professori, eximio domino petro Episcopo Cameracensi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , eius discipulus johannes cancellarius indignus ecclesie parisiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Postulare dignata est beniuolencia tua, quatenus scripto tibi traderem unam ex lectionibus meis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tertia loquitur de vita anime per contemplacionem stabilite et consolate. Bene vale, Pater in christo, et oremus pro invicem, ut saluemur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >E<go vos baptiso in aqua, ille vos baptizabit spiritu sancto (Mc 1,8). Antiqua iam atque nouissima patrum erudicione compertum habemus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quid operabatur baptismus johannis et quid baptismus christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cui sicut prefaciuncule inicium ita finem huius operis dedicamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Laus deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -135a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \u338 \'8cuvres 2, Nr. 14, S. 63 f. (Widmungsvorrede), \u338 \'8cuvres 3, Nr. 97, S. 113-202 (Text).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

