\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Jan Hus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Quaestio de correctione cleri seu de arguendo clero}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 [C]Jrca preparacionem ewangelii, de qua dictum est, videtur vtile dubitare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , vtrum in ewangelizatione coram clero et omni populo licet caritatiue cleri maliciam arguere, ypocrisim eius detegere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et patet, quod questio non impugnatur in sua virtute per omnia argumenta, que in oppositum sunt adducta. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Barto\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u353 \'9a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Spunar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Soupis, S. 101f., Nr. 50 (s. 136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , ohne diese Hs.). \endash  Druck: Ioannis Hus et Hieronymi Pragensis \u8230 \'85 Historia Et Monumenta 1, Bl. 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

