\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 De simonia et aliis exemplis venditionis beneficiorum ecclesiasticorum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota excerptum juris canonici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Exzerpte aus dem Decretum Gratiani: C.1 q.1 c.105, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Friedberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sp. 399f. \endash  C.1 q.3 c.15, ed. ebd., Sp. 418. \endash  C.13 q.2 c.12-14, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Friedberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sp. 724-726. \endash  (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Gregorius Magnus, Dialogorum libri iv, li. 4. c. 52, ed. PL 77, 415BC. \endash  (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ernestus de Pardubitz, Statuta provincialia, c. 65:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item in statutis Arnesti provincialibus Capitulo \u8250 \'9bde Symonia\u8249 \'8b dicitur: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 In tantum peccatis exigentibus corda quorundam presbyterorum symoniaca prauitas deprauat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. X 5. 3.36), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod nec baptismi, eukaristie, penitencie aut extreme vnctionis sacramenta nec benedictionem nubencium aut exequias seu sepulturam mortuorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et oleo per se uel per alios aliquid presumpserint extorquere, suis beneficiis spolientur. Hec ex concilio arnesti archiepiscopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Petrus Lombardus, Sententiae, li. 4, dist. 25, c. 4-6, ed. PL 192, 907f. \endash  (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Exzerpte aus den Decretales Gregorii: X 5. 3.8-9, 29, 42. \endash  (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota super illo supra \u8250 \'9bSi quis prebendas\u8249 \'8b etc Innocencii pape infra q. 1, tria ibi innuit: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Primo, quia sub nullius conswetudinis obtentu pro sacramentis aliud exigatur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , secundo nec ante nec post exigitur et tertio causa subditur: Quoniam symoniacum est perconsequens hereticum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. C.1 q.3 c. 15, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Friedberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sp. 418) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod simon primo voluit emere donum dei et postea more gezi voluit exigere, patet intra per magistrum quarto sentenciarum, distinctione 25\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , vbi dicit \u8250 \'9bLicet symoniaci\u8249 \'8b etc ut supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9bPrauas exacciones fieri prohibemus\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 5. 3.42): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Que enim prauis consuetudo, queque est a sacramentis patribus et ab ecclesia prohibita}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , puta importuna sacramentorum exaccio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod veritas sacre scripture, que omni populo scripta est, ad memoriam debet omni populi declarari et secundum capacitatem audiencium atque temporis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota probreuiatorius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Juris canonici: Primo, quod totum jus in duas partes diuiditur, in jus canonicum et jus ciuile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de istis ergo et talibus dicit dominus per prophetam: Isti regnauerunt, sed non ex me principes extiterunt et non cognoui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Os 8,4). \endash  (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota Ysa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <ja>: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Subter te sternetur tinea \u8230 \'85 (Is 14,11). Quidam asserit, quod de cerebro putrefacto oritur buffo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et hoc propter pondus superbie, de putrefactione lingwe nascuntur uermes propter peccata locutionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 quod faciat contra legem ludi, ut non male computet nec eciam ludentem prouocet, prout hec notantur de ludo alee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Notandum autem, quod secundum duplicem spem est duplex adoracio siue cultus diuinus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Nam quedam est spes salutis et hec in solo deo ponenda est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 enim solus deus sit efficaciter causa gracie, beata tum virgo et ceteri sancti meritorie per modum suffragii deprecatiui possunt esse cause gracie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Votum est spontanea promissio cum deliberacione uel obligacione firmata}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , ex quo patet, quod ad uotum tria requiruntur: primum propositum voluntatis, quia debet fieri ex animi libertate, non autem ex coacta necessitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod omnis christianus, quia in die ista diceret illos versus cum deuocione uel totidem \u8250 \'9bpater noster\u8249 \'8b et \u8250 \'9baue maria\u8249 \'8b, invenieret ibi multum fructum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Kirchenrechtliche Sammlung mit Exzerpten u. a. aus dem \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Decretum Gratiani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  und dem \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Liber extra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Bemerkenswert ist die Rezeption des Kapitels \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 De simonia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  aus den Provinzialstatuten, die Erzbischof Ernestus de Pardubitz (1297-1364) auf der ersten Prager Reformsynode (11.-12. November 1349) erlassen hatte. \endash  Druck: Statuta provincilia, in: \plain \f2\lang1024\fs20 Pra\u382 \'9esk\u233 \'e9 synody a koncily p\u345 \'f8edhusitsk\u233 \'e9 doby. Hrsg. von J\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . V. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Polc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  und Z. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hled\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u237 \'ed\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 kov\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u225 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Prag 2002, Nr. XIII, S. 115-164, ebd. S. 150 f., S. 27-29 mit Angabe fr\u252 \'fcherer Editionen. \endash  Lit.: J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Polc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , E. von Pardubitz, in: Lebensbilder zur Geschichte der b\u246 \'f6hmischen L\u228 \'e4nder. Bd. 3: Karl IV. und sein Kreis. Hrsg. von F. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Seibt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . M\u252 \'fcnchen 1978, S. 25-42, ebd. S. 31 f. \endash  P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Krafl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Arn\plain \f2\lang1024\fs20 o\u353 \'9atova provinci\u225 \'e1ln\u237 \'ed statuta z roku 1349. V\u253 \'fdznamn\u225 \'e1 \u269 \'e8esk\u225 \'e1 pr\u225 \'e1vn\u237 \'ed pam\u225 \'e1tka, in: Arno\u353 \'9at z Pardubic (1297-1364).\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Osobnost, o\plain \f2\lang1024\fs20 kruh, d\u283 \'ecdictv\u237 \'ed; posta\u263 \'e6, \u347 \'9crodo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 wisko, dziedzictwo. Hrsg. von L. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bobkov\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u225 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , R. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gladkiewicz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Vorel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Warschau, Prag, Pardubitz 2005, S. 59-64.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Verdana;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red157\green185\blue235;\red157\green185\blue235;}

