\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo beati Ambrosii de vidvis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Bene accidit, fratres, ut, quoniam tribus libris superioribvs de vir<ginum laudibus disseruimus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , uiduarum tractatus incideret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cauete igitur, filie, ne et gratiam nuptiarum tenere nequeatis, et molestias augeatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
