\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Gregorius Turonensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Liber de miraculis sancti Andreae apostoli}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt capituli sancti Andree apostoli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kapitelverzeichnis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 i-xxxviii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Inclita sanctorum Apostolorum trophea nulli< credo latere fidelium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed integritas rationis et puritas mentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Cap. 1-37: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Igitvr post illvm dominice ascensionis nobilem gloriosvmque< triumphum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cum beati apostoli predicare uerbum domini per diuersas regiones dipersi fuissent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut cum ille post iudicium dominico corpori conformatus refulget in gloria, saltim obtineat pro inmensis criminibus mihi uel ueniam non negandam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 BHL 430. \endash  Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Nausea \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (1531)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , fol. IX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 -XXII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  (s. Nr. 4). \endash  Georgii Florentii Gregorii episcopi Turonensis liber de miraculis beati Andreae apostoli. E\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 d. M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bonnet,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  in: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Monumenta Germania historica, Scriptores rerum Merovingicarum I. Hannover 1884, S. 821-846, S. 824 (diese Hs.), S. 827-846 (Edition). \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Supplementum codicis apocryphi II. Acta Andreae cum laudatione contexta et martyrium Andreae graece. Passio Andreae latine. A se primum edita ex Analectis Bollandianis repetiit, praefatus est, indices adiecit. Hrsg. von M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bonnet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . Paris 1895. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lipsius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die apokryphen Apostelgeschichten 1, S. 135-138, S. 174 (zu den Quellen), S. 549 f., S. 562 f., S. 602 f. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zelzer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Zur Frage des Autors der \u187 \'bbMiracula b. Andreae apostoli\u171 \'ab (s. Nr. 1). \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bourgain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Heinzelma\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 nn\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , L'\u339 \'9cuvre de Gr\u233 \'e9goire de Tours. La diffusion des manuscrits, in: Gr\u233 \'e9goire de Tours et l'espace gaulois: Actes du congr\u232 \'e8s international, Tours, 3-5 novembre 1994. Hrsg. von N. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gauthier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  und H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Galini\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Tours 1977 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Suppl\u233 \'e9ment \u224 \'e0 la \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Revue arch\u233 \'e9ologique du Centre de la France 13), S. 273-317, ebd. S. 313 f.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

