\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit passio sancti Iacobi fratris Iohannis apostoli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Jacobvs frater Iohannis apostoli< et euangeliste omnem iudeam et samariam visitabat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cum apostolo una hora simul martyr effectus, perrexit ad dominum, cui est gloria in secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <.
