\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u220 \'dcberschrift am Rand von j\u252 \'fcngerer Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De fine et obitu herodis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Textanfang defekt: ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 <H>erodes et in die sollempni preclara ues<te indutus regia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pro tribunali sedisset, hac de suplimi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  concionaretur ad populum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 talis igitur herodi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 extitit finis, quo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 digna supplicia pateretur, ut crudelitati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quam circa apostolos christi excreuerat et indigna uita uiuens, digna morte moreretur regnante domino nostro ihesu christo, qui uiuit et regnat in secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 BHL 4318. \endash  Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Nausea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (1531)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , fol. XL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 -XL\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  (s. Nr. 4).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

