\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit passio sanctorum apostolorum Simonis et iude\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Simon itaque< chananeus et iudas apostoli domini nostri ihesu christi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , cum per reuelationem spiritus sancti perside fuissent regionem ingressi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et stupentibus cunctis dixit symon ad simulacrum solis: Precipio tibi ludi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || (Text bricht ab).
