\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -255\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Guilelmus Peraldus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Summa vitiorum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit summa viciorum. Et primo de vicio gule, deinde de cetteris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 secundum ordinem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >D<Icturi de singulis viciis, primo incipiamus a vicio gule}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quia dicit glosa super Mattheum iiii: In pugna christi primus contra gulam agitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et iterum: vicia sine modo et sine ordine persequenda sunt, quia modum et ordinem non habent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -255\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De vicio gule secunda pars principalis in ordine. Et pars prima huius tractatus gule\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >H<Oc ordine dicemus de vicio gule}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Primo dicemus de hiis, que faciunt ad detestationem huius vicii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ultimo ad commendacionem silencii potest ualere illud Sapientis: Locutum esse aliquando me penituit et tacere vero numquam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (255\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Schlussschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit summa viciorum liber multum utilis et magistra totius status humane nature tam spiritualium quam secularium. Scripta per Vdalricum schalhas de oberstorff fferia tercia ante festum Symonis et Jude Anno domini 1462\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (25. Oktober). \endash  256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -257\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed.: GW 12055 (BSB-Ink G-525), li. II (Summa vitiorum), Fo. 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (A5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -S6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). \endash  Teiled.: C. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gutowski\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Le Trait\u233 \'e9 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 De Avaritia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  extrait de la Summa de Viciis de Guillaume Peyraut. Edition critique partielle et commentaire, in: Positions des th\u232 \'e8ses ..., Paris, Ecole des Chartes, 1975, S. 105-112 (nicht zug\u228 \'e4nglich). \endash  Lit.: A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dondaine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Guillaume Peyraut. Vie et \u339 \'9cuvres, in: Archivum fratrum praedicatorum 18 (1948), S. 162-236, hier S. 184-197 (mit Nennung der Hs.) \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Scriptores 2, S. 133-152, Nr. 1622 A und 6, S. 105 f., Nr. II 133 (mit Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen zu Lit. und weiteren Textzeugen). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Incipits, Nr. 1628. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 R.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Newhauser\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The treatises on vices and virtues in Latin and the vernacular. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Turnhout\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  1993 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Typologie des sources du moyen \u226 \'e2ge occidental 68), S. 36, 127-130, 195 f. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u178 \'b2VL 10 (1999), Sp. 1116-1129, zur Summa ebd. Sp. 1117-1119.}

