\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -331\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Richardus de Sancto Laurentio}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De laudibus beatae Mariae virginis libri XII}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad lectorem et scriptorem: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >N<ota prudens lector et acquiesce obsecro hiis, que tibi dicturus sum ad honorem dei}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et beatissime matris eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nec prius michi precauisset de sinceritate libri modis omnibus conseruanda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Divisio libri. \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >U<Niuersis christi fidelibus inspecturis oculo simplici presens opusculum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que ferrum prevalet acutum reddere, cum sit inutilis ad secandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog 2: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >D<ictum est iohanni sancto theologo: Quod uides, scribe in libro \u8230 \'85 (Apc 1,11)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In hoc loco et multis aliis \u8250 \'9bvidere\u8249 \'8b ponitur pro \u8250 \'9bintellegere\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ne tractatus forte vilesceret cognito tractatore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -331\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Libri 1-12: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >A<ue maria, gratia plena, dominus tecum, benedicta tu in mulieribus \u8230 \'85 (Lc 1,28). Tres salutaciones celebriores ceteris in euangelio reperimus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quere exposicionem huius auctoritatis in xii priuilegio prope finem capituli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Schlussschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deo gracias. Honor lausque Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Beati Alberti Magni \u8230 \'85 opera omnia. Ed. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Borgnet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Bd. 36: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 De laudibus Beatae Mariae virginis libri XII.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Paris 1898, S. 1-841.}

