\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer; 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Thomas Ebendorfer de Haselbach}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Sermones de sanctis}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1  }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nota sermones magistri Thome a Haselbach de sanctis et primo de tempore hiemali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [Perchtoldsdorfer Predigten] Praefatio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Laudate dominum in santis eius (Ps 150,1). Sic monet propheta regius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [i. e. David] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 spiritu sancto afflatus ut ne dum pro forma beate conuersationis sanctorum studeamus deo nostro immortales gratias agere sed et eorum exemplis imitari discamus de uirtute in uirtutem ascendentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Etiam hoc opus collationum pro suis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [scil. sanctorum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 festis prout et his decurrentibus annis  populo michi credito in Bertelsdorff\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [=Perchtoldsdorf] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 propria in persona utinam tam fructuose quam laboriose declamarem in vnum conpingere amicorum deuictus precibus quod percensui lectori offerre pro minus benedictis veniam petens pro benedictis autem dignas habere gratas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Sequitur collacio de sancto Andrea<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Prothema: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Corde creditur ad iustitiam, ore autem confessio fit ad salutem etc. Ad Rom. 10 (10). Inter tres virtutes theologicas que immediate faciunt hominem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  contemplari deum vna est fides que deum facit contemplari ut summum infallibile verum ymo ut inmutabilis veritas est \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 ut dicit Ambrosius super psalmum 46: Scientes quia corde creditur ad iuistitiam ut in presenti epistola. Pro gracia dicamus Aue Maria.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 - (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Hauptthema: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Corde creditur \u8230 \'85 (Rm 10,10). Dicit enim scriptura: Omnis qui credit }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in Christum non confundetur \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 vnde dyabolus confusus disparuit.- Plura vide in legenda.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Collatio secunda de sancto Andrea< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Corde creditur ad iustitiam \u8230 \'85 Ad Rom 10 (10). Multi sunt de presenti quos sathanas plus regnat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  in multo quam verbum dei scientes qui multos saluat \u8230 \'85-\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ut per  veram fidem \u8230 \'85 obseruancia mandatorum dei ad quietem et salutem quam credentibus promitti mereamur peruenire etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Etc. Fol. 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Hinweis, da\u223 \'df die Passionspredigten, die eigentlich hierher geh\u246 \'f6rten, erst im Anschlu\u223 \'df an die Heiligenpredigten (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) zu finden sind.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Letzter Sermo in der Reihe der Sermones de sanctis. Prothema: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Sancti uero ludibria et verbera experti insuper et vincula et carcerem etc. Ad Hebr. 11 (36). Recte et ex quodam debito}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  sanctorum martirum solempnis honorat et festiuat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ecclesia \u8230 \'85 verbera libenter passi sunt quod dicitur in epistola presenti. Pro gracia di\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [camus].- (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Hauptthema: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Sancti uero distenti sunt non suscipientes redemptionem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  vt meliorem invenirent resurrectionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85- (123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hodie suffragium petamus \u8230 \'85 vt memores preceptorum eius per ea perueniamus ad portum quietis eterne ad quam nos perducat qui sine fine viuit et regnat. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .- 123a-123b leer.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

