\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Passionspredigten}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Passio domini Jhesu Christi<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Prothema: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 [S]cietis quia post biduum pasca fiet etc. Mt 26 (2). Postquam, dilectissimi, per totum anni circulum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Christi humanitatem et deitatem et miracula et per hoc suam omnipotentiam predicauimus, quomodo in mundum ingressus est et in eo conuersatus sit \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 Hodie tristis astitit cruci pro nobis ut graciam obtinet nobis. Pro gracia dicamus Aue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .- (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Hauptthema: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Scitis quia post biduum pasca fiet \u8230 \'85 Mt 26 (2). Quamuis Iudei pluribus diebus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  et longo tempore cogitassent occidere Christum velut (?) Johannes 8 et in pluribus locis ewangelii, tamen ex diuina dispositione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [ \u8230 \'85] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sacrilegi hoc non potuerunt perficere nec permittebantur nisi in sollemnitate paschale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85- (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et compati possumus ut in hora exitus nostri fructum tue passionis sentiamus. Amen etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Es Folgen weiter Passionspredigten.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Die letzte Predigt (ohne \u220 \'dcberschrift): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Finaliter secuntur ea que meditanda sunt pro completorio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  scil. quod dominus est positus in sepulcro et vbi de quibus clarius habetur Joh. 19\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (41): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Erat autem in loco vbi crucifixus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [h]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ortus et in orto monumentum nouum \u8230 \'85 Vbi describit ewangelista Christi sepulturam et duplicem rationem quare in loco isto collocabatur scilicet loci congruitas et temporis breuitas \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 te sepeliam in corde meo ut ego tecum consepultus tecum, merear pervenire ad resurrectionis gloriam. Amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 )  Anleitung zur Meditation \u252 \'fcber die Passion: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Nunc breuiter qui wlt a multis multipliciter (?) custodiri recogitat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  qualiter dominus septem horas  pro eo passus est sibi dicat: Hora matutina cogitatis quo amore me pro te capi, ligari a malis volui \u8230 \'85 atque que in pace sempiterna complebitur in patria. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .- 175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

