\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Epistola ad Leandrum, c. 2-5: ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 me loquente excepta sub oculis fuerant, per libros emendando composui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 utraque utitur, mei quoque labor studii ex utraque fulciatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Praefatio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Inter mvltos sepe qveritvr< quis libri beati iob scriptor habeatur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut ualeamus mentem postmodum de allegoriarum fructu sature\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Vir erat in terra Hvs, nomine< iob. Idcirco sanctus uir ubi habitauerit dicitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , ut eius meritum uirtutis exprimatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nisi qui adhuc in desideriis infirmatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit liber qvintvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. (Pars 1, li. 1: 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 2: 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 3: 42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 4: 59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 5: 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber sextvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Servata historica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ueritate beati iob dicta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quanto ex lectionis quoque intercessione respirat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Pars 2, li. 6: 110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 7: 133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 8: 154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 9: 187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 10: 219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -356\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tertia pars moralivum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Liber xi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qvamvis in pro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lixo opere esse culpabilis stili mutabilitas non debet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia magna obscuritate implicata sunt, opitulante deo latius disserantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit liber xvi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. (Pars 3, li. 11: 237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 12: 256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -277\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 13: 277\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -290\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 14: 290\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -311\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 15: 311\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -333\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 16: 333\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -356\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (356\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -404\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pars IIII. Incipit liber xvii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qvotiens in sancti viri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 historia per nouum uolumen enodare mysterium typice expositionis aggredimur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia deus cernitur; et tamen aequanda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non est requiei illius, quia non a se in alium transiit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || (Text bricht ab bei pars 4, li. 18, c. 93). (Pars 4, li. 17: 356\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -371\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 18: 371\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -404\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (405\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -408\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Transferentur rupes de loco suo; heretici rupes uocant eos quos sublimibvs in humano genere excedere sensibvs aestimant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed peccatum debet intelligi, ex quo contingit reprobos ad\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || (Textabbruch, vgl. oben die Lagenformel). (Pars 3, li. 14, c. 6-c. 17, ed. PL 75, 1043C-1050B, CC 143A, S. 701, Z. 3-S. 709, Z. 14).
