\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber viiii Decimvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Qvid mirvm< si aeterna dei sapientia conspici non ualet}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que tanto grauiore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 circumspectione pensanda sunt, quanto et per iuuentutis audaciam spiritu feruentiore proferuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Pars 4, li. 19: 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 20: 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 21: 51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 22: 64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit expositio Beati Gregorii pape In xxiii librvm Moralivm Iob\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prefationem hvivs operis quotiens necessario repeto, tociens hoc in distinctione uoluminum locutionis mee repausatione succido\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia ad concupiscendum dominum in elata cogitationum suarum turba deprehensi, adhuc siccomorum arborem non inuenerunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Pars 5, li. 23: 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 24: 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 25: 107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 26: 128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 27: 151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -334\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber xxviii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Post dampna rervm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 post funera pignorum, post uulnera corporis, post uerba male suadentis uxoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lector meus in recompensatione me superat, sicut per me uerba accipit, pro me lacrimas reddat. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Pars 6, li. 28: 173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 29: 187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 30: 209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 31: 231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -261\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 32: 261\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -279\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 33: 280\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -303\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , li. 34: 303\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -319\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb