\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Vorsatzbl. leer; 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Postilla epistolarum dominicalium}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >Postilla epistolarum dominicalium. In prima dominica aduentus domini nostri Jhesu Christi<  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Fratres, scientes quia hora est etc. Ro 13 (11). Item in epistolis quas de sancto Paulo sumit ecclesia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  premittit: fratres uel karissimi. In quo hortantur filii ecclesie ad vnitatem et caritatem et fraternitatem. Ro 12 \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 Nota distinctiones membrorum in epistolis positorum in libello qui intytulatur registrum epistolarum.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) >Dominica secunda< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Quecumque scripta sunt Ro 15 (4). Scripta in quacumque in libris sacris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  de Christo et eius aduentu sc. in lege et prophetis et in spalmis (!) et reliquis scriptis ecclesiasticis. Et non determinat apostolus cuiusmodi scripta ut intelligantur scripta canonica \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 Hec  in lectura (?) innuitur repletionis actor materia, finis et forma. Etc.(13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Hier endet der 1. Abschnitt: In 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  parte ponuntur 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 or\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  circumstantie perfecte dilectionis scil. utque in figura. Daran schlie\u223 \'dft sich (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) eine schematische Gliederung des Themas an. Es folgen: In 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  parte ponuntur circumstantie boni christiani: Schema. In 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  parte ponuntur quatuor in quibus consistit mutua communicacio. Consistit enim \u8230 \'85 Schema. Nota verus propheta seu doctor debet habere quatuor scil. Schema. Nach dieser Aufgliederung des 2. Teiles werden die Interpretationen weitergef\u252 \'fchrt. (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Mt 22 (23, 34): Ecce ego mitto ad uos sapientes et prophetas et ipsi prophetabant. At contra Jeremias 23 (21). Non mittebam \u8230 \'85 Etc. Endet (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) mit einer Meditation zur >Dominica XXIIII< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Non cessamus pro uobis orantes etc. Col. 1 (9). In presenti epistola apostolus primo proponit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  pro Colosensibus suas orationes et postulationes \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 qui dilexit nos et lauit nos a peccatis nostris. Mt 9 (6). Filius hominis habet potestatem in terra dimittendi peccata additur (?) in Christo Jhesu domino nostro etc.- 84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

