\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Expositio epistolarum in quadragesima}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Hec dicit dominus: Conuertimini etc. (Joel 2,12). In ista epistola dicens (?) primo contra transgressionem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  swadet amaritudinem penitencie. Vbi quandoque tangit sc.diuinum preceptum cum dicit: Hec dicit dominus cuius auctoritati est obediendum \u8230 \'85 et conuertimini ad dominum deum nostrum etc. (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Hic contra desperationem proponit nobis propheta magnitudinem diuine clementie \u8230 \'85- (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8230 \'85 et in temporibus quantum esset necessarium largiretur.- Endet 150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : >In vigilia pasce< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Si consurrexistis cum Christo que sursum sunt querite etc. Col 3 (1). Expositionem huius epistole quere in postilla}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  epistolarum dominicalium etc. \endash Explicit expositio epistolarum uel lectionum quadragesimalium etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

