\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dictata Domini Andreae Alciati nostri seculi Papiniani super lege \u8250 \'9bEadem\u8249 \'8b, \u167 \'a7 finali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Commentarius ad D. 45.1.4.pr.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tres questiones explicat hic Iurisconsultus: Prima est in casu harum stipulationum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , si creditor decedat relictis pluribus heredibus, quomodo vox aliquis aduersus promissionem exprimi possit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 si magis libuerit ad factum intendere, ut, quod iniuste aedificatum est, destruatur et in pristinum statum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (korr. zu \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pristinam faciem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 restituatur, idque inditorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 indiuisorum naturam habebit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glossa ad D. 45.1.4.2: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vtilitas caussa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)<. \endash  (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glossa ad D. 45.1.4.2: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Super verbo \u8250 \'9bdefensio\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Commentarius ad D. 45.1.5.pr.: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Stipulationum aliae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glossa ad D. 45.1.5.pr.: >