\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 [C]um appropinquasset (Mt 21,1) Domine Jhesu Christe qui pro nobis venisti}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  in carnem pro vnione diuine nature \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 fili Dauid nos saluificans a nobis benedicaris excelsis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 - (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) [E]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 runt signa in sole et luna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Lc 21,25). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Domine Jhesu Christe fili hominis veni in nubibus penitencie \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 cum celum anime et terra corporis mei transierunt ad te uerbum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Etc. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Am unteren Seitenrand ist jeweils des liturgische Tag vermerkt, z. B. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dominica 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  in aduentu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . etc. Endet (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ): \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Tunc manum anime mee ut resurgat a morte peccati. Amen. Et sic finiuntur moralitates ac mistificationes ewangeliorum dominicalium a fratre Alberto Magno quondam episcopo Ratisponensi.
