\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Abecedarius artis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Introductio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 Incipit abecedarius artis ad legendum quodlibet in quolibet}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  et ad doctrinandum quodlibet ex quolibet. Cuius primum capitulum tractat vtilitatem artis, summat in quodam compendio decem rerum diuinos sermones, declarat quid facies cum septem locis negociandi in triformi via: nature, artis et morum.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18\cf1 [H]ec est artis vtilitas ut eandem rem spiritualem vel corporalem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  diuersis diuersimode per diuersas res scimus exprimere \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Etc. Das Werk umfa\u223 \'dft 23 Kapitel. Endet 188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 Et ergo tytulari inscriptione tractatus iste legittime vocatur abecedarius artis ad legendum quodlibet in quolibet et ad doctrinandum quodlibet ex quolibet liber virtutum et viciorum qui hic finitur in laudem eius ex quo et in quo et per quem sunt omnia ipsi honor et gloria per infinita secula amen.-\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Die Kapitel werden in Kreisschemata zusammengefa\u223 \'dft zum Einpr\u228 \'e4gen. Zu Kap. 1 (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Loci pro multitudine facierum inuenienda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ; Kap: 2 (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec secunda figura continet ambitum sermonum dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ; zu Kap. 3 (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 /149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hec tertia figura continet vniuersas operationes mentis respectu potentiarum, actuum et obiectorum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Etc. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend an den Text steht (189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) die \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Figura legendi in deo omnia atque ex eo doctrinandi vniuersa per 12 prestantes summitates ipsorum \u8230 \'85 et captiuare oportet omne humanum ingenium.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Den Abschlu\u223 \'df des Werkes bilden (189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  und 190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) die schematische Darstellung des vierfachen Schriftsinnes: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Littera. Anagogica. Tropologia. Allegoria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .- (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit hoc opus anno 1440\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mo\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  in octaua Agnetis. Orate pro scriptore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .- 190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
