\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Bartholomaeus Pisanus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Summa de casibus conscientiae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Q<Voniam, ut ait Gregorius super Ezechielem, nullum omnipotenti deo tale sacrificium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est, quale zelus animarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia sicut homo errare possum idcirco super quibuslibet obmissis aut eciam non bene dictis postulo correctorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >A<bbas in suo monasterio conferre potest suis subditis primam tonsuram}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et duos ordines minores dummodo sacerdos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 si uero aliquis doleret de bono alterius, in quantum alter excedit ipsum in bonis, tunc est inuidia, ut dictum est supra Inuidia, \u167 \'a7 2\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Verweisung auf Nachtrag 126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Obmissa de materia hereticorum, quere in fine huius Summe folio 119, columpna 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , vbi sic \u8250 \'9bOfficium inquisitionis hereticorum\u8249 \'8b etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) mit Nachtr\u228 \'e4gen zu den Lemmata \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 magister\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , secundo, \u167 \'a7 2-3, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 maior pars\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 maledictio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Utrum liceat maledicere creature\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hec sumpta sunt de thoma, secunda secunde, q. 76\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 malefactor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 maleficium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 missa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qua hora debeat missa celebrari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de celebracione misse, capitulo vultimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 excommunicatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sexto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u167 \'a7 46\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Utrum predicatores possint passim participare excommunicatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed non ultro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Virtus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Istud non est de corpore Summe, sed additum propter bene esse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >A<ugustinus dicit in 14 libro de trinitate: Justicia est in subueniendo miseris}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , fortitudo in perferendo molestiis, prudencia in precauendis insidiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod predicte virtutes in futuro erunt, sed alios vsus tunc habebunt quam modo, cui beda consentit super exodum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Petrus Lombardus, Sententiae, li. iii, dist. 33, c. 1, ed. PL 192, 823. \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 De connexione, quia que habet unam virtutem theologicam, habet omnes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , hoc autem non sequitur de virtutibus cardinalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . [\u8230 \'85]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Respondet Jeronimus super ysaiam: Omnes virtutes sibi herent, ut qui una caruerit, una\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (expungiert\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ) careat omnibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ubi caritas est, quid est quod possit deesse? Ubi autem non est, quid est quod possit prodesse?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\u8230 \'85] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sed Augustinus dicit in epistola ad Jeronimum: Clarissima disputatione satis apparuit non placuisse auctoribus nostris, omina paria esse peccata, eciam si hoc de virtutibus intelligatur verum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Petrus Lombardus, Sententiae, li. iii, dist. 36, c. 1-2, ed. PL 192, 829. \endash  119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Schlussschrift: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Laus tibi sit christe, quoniam liber explicit iste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 M cum sciuisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u252 \'fcberschrieben mit: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .ccc. ter ut scisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quoque lvx annis dare christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 finem tunc isti nox Martini tribuisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Summe pisane que tractat singula plane\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Juris quam sane tibi discere non sit inane\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . | >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Scriptorem riuis cuius deus instrue viuis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Arnold de cliuis tuus ut valeat fore ciuis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hinc sinphonia laus gloria vera sophia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 virtus, honor que pia vobis sint virgo Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . | >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod sanctum flamen det, dicat quilibet. amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): Kopfzeile: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Paragraphus quintus super \u8250 \'9bhereticus primo\u8249 \'8b, fol. 41, columpna prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Nachtrag zu den Lemmata \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hereticus 2\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hereticus 3\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Officium inquisitionis hereticorum perdurat post mortem summi pontificis eciam quo ad negocia non incepta vel que nondum emerserant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nullus autem inquisitor potest procedere contra officialem aliquem vel nuncium romane curie ut in extrauaganti Johannis xxii, que incipit \u8250 \'9bSi fratrum\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Extravag. Io.XXII. 5.1.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ermafroditus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zu Druck und Lit. vgl. die Angaben zu Clm 3760. Diese Hs. genannt: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , GQ, S. 429, Anm. 3.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

