\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Andreae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Declaratio arboris affinitatis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ad arborem affinitatis et eius materiam transeamus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Et primo videndum est, quid sit affinitas et vnde dicatur, quomodo ipsius genera assurgant et gradus computentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in qua uniuersi fideles et precipue studentes continuo perseuerent. Per gratiam eius, qui est benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec Joannes Andree\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Arbor affinitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. Schematische Darstellung der Verwandtschaftsgrade.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
