\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur tractatus, qui dicitur formula honeste vite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >G<loriosissimo ac tranquillo (!) et insigni catholice fidei predicto (!) pietati (!) Mironi Regi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Martinus humilis episcopus salutem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tantum humane intelligencie lege eciam a laycis recte honesteque viuentibus valeant adimpleri. Explicit prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De quatuor principalibus virtutibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Q<uatuor virtutum species multorum sapientum sentenciis diffinite sunt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 aut ruentem compos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ipse deuitet insaniam aut deficientem contempnat ignauiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Schlussschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tractatus, qui dicitur formula honeste uite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 D\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u237 \'ed\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 az y D\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u237 \'ed\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 az\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nr. 27 (ohne diese Hs.). \endash  \u179 \'b3CPL 1080. \endash  CPPM 2, Nr. 3480. \endash  Druck: PL 72, 21-28D. \endash  Martini episcopi Bracarensis opera omnia. Ed. C. W. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Barlo\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 w\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . New Haven 1950 (Papers and monographs of the American Academy in Rome 12), S. 236-250. \endash  Korrekturen von A. M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kurfess\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Weitere textkritische Bemerkungen zu Martini episcopi Bracarensis opera, in: Athenaeum 33 (1955), S. 55-63, ebd. 59 f. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfi\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 eld\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Incipits, Nr. 4457 (ohne diese Hs.). \endash  Zur literarischen Abh\u228 \'e4ngigkeit zwischen der \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Formula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  und dem Werk Senecas vgl. E. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bickel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Schrift des Martinus von Bracara Formula vitae honestae, in: Rheinisches Museum f\u252 \'fcr Philologie 60 (1905), S. 505-551. \endash  G. G. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Meersseman\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Seneca maestro di spiritualit\u224 \'e0 nei suoi opuscoli apocrifi dal XII al XV secolo, in: Italia medioevale e umanistica 16 (1973), S. 43-135, ebd. S. 92-114.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

