\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u220 \'dcberschrift von der Nachtragshand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus aut Arenga de cupiditate uel avaricia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De cupiditate uel Auaricia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >S<Anctorum ecclesiam, fratres karissimi, esse dei agrum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quis dubitet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 fidelem retinens promissorem mediatorem dei et hominum christum ihesum, qui viuit et Regnat deus per omnia secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Schlussschrift: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit Tractatus Siue formula de honestate vite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. Am Rand: \u183 \'b7\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ff\u183 \'b7ivi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u183 \'b7 (= finivi) 42\u176 \'b0. Darunter von der Nachtragshand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit Arenga de cupiditate seu auaricia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: PL 89, 1277C-1292C. \endash  Lit.: J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Winandy\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , L\rquote \u339 \'9cuvre litt\u233 \'e9raire d\rquote Ambroise Autpert, in: Rev. B\u233 \'e9n. 60 (1950), S. 93-119, ebd. S. 102, Nr. 5. \endash  R. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Weber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Les sermons d\rquote Ambroise Autpert, in: Rev. B\u233 \'e9n. 86 (1976), S. 321-327. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Incipits, Nr. 5264 (ohne diese Hs.).
