\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Expositio orationis dominicae et salutationis angelicae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 N\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ota{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18  inter omnes oraciones oracio dominica et angelica salutacio radiat sicut sol inter stellas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , ideo de ipsis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 breuiter videamus dicens in ewangelio: Oportet enim semper orare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 18,1), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia oracio infinitae est uirtutis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 item in missa post eleuacionem hec oracio dicitur, ut eius singularitas super ceteras oraciones demonstretur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Expositio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >P<ater noster, qui es in celis ... (Mt 6,9), tota trinitas dicitur pater, omnipotens deus per potenciam nos creauit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , per sapienciam nos ditauit et bonitatem nos conseruauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut frequencia eius utilitatem indicet et in missa post eleuacionem, ut eius singularitas super ceteras oraciones demonstretur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Schlussschrift: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit interpretacio siue exposicio dominice oracionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \u183 \'b7\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ff\u183 \'b7iv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u183 \'b7 (= finivi) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 42\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

