\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Mateusza z Krakowa Opuscula theologica. Ed. W. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1024\fs20 Se\plain \f2\scaps\lang1024\fs20 \u324 \'f1\plain \f2\scaps\lang1024\fs20 ko\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , A. L. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1024\fs20 Szafra\plain \f2\scaps\lang1024\fs20 \u324 \'f1\plain \f2\scaps\lang1024\fs20 ski\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Warschau 1974 (Textus et studia historiam theologiae in Polonia excultae spectantia 2,1-2), Bd. 2,1, S. 248-292. \endash  S. Thomae Aquinatis opera omnia. Bd. 7: Aliorum medii aevi auctorum scripta 61. Ed. R. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Busa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Stuttgart, Bad Cannstatt 1980, S. 577-582. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire 1, S. 103, Nr. 14 fg, Bd. 2, S. 50, Nr. 305dn. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Michaud-Quantin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sommes, S. 79\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs20 Polonica w \u347 \'9credniowiecznych r\u281 \'eakopis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ach bibliotek monachijskich. Ed. J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wolny\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Markowski\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Z. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kuksewicz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Breslau, Warschau, Krakau 1969, S. 41 (diese Hs.). \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 J. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1024\fs20\cf1 T\plain \f2\scaps\lang1024\fs20\cf1 \u345 \'f8\u237 \'ed\u353 \'9a\plain \f2\scaps\lang1024\fs20\cf1 ka\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , \plain \f2\lang1024\fs20 Studie a Prameny k r\u233 \'e9torice a k universitn\u237 \'ed literatu\u345 \'f8e (De rhetorica et litteris Universitatis Pragensis. Studia et fontes 1. Pr\u225 \'e1ce z d\u283 \'ecjin university Karlovy 9). Prag 1972, S. 115 f., Nr. 17. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Distelbrink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bonaventura, S. 114 f., Nr. 92. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Incipits, Nr. 4945 (ohne diese Hs.). \endash  F.- J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Worstbrock\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , in: \u178 \'b2VL 6 (1987), Sp. 172-182, ebd. Sp. 176 f.
