\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In presenti libello continentur subnotati tractatus: Ysydorus de summo bono\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jtem formula honeste vite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jtem de duodecim gradibus abusionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jtem utilitas oracionis et exposicio dominice oracionis et angelice salutacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jtem tractatus de cognicione sui ipsius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jtem Speculum peccatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jtem tractatus de virtutibus magni alberti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jtem tractatus de viciis paleantibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 se sub speciebus virtutum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jtem tractatus utilis pro informacione christi fidelium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jtem Confessionale magistri Mathei de Crocouia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 doctoris sacre theologye\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Schlussschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sunt decem tractatus conscripti per manus fratris Wernheri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Schreibervers: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quos pater suscipe gratanter atque benigna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  | \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nam aliud nil habeo, quia pauper cum paupere christo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

