lain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , magno studio atque industria unum nobis pro quattuor euangeliis dereliquid\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 atque eos in suis propriisquae locis similia dixisse repperies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!). Ed. PL 29, 529-531). \endash  (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Additamentum ad praefationem Hieronymi: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hieronimus Damaso pape\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Sciendum etiam, neque (!) ignarum ex similitudine numerorum error inuoluat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 obto \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , ut in Christo ualeas et memineris mei, beatissimae papa.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Ed. PL 29, 529B-530C, Adn. C; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB, Nr. 601. \endash  (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sedulius Scotus, Argumentum in Matthaeum: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit argumentum secundum Matheum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >M<atheus ex iudea sic in ordine primus ponitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , ita euangelium in iudea primus scripsit: cuius uocatio ad deum ex publicanis actibus fuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et operantis dei intellegendam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 diligenter esse dispositionem querentibus non tacere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit argumentvm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. Ed. PL 103, 273A-274B; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB, Nr. 590. \endash  (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit breviarium eiusdem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 i\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 N<atiuitas Christi. Magi cum muneribus ueniunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et ioseph ab angelo per uisum admonitus cum puero et matre eius in egyptum fugit infantes interficiuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 xxviii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 assio ihesu et sepultura et resurrectio eius. Item que mandata et doctrina eius de baptismo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit Breuiarivm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. Ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 De Bruyne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sommaires, S. 270-280; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB, Nr. 11016,1. \endash  (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Isidorus Hispalensis, Etymologiae: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Canones ewangeliorum. Ammonius, alexandrie episcopus, primus excogitauit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quem postea eusebius cesariensis secutus, plenius conposuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que ex ipsis numeris indicantur per singula ewangelia de eisdem dixisse inuenies. Hec ysidorus ethimoloyarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Erkl\u228 \'e4rung zum Text, 14. Jh. Ed. PL 82, 242B-D. \endash  (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kanontafeln X-I: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Canon x in quo marcus proprie. Canon x in quo proprie Lucas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 < \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Canon I in quo IIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. Ed. PL 29, 531-542. \endash  (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Evangelium secundum Matthaeum: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Liber generationis Ihesu Christi, filii david< filii abraham}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 usque ad consummationem saeculi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit Liber sancti euangelii secundum matthevm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \endash  (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Beda Venerabilis, Homiliae subdititiae: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Moraliter hae quoque interpretationes nominum ad nostram aedificationem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  multimodis pertinere noscuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in ara cordis nostri Domino offeramus, sicut propheta dicit: Dirigatur etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Textzusatz, 9./10. Jh. Ed. PL 94, 416A-D. \endash  (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Walahfridus Strabo, Homilia in initium evangelii sancti Matthaei: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Decursis igitur generationibus Mattheus recapitulat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , dicens: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ab abraham usque ad dauid generationes iiii.x\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (Mt 1,17) ... \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et per patientiam exspectantes quousque ad promissam aeternae felicitatis patriam peruenire mereamur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Textzusatz von derselben Hand. Ed. PL 114, 859D-860B.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lit.: Nach \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Thiel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die liturgischen B\u252 \'fccher des Mittelalters, S. 2384, geh\u246 \'f6rt das vorliegende Evangeliar nach der Reihenfolge der von den Kirchenv\u228 \'e4tern Hieronymus an Papst Damasus sowie Eusebius an einen unbekannten Adressaten verfassten Briefe zur Gruppe IIA, die f\u252 \'fcr Evangeliare aus dem 8. und fr\u252 \'fchen 9. Jh. charakteristisch war.
