282-286; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ll\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 er\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB, Nr. 11016,2. \endash  (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit euangelium Marci\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Jnitium evangelii Ihesu Christi, filii Dei<}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 et sermonem confirmante, sequentibus signis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit evangelium secundum Marcum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <.
