lain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit evangelium Lucae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >Quoniam quidem mvlti conati svnt ordinare narra<tionem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et erant semper in templo laudantes et benedicentes deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit evangelium secundum Lucam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <.
