\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Beda Venerabilis, In sancti Joannis evangelium: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit breuiarium evangelii secundum iohannem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Hic est iohannes euangelista, unus ex discipulis dei}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et quaerentibus fructus laboris et deo magisterii doctrina seruetur. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Ed. PL 92, 633D-636; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB, Nr. 624. \endash  (151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Beda Venerabilis, Breviarium evangelii d. Joannis: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit breuiarius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 evangelii secundum iohannem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 i {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 PH<arisaeorum leuitae interrogant iohannem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Johannes ihesum uidens, agnum dei dicit, et andreas petro dicit: \u8250 \'9bInuenimus messiam\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 xiiii P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 assio ihesu et sepultura et resurrectio eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit breuiarium euangelii secundum iohannem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. Ed. PL 92, 635B-636C; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 De Bruyne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sommaires, S. 302-310; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB, Nr. 11016,4. \endash  (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Initium sancti euangelii secundum iohannem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >I<n principio erat uerbum et uerbum erat apud deum et deus erat uerbum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nec ipsum arbitror mundum capere eos qui scribendi sunt libros. Finit. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit evangelium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

