\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glossa marginalis: (ad Rt 1,1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rabanus. \u8250 \'9bAbiit homo\u8249 \'8b etc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Christus scilicet in bethleem iuda natus peregrinationem huius mundi uisitauit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui christi sanguine a peccati seruitute sunt liberati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB, Nr. 11788\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Vgl. Hrabanus Maurus, Commentarium in librum Ruth, PL 108, 1200D. \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Propter paucitatem spiritualium doctorum quibus iudicandi datur auctoritas, facta est fames uerbi dei, quando lex etiam per iudaicas tradiciones corrupta est.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB, Nr. 11788\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Vgl. Hrabanus Maurus, ebd. 1199D. \endash  (ad Rt 4,18) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Decem sunt generationes filii iude usque ad dauid. Unde cognoscis quia tocius diuinae intencio legis ad christum tendit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 patet ergo omnium prophetarum et patriarcharum oraculum pertinere ad dispensacionem domini nostri ihesu christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ste\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 gm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB, Nr. 11788. Vgl. Hrabanus Maurus, ebd. 1224A.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glossa interlinearis: (ad Rt 1,1) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Regione silicet diaboli, qui est princeps huius mundi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB, Nr. 11788\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ad Rt 1,2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deus meus rex. Hic est christus, cui dicitur: \u8250 \'9bIntende uoci orationis mee, rex meus et deus\u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Ps 5,3). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB, Nr. 11788\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Vgl. Hrabanus Maurus, ebd. 1201A. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pulchra. \u8250 \'9bPulchra es amica mea\u8249 \'8b etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Ct 1,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iudeam que male utebatur lege\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ad Rt 4,13) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quia christus iuncta ecclesia spiritualem generat sobolem. Unde: \u8250 \'9bDonec peperit sterilis plurimos et que multos habebat filios infirmata est\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ism 2,5). \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB, Nr. 11788. Vgl. Hrabanus Maurus, ebd. 1221A.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Bibeltext: Rt 1,1-4,22. \endash  121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
