\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 288\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -296\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1    \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Zusammenstellung kirchenrechtlicher Vorschriften
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (288\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -292\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Casus reseruati episcopis:\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Isti sunt casus sine excommunicatione maiori qui sunt episcopo reseruati< Primus tamen est sollempnis penitencia imponenda et hoc imponitur pro crimine wlgari \u8230 \'85 Item: Quis plasphemiam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  dicit deo et beate Marie et aliis sanctis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 Etc. (288\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Casus papales cum censura< Sunt casus in quibus incurrit quis excommunicationis sententiam ipso iure\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 Z\u228 \'e4hlt 12 Casus auf. \endash  (288\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Casus papales Clementinarum< 13\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  contra inquisitiones heretice prauitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (Clem. V, 3 c. 1.2) \u8230 \'85; (289\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Casus episcopales< Omnes heretici credentes receptaturos defensores et fautores \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (289\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Casus excommunicationis episcopales li\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [bri] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 VI decretalium< Contra illos qui cardinalibus existentibus in conclaui pro electione summi pontificis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 Etc.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (292\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -293\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Repetitio de celebratione missarum et de harum dicendis<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Repetimus de celebratione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  presbyteri qui est prima subparticula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de celebratione missarum \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 in sabbatis minor quum vsque ad vesperam per Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [hannem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 An\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [dream] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in Nouellis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [in Sextum]. \endash  (294\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -296\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Texte zur kirchlichen Prozessordnung und zum Appellationsverfahren: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Finitis iudiciis deliberandi partes i. e. actor et reus ad iudicium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sed potius admittuntur non propter ignorantiam doctorum sed ab imbecillitate discentis. Rubrica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (?).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

