\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 299\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -300\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1    \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannes Wissenhan: Sermo in nativitate domini. Dt.
