\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 >S<Jcut dicit beatus Johannes canonice sue primo capitulo: Si confiteamur peccata nostra}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , fidelis et iustus est Christus, ut remittat peccata nostra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Io 1,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jdcirco quasi petisti \u8250 \'9bAmen\u8249 \'8b, ut det tibi aliquam formulam in scriptis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pater misericordiarum Christus fundet nobis nostra confiteri peccata, vt ex hoc possumus incursu huius miserie graciam in gustu seu fructu eterne patrie gloriam promereri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
