\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >V<eneranda nobis dies hec est sancta, que dicitur dominica, quia ideo dominica dicitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quia dies Domini est. Omnes enim dies septimane huic diei ad seruiendum date sunt ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quid modo diuicie quid prosunt gaudia vite, dominus enim illa die liberet nos a penis inferni et perducat nos ad sanctam ciuitatem Ierusalem. Amen
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallelhs.: M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 2\u176 \'b0 Cod.ms. 120}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , f. 33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .
