\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gratia Dei in me vacua non fuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Cor 15,10). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Thema illud, dignissimis vestris reverenciis, propositum prime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Corinthios xv}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , ut pari originaliter exaratum et habetur in epistola dominice concurrentis. Reuerendi patres fratresque mei singuli in virginis filio merito honorandi, teste beato Gregorio in pastorali suo capitulo xv: Iram Dei contra se excitat, qui sine predicationis sonitu incedit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 77, 31B) ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in mee collacionum inicio, quod ut facilius acquiramus ad thronum gratie sive Mariam accedamus eique sacratissimum verbum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lucae 1\u176 \'b0 scriptum presentemus, quod Gabriel apparuit de sublimis dicendo corde puro mente serena: \u8250 \'9bAve gratia plena\u8249 \'8b.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

