\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -323\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Guilelmus Peraldus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Summa virtutum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Inhalts\u252 \'fcbersicht: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit registrum super dicendis in summa uirtutum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >P<Resens opus habet quinque partes principales}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Prima est de virtute in communi, secunda de tribus virtutibus theologicis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in duodecima parte tangitur de paciencia persecucionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prologus in summa virtutum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >C<Vm circa singula vtilia studere debeamus exemplo Salomonis dicentis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Cogitaui in corde meo abstrahere carnem meam a vino ut animam meam transferam ad sapienciam deuitaremque stulticiam, donec uiderem, quid esset vtile filiis hominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ecl 2,3) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tercio de quattuor cardinalibus virtutibus, quarto de donis, quinto de beatitudinibus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -323\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Partes I-V: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prima pars huius operis de virtutibus in communi. Capitulum i\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >S<I separaueris preciosum a uili, quasi os meum eris (Ier 15,19). Preciosum est anima }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 presentes pressure sunt debita, quibus obligauerunt parentes nostri celestem hereditatem. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (323\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Schluss-Schrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit Summa virtutum scripta per manus Voldarici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 schalhas de oberstorff Anno domini M\u176 \'b0 cccc\u176 \'b0 lxii etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  324\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -330\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zu Ed. und Lit. vgl. die Angaben zu {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 3777}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -272\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}
